omer-service.html [28]: /contact-us/corporate-procurement.html [29]: /our-products/our-medicines.html [30]: /contact-us.html [31]: https://onecode.novonordisk.com/code-of-conduct/our-purpose [32]: /sustainable-business/esg-portal.html [33]: https://novonordiskfonden.dk/en/ [34]: https://www.novonordisk.com/data-privacy-and-user-rights/social-media-privacy-disclaimer.html [35]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/novo-nordisk [36]: https://www.youtube.com/user/novonordisk [37]: https://www.facebook.com/novonordisk [38]: https://twitter.com/novonordisk [39]: https://www.instagram.com/novonordisk [40]: https://www.tiktok.com/@novonordisk [41]: /location.html [42]: /copyright.html [43]: /data-privacy-and-user-rights.html [44]: /data-privacy-and-user-rights/cookie-policy.html [45]: #", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Novo Nordisk — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Originator and marketer of multiple GLP-1 RAs (semaglutide, liraglutide). | Leading GLP-1 RA manufacturer with multiple blockbuster products | Healthcare | Denmark | Bagsværd, Denmark", "role_description": "Brand", "key_products": "Healthcare"}}, "X Score": "86", "Y Score": "86", "Overall Score": "86", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Novo Nordisk Pharma (Thailand) Ltd.", "Website": "https://www.novonordisk.co.th", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Bangkok, Thailand", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Thailand)", "Operational Presence": "Thailand", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Subsidiary of Novo Nordisk, a global leader in GLP-1 therapies, operating in the Asia Pacific region.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "TH", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Novo Nordisk Pharma (Thailand) Ltd. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Subsidiary of Novo Nordisk, a global leader in GLP-1 therapies, and markets GLP-1 products in Thailand.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "novonordisk.co.th", "data": {"company": {"name": "novonordisk.co.th"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [EN][1]\n* [TH][2]\n* [ Disease areas ][3]\n* [ Sustainable business ][4]\n* [ Patient education ][5]\n* [ Careers ][6]\n* [ About us ][7]\n* [ News & Event ][8]\n* [ Contact us ][9]\n1. [ Visit our heritage experience ][10]\n\n\n\n\n“We are proud to have been recognized as the Best Place to Work for Women for two consecutive years\nand as the Best Place to Work for four years in a row. We see these awards as a validation that we\nare on the right track, but we also acknowledge that we must continue to strive for improvement to\nbetter serve our people.\n\nDespite the challenges faced globally around employee turnover and declining engagement level, the\naverage level of engagement of the top performing companies in Thailand is 85% and this is something\nto be proud of.\"\n\n**Enrico Cañal Bruland, Vice President & General Manager for Novo Nordisk Thailand**\n\n\n[Find out for more details][11]\n\n[Find jobs you are looking for ][12]\n\n \n\n## Career Opportunities\n\n[ Dear colleague\nPlease click here to go directly to our internal career site to view all our current job openings.\n][13]\n\nHere are our current job openings. If there is not a job you are looking for, you are welcome to\ncreate a [job agent][14] or a [candidate profile.][15]\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n\nFind jobs\n\n## Novo Nordisk Pharma (Thailand) Ltd.\n\n98 Sathorn Square Office Tower, Unit 2101-2105, 2112 | 21st Floor, North Sathorn Road, Silom Bangrak\nDistrict | 10500 Bangkok\n\nPhone: +66 2 237 9263\n\nMail: [infothailand@novonordisk.com][16]\n\n## Helpful links\n* [ Contact us ][17]\n* [ Privacy notice ][18]\n\n## Follow us\n* [LinkedIn ][19]\n* [YouTube ][20]\n* [Facebook ][21]\n* [X (Twitter) ][22]\n* [Instagram ][23]\n\n## Other offices\n\n[ Select country][24]\n[ © 2026 Novo Nordisk A/S\n][25] [ Privacy policy\n][26] [ Cookie policy\n][27]\n\nchange\n\n[1]: /en.html\n[2]: /th.html\n[3]: javascript:void(0)\n[4]: javascript:void(0)\n[5]: javascript:void(0)\n[6]: javascript:void(0)\n[7]: javascript:void(0)\n[8]: /en/news---event.html\n[9]: /en/contact-us.html\n[10]: /en/about/our-heritage.html\n[11]: https://bestplacestoworkfor.org/\n[12]: /en/careers/find-a-job.html\n[13]: https://performancemanager.successfactors.eu/sf/careers?company=novonordisk\n[14]: /en/careers/job-agent.html\n[15]: https://career2.successfactors.eu/career?career_company=novonordisk&lang=en_GB&company=novonor\ndisk&site=&loginFlowRequired=true&career_job_req_id=1083&_s.crb=m7Q//WjXJ7txu/J6VxaXVNiDoAI%3D\n[16]: mailto:infothailand@novonordisk.com\n[17]: /en/contact-us.html\n[18]: /en/privacy-notice.html\n[19]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/novo-nordisk\n[20]: https://www.youtube.com/user/novonordisk\n[21]: https://www.facebook.com/novonordisk\n[22]: https://twitter.com/novonordisk\n[23]: https://www.instagram.com/novonordisk\n[24]: /en/country-list.html\n[25]: /en/copyright.html\n[26]: /en/privacy-policy.html\n[27]: /en/cookie-policy.html"}}, "page_text": "* [EN][1] * [TH][2] * [ Disease areas ][3] * [ Sustainable business ][4] * [ Patient education ][5] * [ Careers ][6] * [ About us ][7] * [ News & Event ][8] * [ Contact us ][9] 1. [ Visit our heritage experience ][10] “We are proud to have been recognized as the Best Place to Work for Women for two consecutive years and as the Best Place to Work for four years in a row. We see these awards as a validation that we are on the right track, but we also acknowledge that we must continue to strive for improvement to better serve our people. Despite the challenges faced globally around employee turnover and declining engagement level, the average level of engagement of the top performing companies in Thailand is 85% and this is something to be proud of.\" **Enrico Cañal Bruland, Vice President & General Manager for Novo Nordisk Thailand** [Find out for more details][11] [Find jobs you are looking for ][12] ## Career Opportunities [ Dear colleague Please click here to go directly to our internal career site to view all our current job openings. ][13] Here are our current job openings. If there is not a job you are looking for, you are welcome to create a [job agent][14] or a [candidate profile.][15] Find jobs ## Novo Nordisk Pharma (Thailand) Ltd. 98 Sathorn Square Office Tower, Unit 2101-2105, 2112 | 21st Floor, North Sathorn Road, Silom Bangrak District | 10500 Bangkok Phone: +66 2 237 9263 Mail: [infothailand@novonordisk.com][16] ## Helpful links * [ Contact us ][17] * [ Privacy notice ][18] ## Follow us * [LinkedIn ][19] * [YouTube ][20] * [Facebook ][21] * [X (Twitter) ][22] * [Instagram ][23] ## Other offices [ Select country][24] [ © 2026 Novo Nordisk A/S ][25] [ Privacy policy ][26] [ Cookie policy ][27] change [1]: /en.html [2]: /th.html [3]: javascript:void(0) [4]: javascript:void(0) [5]: javascript:void(0) [6]: javascript:void(0) [7]: javascript:void(0) [8]: /en/news---event.html [9]: /en/contact-us.html [10]: /en/about/our-heritage.html [11]: https://bestplacestoworkfor.org/ [12]: /en/careers/find-a-job.html [13]: https://performancemanager.successfactors.eu/sf/careers?company=novonordisk [14]: /en/careers/job-agent.html [15]: https://career2.successfactors.eu/career?career_company=novonordisk&lang=en_GB&company=novonor disk&site=&loginFlowRequired=true&career_job_req_id=1083&_s.crb=m7Q//WjXJ7txu/J6VxaXVNiDoAI%3D [16]: mailto:infothailand@novonordisk.com [17]: /en/contact-us.html [18]: /en/privacy-notice.html [19]: https://www.linkedin.c