cial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "100", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "lilly.co.uk", "data": {"company": {"name": "lilly.co.uk"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "# A medicine company that puts health\n# above all\n\n[Two girls running by a tree]\nstyle\nbackground-none\n[lilly logo]\n\n## Lilly is more than a Medicines Company.\n\nstyle\nbackground-primary-red\nadditionalPadding\nnone\n\n## CONDITION SUPPORT\n\n## Get a better understanding of a condition.\n\nHere are the conditions that we work in.\n[Learn more][1]\nstyle\nbackground-none\nadditionalPadding\nnarrow\n\n## ABOUT LILLY\n\n## Our job is to put health\n## *above all.*\n\nThroughout our history, we have focused our research efforts on understanding some of the world’s\nmost challenging health conditions, including diabetes, heart disease, infectious diseases,\nneurological disorders and cancer. This commitment continues today.\nstyle\nbackground-secondary-red\nadditionalPadding\nnarrow\n**150+**\nYears making medicine\n**100+**\nPatented medications\nstyle\nbackground-secondary-red, four-col-25-25-25-25\n[Lilly employee working on a manufacturing line]\n\n### Medicine starts with quality\n\ncard, titleone-fs-24px, description-fs-16px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab,\nctaexitinterstitial-select, ctatarget-sametab-two, ctaexitinterstitial-select-two, ctanumber-one\nFrom manufacturing through quality assurance, Lilly UK focuses on robust processes and high\nstandards as part of our day‑to‑day operations.\n[Our manufacturing process][2]\n[Glass of water on a table with a pill organiser and three loose pills]\n\n### Counterfeit medicines\n\ncard, titleone-fs-24px, description-fs-16px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab,\nctaexitinterstitial-select, ctatarget-sametab-two, ctaexitinterstitial-select-two, ctanumber-one\nFake or counterfeit medicines can be unsafe and may pose significant risks to health. We aim to\nraise awareness of these risks and provide information on reporting suspected fake or illegal\nmedicines.\n[Learn more][3]\n\n## Information on Clinical Trials\n\nDetails and results of Lilly sponsored clinical trials can be accessed via [ClinicalTrials.gov][4],\nwhere all registered trials involving human participants, including ongoing and completed studies\nare listed.\nCMAT-06462 May 2026\nstyle\nbackground-secondary-red\nadditionalPadding\nnarrow\n\n[1]: /uk/conditions\n[2]: /uk/medicines/safety/manufacturing-quality\n[3]: /uk/medicines/safety/counterfeit\n[4]: https://clinicaltrials.gov/_INTERSTITIAL_GENERAL_THIRD_PARTIES"}}, "page_text": "# A medicine company that puts health # above all [Two girls running by a tree] style background-none [lilly logo] ## Lilly is more than a Medicines Company. style background-primary-red additionalPadding none ## CONDITION SUPPORT ## Get a better understanding of a condition. Here are the conditions that we work in. [Learn more][1] style background-none additionalPadding narrow ## ABOUT LILLY ## Our job is to put health ## *above all.* Throughout our history, we have focused our research efforts on understanding some of the world’s most challenging health conditions, including diabetes, heart disease, infectious diseases, neurological disorders and cancer. This commitment continues today. style background-secondary-red additionalPadding narrow **150+** Years making medicine **100+** Patented medications style background-secondary-red, four-col-25-25-25-25 [Lilly employee working on a manufacturing line] ### Medicine starts with quality card, titleone-fs-24px, description-fs-16px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab, ctaexitinterstitial-select, ctatarget-sametab-two, ctaexitinterstitial-select-two, ctanumber-one From manufacturing through quality assurance, Lilly UK focuses on robust processes and high standards as part of our day‑to‑day operations. [Our manufacturing process][2] [Glass of water on a table with a pill organiser and three loose pills] #