g GLP-1 receptor agonist brands in the U.S. market. | United States | Plainsboro, New Jersey, USA", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "81", "Y Score": "81", "Overall Score": "81", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Eli Lilly Japan K.K.", "Website": "https://www.lilly.co.jp", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Kobe, Japan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Japan)", "Operational Presence": "Japan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Commercializes GLP-1 receptor agonists in the Japanese market.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "JP", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Eli Lilly Japan K.K. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Subsidiary of Eli Lilly, originator of tirzepatide and other GLP-1 drugs.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "lilly.co.jp", "data": {"company": {"name": "lilly.co.jp"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n* 採用情報\n* お問い合わせ\n* [ Globe ]\nメニュー [ Menu ]\nMenu closed\n閉じる [ Close ]\n* 会社情報\n  [ Expand mega menu ]\n  [ Expand submenu ]\n  [ 戻る ] 会社情報\n  会社概要\n  [ Expand ]\n  * イーライリリー・アンド・カンパニーについて\n  * 日本イーライリリーについて\n  * 社長メッセージ\n  * 日本イーライリリーのあゆみ\n  * 主な事業所\n  * 表彰実績\n  ポリシー＆レポート\n  [ Expand ]\n  * 企業活動と医療機関等の関係の透明性に関する方針\n  * 企業活動と患者団体の関係の透明性に関する方針\n  * 患者団体との協働に関する基本指針\n  * マルチステークホルダー方針\n* 研究開発\n  [ Expand mega menu ]\n  [ Expand submenu ]\n  [ 戻る ] 研究開発\n  革新的医薬品の開発\n  [ Expand ]\n  * 研究と科学的開発\n  * 開発中の新薬\n  * 研究開発におけるリリーとの提携\n  リリーの臨床試験\n  [ Expand ]\n  * リリーの臨床試験・方針について\n  * リリートライアルガイド（参加可能な日本での臨床試験）\n  * 実施中の臨床試験に関する情報\n  リリーの研究疾患領域\n  [ Expand ]\n  * 糖尿病\n  * がん\n  * 自己免疫疾患\n  * 疼痛\n  * 神経変性疾患\n* 製品情報\n  [ Expand mega menu ]\n  [ Expand submenu ]\n  [ 戻る ] 製品情報\n  患者さんとご家族の皆様\n  [ Expand ]\n  * くすりの情報\n  * 患者さんの安全への取り組み\n  * 副作用が発生したら\n  * 偽造防止への取り組み\n  * 当社製品の適正使用に関する取り組み\n  お役立ち情報\n  [ Expand ]\n  * 糖尿病\n  * 肥満症\n  * 関節リウマチ\n  * 乾癬\n  * アトピー性皮膚炎\n  * アルツハイマー病\n  * 片頭痛\n  医療関係者の皆様\n  [ Expand ]\n  * リリーメディカル（製品情報など）\n* ソーシャルインパクト\n  [ Expand mega menu ]\n  [ Expand submenu ]\n  [ 戻る ] ソーシャルインパクト\n  さらなる貢献へ\n  [ Expand ]\n  * ソーシャルインパクト概要\n  * リリー財団\n  * リリー教育・研究助成事務局\n  * リリーが支援するアワード\n  サステナビリティと社会的責任\n  [ Expand ]\n  * ヘルスケアシステムの改善\n  * QOLやコミュニティへの貢献\n  * 多様な社員の能力を活かす\n  * 自然環境への負荷軽減\n  * 倫理と責任を伴った事業運営\n  取り組み紹介\n  [ Expand ]\n  * 患者さんとご家族に寄り添う\n  * コミュニティへの貢献\n  * ヤングケアラーを取り巻く環境改善に向けて\n  * インクルージョンの推進\n  * 社員の健康\n  * ヘルスケア・イノベーションフォーラム\n* ニュース\n  [ Expand mega menu ]\n  [ Expand submenu ]\n  [ 戻る ] ニュース\n  患者さんとご家族に寄り添う（肥満症、糖尿病、認知症）\n  [ Expand ]\n  * 肥満症：線画アニメーションで描く、肥満症のストーリー\n  * 肥満症：肥満と肥満症のただしいミカタ研修\n  * 糖尿病：リリー インスリン50年賞\n  * 認知症：認知症との新しい関係\n  * 認知症：認知症の当事者動画\n  患者さんとご家族に寄り添う（がん、自己免疫疾患、片頭痛）\n  [ Expand ]\n  * がん：「日々をつなぐ」、再発乳がんのショートフィルム\n  * がん：乳がん患者さんのものがたり\n  * がん：リリー・オンコロジー・オン・キャンバス\n  * 自己免疫疾患：円形脱毛症と向き合うプロジェクト\n  * 自己免疫疾患：乾癬の患者さんと先生の物語\n  * 片頭痛：ヘンズツウかるた\n  報道関係者の皆様\n  [ Expand ]\n  * プレスリリース\n* [ Search ]\n* 採用情報\n* お問い合わせ\n* [ Globe ]\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nこの度の「令和8年熊本地震」により被害にあわれた皆様に心よりお見舞い申し上げますとともに、被災地の皆 \n様の安全と一日も早い復旧・復興をお祈り申し上げます。                                                \n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n**マンジャロに関する昨今の報道について**                                                            \nマンジャロは日本で2型糖尿病治療薬として承認された処方箋医薬品であり、医師の管理・指導のもとでのみ使 \n用が許可されている薬剤です。                                                                        \n美容目的など２型糖尿病以外の方に使用された場合の安全性は医学的に確認されておらず、深刻な健康被害につ\nながる恐れがあります。また、無許可での売買・転売は法令違反にあたります。当社はこうした不適切な使用を\n容認せず、関係当局・警察等と連携しながら適正使用の推進に取り組み、患者さんへ適切に医薬品が届くよう努\nめてまいります。                                                                                    \nなお、肥満症治療においては、肥満症治療薬として承認された薬剤を、医師の管理・指導のもとでご使用いただ\nきますようお願いいたします。                                                                        \n[当社製品の適正使用に関する取り組みについて][2]                                                     \n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n# OUR PURPOSE（使命）\n\n日本イーライリリーは、「世界中の人々のより豊かな人生のため、革新的医薬品に思いやりを込めて」医薬品の\n開発・製造・販売などに取り組んでいます\n\n## NEWS\n\n[ ]\n\n### ニュース\n\n[\n\n会社情報を更新\n\n][3]\n[ ]\n\n### ニュース\n\n[\n\n線画アニメーションで描く、肥満症のストーリーを更新\n\n][4]\n[Entrance of Kobe Headquarters]\n\n\n[\n\n日本イーライリリーについて\n\n][5]\n[実験に当たっている 2 人の科学者]\n\n\n[\n\n革新的な医薬品の開発\n\n][6]\n[オープンスペースで会議をする様々な背景を持った社員たち]\n\n\n[\n\nインクルージョンの推進\n\n][7]\n[人々のQOLやコミュニティへの貢献（ニュース用）]\n\n\n[\n\n患者さんとご家族、地域社会への貢献\n\n][8]\n[タイピングする医療従事者（ニュース用）]\n\n\n[\n\nリリー教育・研究助成事務局\n\n][9]\n[会議中の社員3人]\n\n\n[\n\n採用情報\n\n][10]\n\n* [ インクルージョンの推進 ][11]\n* [ お問い合わせ ][12]\n* [ 取引先向け情報 ][13]\n* [ 利用規約 ][14]\n* [ 個人情報の保護について ][15]\n* [ アクセシビリティに関して ][16]\n* [ サイトマップ ][17]\n\nCopyright © 2026 Eli Lilly Japan K.K. All rights reserved.\nPP-MG-JP-2880\n当サイトは、18歳未満の方向けに制作されたサイトではございません。\n\n[[ Facebook ]][18]\n[ 利用規約 ][19][ 個人情報の保護について ][20][ アクセシビリティに関して ][21][ サイトマップ ][22]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: patients-families/appropriate_use\n[3]: who-we-are/lilly-japan-overview\n[4]"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] * 採用情報 * お問い合わせ * [ Globe ] メニュー [ Menu ] Menu closed 閉じる [ Close ] * 会社情報 [ Expand mega menu ] [ Expand submenu ] [ 戻る ] 会社情報 会社概要 [ Expand ] * イーライリリー・アンド・カンパニーについて * 日本イーライリリーについて * 社長メッセージ * 日本イーライリリーのあゆみ * 主な事業所 * 表彰実績 ポリシー＆レポート [ Expand ] * 企業活動と医療機関等の関係の透明性に関する方針 * 企業活動と患者団体の関係の透明性に関する方針 * 患者団体との協働に関する基本指針 * マルチステークホルダー方針 * 研究開発 [ Expand mega menu ] [ Expand submenu ] [ 戻る ] 研究開発 革新的医薬品の開発 [ Expand ] * 研究と科学的開発 * 開発中の新薬 * 研究開発におけるリリーとの提携 リリーの臨床試験 [ Expand ] * リリーの臨床試験・方針について * リリートライアルガイド（参加可能な日本での臨床試験） * 実施中の臨床試験に関する情報 リリーの研究疾患領域 [ Expand ] * 糖尿病 * がん * 自己免疫疾患 * 疼痛 * 神経変性疾患 * 製品情報 [ Expand mega menu ] [ Expand submenu ] [ 戻る ] 製品情報 患者さんとご家族の皆様 [ Expand ] * くすりの情報 * 患者さんの安全への取り組み * 副作用が発生したら * 偽造防止への取り組み * 当社製品の適正使用に関する取り組み お役立ち情報 [ Expand ] * 糖尿病 * 肥満症 * 関節リウマチ * 乾癬 * アトピー性皮膚炎 * アルツハイマー病 * 片頭痛 医療関係者の皆様 [ Expand ] * リリーメディカル（製品情報など） * ソーシャルインパクト [ Expand mega menu ] [ Expand submenu ] [ 戻る ] ソーシャルインパクト さらなる貢献へ [ Expand ] * ソーシャルインパクト概要 * リリー財団 * リリー教育・研究助成事務局 * リリーが支援するアワード サステナビリティと社会的責任 [ Expand ] * ヘルスケアシステムの改善 * QOLやコミュニティへの貢献 * 多様な社員の能力を活かす * 自然環境への負荷軽減 * 倫理と責任を伴った事業運営 取り組み紹介 [ Expand ] * 患者さんとご家族に寄り添う * コミュニティへの貢献 * ヤングケアラーを取り巻く環境改善に向けて * インクルージョンの推進 * 社員の健康 * ヘルスケア・イノベーションフォーラム * ニュース [ Expand mega menu ] [ Expand submenu ] [ 戻る ] ニュース 患者さんとご家族に寄り添う（肥満症、糖尿病、認知症） [ Expand ] * 肥満症：線画アニメーションで描く、肥満症のストーリー * 肥満症：肥満と肥満症のただしいミカタ研修 * 糖尿病：リリー インスリン50年賞 * 認知症：認知症との新しい関係 * 認知症：認知症の当事者動画 患者さんとご家族に寄り添う（がん、自己免疫疾患、片頭痛） [ Expand ] * がん：「日々をつなぐ」、再発乳がんのショートフィルム * がん：乳がん患者さんのものがたり * がん：リリー・オンコロジー・オン・キャンバス * 自己免疫疾患：円形脱毛症と向き合うプロジェクト * 自己免疫疾患：乾癬の患者さんと先生の物語 * 片頭痛：ヘンズツウかるた 報道関係者の皆様 [ Expand ] * プレスリリース * [ Search ] * 採用情報 * お問い合わせ * [ Globe ] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── この度の「令和8年熊本地震」により被害にあわれた皆様に心よりお見舞い申し上げますとともに、被災地の皆 様の安全と一日も早い復旧・復興をお祈り申し上げます。 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── **マンジャロに関する昨今の報道について** マンジャロは日本で2型糖尿病治療薬として承認された処方箋医薬品であり、医師の管理・指導のもとでのみ使 用が許可されている薬剤です。 美容目的など２型糖尿病以外の方に使用された場合の安全性は医学的に確認されておらず、深刻な健康被害につ ながる恐れがあります。また、無許可での売買・転売は法令違反にあたります。当社はこうした不適切な使用を 容認せず、関係当局・警察等と連携しながら適正使用の推進に取り組み、患者さんへ適切に医薬品が届くよう努 めてまいります。 なお、肥満症治療においては、肥満症治療薬として承認された薬剤を、医師の管理・指導のもとでご使用いただ きますようお願いいたします。 [当社製品の適正使用に関する取り組みについて][2] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── # OUR PURPOSE（使命） 日本イーライリリーは、「世界中の人々のより豊かな人生のため、革新的医薬品に思いやりを込めて」医薬品の 開発・製造・販売などに取り組んでいます ## NEWS [ ] ### ニュース [ 会社情報を更新 ][3] [ ] ### ニュース [ 線画アニメーションで描く、肥満症のストーリーを更新 ][4] [Entrance of Kobe Headquarters] [ 日本イーライリリーについて ][5] [実験に当たっている 2 人の科学者] [ 革新的な医薬品の開発 ][6] [オープンスペースで会議をする様々な背景を持った社員たち] [ インクルージョンの推進 ][7] [人々のQOLやコミュニティへの貢献（ニュース用）] [ 患者さんとご家族、地域社会への貢献 ][8] [タイピングする医療従事者（ニュース用）] [ リリー教育・研究助成事務局 ][9] [会議中の社員3人] [ 採用情報 ][10] * [ インクルージョンの推進 ][11] * [ お問い合わせ ][12] * [ 取引先向け情報 ][13] * [ 利用規約 ][14] * [ 個人情報の保護について ][15] * [ アクセシビリティに関して ][16] * [ サイトマップ ][17] Copyright © 2026 Eli Lilly Japan K.K. All rights reserved. PP-MG-JP-2880 当サイトは、18歳未満の方向けに制作されたサイトではございません。 [[ Facebook ]][18] [ 利用規約 ][19][ 個人情報の保護について ][20][ アクセシビリティに関して ][21][ サイトマップ ][22] [1]: #main [2]: patients-families/appropriate_use [3]: who-we-are/lilly-japan-overview [4]: news/stories/obesity-senga [5]: who-we-are/lilly-japan-overview [6]: discovery/research-scientific-discovery [7]: operating-responsibly/diversity-inclusion [8]: social-impact/communities [9]: extending-our-impact/lilly-grant-office [10]: careers [11]: operating-responsibly/diversity-inclusion [12]: contact-us [13]: suppliers [14]: terms-of-use [15]: privacy [16]: accessibility [17]: sitemap [18]: https://www.facebook.com/elilillyjapan [19]: terms-of-use [20]: privacy [21]: accessibility [22]: sitemap", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Eli Lilly Japan K.K. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Subsidiary of Eli Lilly, originator of tirzepatide and other GLP-1 drugs. | Commercializes GLP-1 receptor agonists in the Japanese market. | Japan | Kobe, Japan", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "82", "Y Score": "79", "Overall Score": "80", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Eli Lilly Canada Inc.", "Website": "https://www.lilly.ca", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Indiana, United, States", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Key GLP-1 products for type 2 diabetes and weight management.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Eli Lilly Canada Inc. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Eli Lilly is a leading originator of GLP-1 brands; the Canadian subsidiary markets these brands.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "lilly.ca", "data": {"company": {"name": "lilly.ca"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "# A medicine company\n# that puts health\n# above all\n\ntrue\n[A photograph of two young children playing on a hillside at golden hour with a scenic landscape\nbehind them]\n[https://delivery-p137454-e1438138.adobeaemcloud.com/adobe/assets/urn:aaid:aem:2b1168e1-3707-436a-ab\n96-90ab2ea498c6/play?assetname=Lilly+Hero+Video+50s.mp4][1]\nstyle\nbackground-none\n[Lilly logo]\n\n## A medicine company should do\n## more *than just make\n## medicine.*\n\n[heart in hand]\n\n### Find Care\n\ntile, title-fs-32px, description-fs-20px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab,\nctaexitinterstitial-select\nGet in touch with an independent doctor who understands your condition.\n[Get started][2]\n[First aid]\n\n### Join a Clinical Trial\n\ntile, title-fs-32px, description-fs-20px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab,\nctaexitinterstitial-select\nClinical trials need patients to help medicine get better.\n[View Trials][3]\nstyle\nbackground-primary-red\nadditionalPadding\nnarrow\nCONDITION SUPPORT\n\n## Get a better\n## understanding of a\n## condition.\n\nOne of the healthiest actions a patient or a loved one can take is getting informed about a\ncondition. Part\nof our job is getting you the information you need, to help make the best decisions for health.\nSelect a condition below to learn more.\n\n### Cancer\n\nmedium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link\n[Woman with cancer wearing a headwrap and staring out a sunny window]\n[Explore Condition][4]\n\n### Dermatology\n\nmedium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link\n[Woman drying her face after showering]\n[Explore Condition][5]\n\n### Autoimmune\n\nmedium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link\n[Woman looking into the camera during sunset]\n[Explore Condition][6]\n\n### Diabetes\n\nmedium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link\n[Woman jogging]\n[Explore Condition][7]\n\n### Obesity\n\nmedium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link\n[Overweight man singing into a microphone at a bar]\n[Explore Condition][8]\n\n### Alzheimer's Disease\n\nmedium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link\n[Older couple sitting on a living room couch as the woman looks at the man as he laughs]\n[Explore Condition][9]\nstyle\nbackground-none\nadditionalPadding\nnone\n\n## Making medicine for those\n## who need it.\n\nFor 150 years, we have worked tirelessly to\ndevelop and deliver trusted medicines and\ndiagnostics that meet real needs.\nfalse\n[A photograph of a young Black woman with natural hair against a warm, blurred outdoor background]\n[View medicines][10]\nstyle\nbackground-none\nTESTIMONIALS\n\n## Patient stories\n\nLiving with a chronic disease like obesity can be isolating, but you aren’t alone. Hear from Liz\nabout their experiences living with this disease.\nstyle\nbackground-primary-red\nadditionalPadding\nnarrow\n\n[Liz story]\n\n**00:00-00:03**\n[The Lilly logo appears on screen in red text on a white background]\n**00:03-00:08**\n[The screen fades to black and transitions to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.]\nLiz: I was put on my first diet that I was aware of in sixth grade.\n**00:08-00:19**\n[The video cuts to two photographs of Liz in France as an exchange student.]\nLiz: I was going to France as an exchange student and my mom said, “Hey, if you lose X amount of\nweight, you can earn your pocket money while you're there.”\n**00:19-00:23**\n[The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.]\nLiz: It was very confusing, and it was very shameful.\n**00:23-00:37**\n[The video cuts to multiple photographs of Liz as a child. Liz is smiling in the photographs,\nplaying soccer, and dressed in a Halloween costume.]\nLiz: It wasn't for not being an active kid, I played soccer. I spent my days riding bikes around the\nneighborhood. I did everything that my sister did or friends did, and I was the only one who had a\nproblem.\n**00:37-00:48**\n[The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.]\n"}}, "page_text": "# A medicine company # that puts health # above all true [A photograph of two young children playing on a hillside at golden hour with a scenic landscape behind them] [https://delivery-p137454-e1438138.adobeaemcloud.com/adobe/assets/urn:aaid:aem:2b1168e1-3707-436a-ab 96-90ab2ea498c6/play?assetname=Lilly+Hero+Video+50s.mp4][1] style background-none [Lilly logo] ## A medicine company should do ## more *than just make ## medicine.* [heart in hand] ### Find Care tile, title-fs-32px, description-fs-20px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab, ctaexitinterstitial-select Get in touch with an independent doctor who understands your condition. [Get started][2] [First aid] ### Join a Clinical Trial tile, title-fs-32px, description-fs-20px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab, ctaexitinterstitial-select Clinical trials need patients to help medicine get better. [View Trials][3] style background-primary-red additionalPadding narrow CONDITION SUPPORT ## Get a better ## understanding of a ## condition. One of the healthiest actions a patient or a loved one can take is getting informed about a condition. Part of our job is getting you the information you need, to help make the best decisions for health. Select a condition below to learn more. ### Cancer medium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link [Woman with cancer wearing a headwrap and staring out a sunny window] [Explore Condition][4] ### Dermatology medium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link [Woman drying her face after showering] [Explore Condition][5] ### Autoimmune medium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link [Woman looking into the camera during sunset] [Explore Condition][6] ### Diabetes medium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link [Woman jogging] [Explore Condition][7] ### Obesity medium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link [Overweight man singing into a microphone at a bar] [Explore Condition][8] ### Alzheimer's Disease medium-media-carousel-item, title-fs-60px, textcolor-white, ctaselection-link [Older couple sitting on a living room couch as the woman looks at the man as he laughs] [Explore Condition][9] style background-none additionalPadding none ## Making medicine for those ## who need it. For 150 years, we have worked tirelessly to develop and deliver trusted medicines and diagnostics that meet real needs. false [A photograph of a young Black woman with natural hair against a warm, blurred outdoor background] [View medicines][10] style background-none TESTIMONIALS ## Patient stories Living with a chronic disease like obesity can be isolating, but you aren’t alone. Hear from Liz about their experiences living with this disease. style background-primary-red additionalPadding narrow [Liz story] **00:00-00:03** [The Lilly logo appears on screen in red text on a white background] **00:03-00:08** [The screen fades to black and transitions to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: I was put on my first diet that I was aware of in sixth grade. **00:08-00:19** [The video cuts to two photographs of Liz in France as an exchange student.] Liz: I was going to France as an exchange student and my mom said, “Hey, if you lose X amount of weight, you can earn your pocket money while you're there.” **00:19-00:23** [The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: It was very confusing, and it was very shameful. **00:23-00:37** [The video cuts to multiple photographs of Liz as a child. Liz is smiling in the photographs, playing soccer, and dressed in a Halloween costume.] Liz: It wasn't for not being an active kid, I played soccer. I spent my days riding bikes around the neighborhood. I did everything that my sister did or friends did, and I was the only one who had a problem. **00:37-00:48** [The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: That was the first experience with, “Oh, this is something society says, isn't quite right.” My name is Liz Paul, and I live with obesity. **00:48-01:07** [As Liz is sitting in a chair talking to the camera, the caption “Liz’s Story” appears on screen. The screen fades to black and fades back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: We've been conditioned to say that people who live in larger bodies are lazy, eating too much, they don't exercise. We're given all of these stereotypes. It's just not true. **01:07-01:16** [The video cuts to Liz walking into her office and using a laptop at a desk, then cuts to an image of her with her daughter’s Cub Scout Pack. Liz: I'm busy from the moment I get up till the time my kids go to bed. I'm the Cubmaster for my daughter's Cub Scout pack. **01:16-01:44** [The video cuts to Liz giving a speech at the Mankato Kiwanis Club and sitting at a table listening to other’s give a speech. The video then cuts to Liz playing a trumpet in a church, and cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera. Liz: I am the president of the Mankato Kiwanis Club, which does service projects around town. I play trumpet in church. When you live in a larger body, you kind of want to hide yourself, but playing trumpet is something that people enjoy, and it's a chance to say, “Look, I can do something. I'm useful.” Doctors told me that I was the only one who was ever going to fix me, and had nothing but shame and blame for me. **01:44-01:56** [The video cuts to photographs of Liz doing CrossFit, running a 5K, her on her wedding day, and photographs of her in a mirror. The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: I have done CrossFit. I have done 5Ks. I have gained and lost hundreds of pounds over my adult life. I would say my most successful was after my son was born. **01:56-02:31** [The video cuts to Liz and her son sitting on a boulder. The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: I lost 80, 100 pounds, and it was great and I felt really good. And then it stopped working. The actual disease of obesity came back to really bite me. I had lost this weight, but it kept creeping back on, and on, and up. And I said, “Well, apparently I can't do this. Apparently I'm just a failure. I will always be living in a larger body,” and kind of gave in to the depression of it all. **02:31-02:52** [The video cuts to Liz at the Obesity Action Coalition. The shots include the schedule for the convention, multiple people giving presentations and participating in panels, and Liz watching a presentation. The video then cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: Around this time, I was invited to the Obesity Action Coalition, their “Your Weight Matters” Convention. Here were experts in the field who said obesity is a chronic, complex disease that can't be cured just by eating less and moving more. And I'm like, “What is this, and why am I just hearing about this now?” **02:52-03:03** [The video cuts to two people having a conversation at the Obesity Action Coalition while Liz is looking at pamphlets on a table, the three of them begin to have a conversation. The video then cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera.] Liz: People who live with obesity deserve access to care, bias-free, stigma-free treatments to help them manage their disease. **03:03-03:39** [The video cuts to Liz walking outside in a park. The video cuts back to Liz sitting in a chair talking to the camera, and then cuts back to Liz walking outside in the park while looking at the camera.] Liz: I'm always trying to lose weight and make good choices and try to move my body every day. I try to eat right. I do as much as I can. I don't like to limit myself, but sometimes my body pays for it. Hopefully one day we'll find the tool or the treatment or anything that'll stick. But I know this will be something I'll be living with my whole life, regardless of whether I have lost weight or not. It's hard to to not be a little bit afraid of all of that. I want to see my kids grow up. I want to be there with them, which is why I never stop trying to lose weight. **03:39-03:43** [The video fades to white as the Lilly logo appears in red text on the white background.] video-item, video-quote, title-fs-48px, description-fs-24px, quote-fs-48px, patientname-fs-20px, condition-fs-14px, ctastyle-primary, transcript-fs-20px ## Nour’s Journey Nour shares the impact Ulcerative Colitis has had on her life and how she has been shaped by the struggles and triumphs of managing a chronic condition. true People who live in larger bodies are lazy, eating too much. They don’t exercise. We’re given all of these stereotypes. It’s just not true. **Liz's story** Navigating obesity [Watch patient story][11] Video Transcript style background-primary-red additionalPadding none ## ABOUT LILLY ## Our job is to put health ## *above all.* Our research focuses on developing life-changing medicines for everyone, regardless of their condition’s popularity or complexity. And we know our biggest advancements are still ahead of us. **145+** numeric-tile, title-fs-60px, description-fs-24px ### Years making medicine **100+** numeric-tile, title-fs-60px, description-fs-24px ### Patented medications **2** numeric-tile, title-fs-60px, description-fs-24px ### Nobel Prizes for medicine style background-secondary-red additionalPadding narrow [A photograph of a worker in a hairnet and gloves carefully handling components on a manufacturing line] ### Medicine starts with safety card, titleone-fs-24px, description-fs-16px, ctaselection-link, ctanumber-one Thousands of employees work every day to make sure Lilly medicine is made consistently and with the highest quality. Manufacturing and quality are some of the most important parts of our process. [Examine our process][12] [A photograph of a pill organizer and a glass of water on a wooden surface, seen from overhead] ### Protect yourself from counterfeits card, titleone-fs-24px, description-fs-16px, ctaselection-link, ctanumber-one We give you the information you need to protect yourself against counterfeit, fake and unsafe or untested products. If you have any doubts, we can help you confirm if the product you have is a genuine Lilly medicine. [How to spot counterfeits][13] [Woman siting on a bed] ### Medicine made for every body card, titleone-fs-28px, description-fs-20px, ctaselection-link, ctatarget-sametab, ctaexitinterstitial-select, ctanumber-one We may one day be able to make medicine that’s tailored to an individual’s biology using new treatments made from their own genetic code. See what research is making possible. [What is genetic medicine][14] PP-LLY-CA-0043 04/2026 [© 2026, Eli Lilly and Company. All rights reserved][15]. style background-secondary-red [1]: https://delivery-p137454-e1438138.adobeaemcloud.com/adobe/assets/urn:aaid:aem:2b1168e1-3707-436 a-ab96-90ab2ea498c6/play?assetname=Lilly+Hero+Video+50s.mp4 [2]: /en-ca/find-care [3]: /en-ca/science/clinical-trials [4]: /en-ca/conditions/cancer [5]: /en-ca/conditions/dermatology [6]: /en-ca/conditions/autoimmune [7]: /en-ca/conditions/diabetes [8]: /en-ca/conditions/obesity [9]: /en-ca/conditions/alzheimers-disease [10]: /en-ca/medicines/current [11]: https://delivery-p137454-e1438138.adobeaemcloud.com/adobe/assets/urn:aaid:aem:ba03f5a9-068f-4f 6b-8105-3c164296e2b4/play?assetname=LIZ+FINAL+LONG+FORM.mp4 [12]: /en-ca/medicines/safety/manufacturing-quality [13]: /en-ca/medicines/safety/counterfeit [14]: /en-ca/science/research-development/genetic-medicines [15]: https://www.lillyhub.com/legal/lillycanada/copyright_en.html_NEW_TAB", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Eli Lilly Canada Inc. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Eli Lilly is a leading originator of GLP-1 brands; the Canadian subsidiary markets these brands. | Key GLP-1 products for type 2 diabetes and weight management. | Canada | Indiana, United, States", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "79", "Y Score": "77", "Overall Score": "78", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Novo Nordisk South Africa", "Website": "https://www.novonordisk.co.za", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Sandton, South Africa", "Continent / Geography": "AF(South Africa)", "Operational Presence": "South Africa", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Novo Nordisk is a global leader in GLP-1 receptor agonists, and its South African affiliate markets products like Ozempic and Victoza in the region.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Novo Nordisk South Africa — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Affiliate of Novo Nordisk, markets GLP-1 products like Ozempic and Victoza in South Africa.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "X Score": "78", "Y Score": "78", "Overall Score": "78", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Eli Lilly South Africa", "Website": "https://www.lilly.co.za", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Bryanston, Johannesburg, South Africa", "Continent / Geography": "AF(South Africa)", "Operational Presence": "South Africa", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Eli Lilly markets Trulicity and other GLP-1 receptor agonists in South Africa through its local affiliate.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Eli Lilly South Africa — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Affiliate of Eli Lilly, markets GLP-1 products like Trulicity in South Africa.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "X Score": "76", "Y Score": "75", "Overall Score": "76", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Pfizer South Africa", "Website": "https://www.pfizer.co.za", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Johannesburg, South Africa", "Continent / Geography": "AF(South Africa)", "Operational Presence": "South Africa", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Pfizer has a presence in South Africa and may market GLP-1 receptor agonists in the region.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Pfizer South Africa — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Pfizer has GLP-1 pipeline and market presence, owning brands.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "pfizer.co.za", "data": {"company": {"name": "pfizer.co.za"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Contact UsPrivacy StatementTerms of UseContact Us\nBreakthroughs That Change Patients' LivesCategory Biotechnology is our foundation. Lorem ipsum dolor\nsit amet. Explore Our Science\n* Oncology\n* Inflammation & Immunology\n* Vaccines\n* Rare Disease\nPfizer South Africa\n\nAt Pfizer, we apply science and our global resources to bring therapies to people that extend and\nsignificantly improve their lives. We strive to set the standard for quality, safety and value in\nthe discovery, development and manufacture of health care products, including innovative medicines\nand vaccines. Every day, Pfizer colleagues work across developed and emerging markets to advance\nwellness, prevention, treatments and cures that challenge the most feared diseases of our time.\nConsistent with our responsibility as one of the world's premier innovative companies, we\ncollaborate with health care providers, governments and local communities to support and expand\naccess to reliable, affordable health care around the world. For more than 150 years, we have worked\nto make a difference for all who rely on us.\n\nFrom our sub-Saharan Africa headquarters located in Johannesburg, South Africa, for more than 70\nyears, Pfizer has been delivering life-changing breakthroughs to the people of South Africa. Guided\nby our three pillars of innovation, investing and safeguarding, we work with Healthcare\nPractitioners, Policy Makers, Patient Groups and other members of civil society to serve the\ncommunities in which we live and work, broadening access to medicines and strengthening healthcare\ndelivery for the people who need it most.\n\nLiving our values of courage, excellence, equity and joy, we are a diverse team of about 250 people\nworking daily to provide all South Africans with access to global scientific innovation that can\nhelp them to live longer, better lives. Through our commitment to the national agenda, we are\ncontributing to the development of a strong healthcare system, as well as growth of the knowledge\neconomy in the interest of those who need to be empowered today and to the benefit of the\ngenerations to come.\n\nJoin the pfizer team\n\n#### Careers\n\nStep inside the world of Pfizer and you’ll discover that every single person who works here plays an\nessential part in making breakthroughs that change patients’ lives.Learn More\n[Home ][1][About Us][2][News][3][Careers ][4][Contact ][5][Pfizer Global][6][Terms of\nuse][7][Privacy Policy][8][Disclaimer ][9][PAIA ][10]Pfizer Laboratories (Pty) Ltd. Company Reg. No.\n1954/000781/07. Building 2, 1st Floor, Maxwell Office Park, Magwa Crescent, Waterfall City,\nMidrand, Johannesburg, South Africa. Tel. No: 0860 PFIZER (734937).\nCopyright © 2025. Pfizer Laboratories (Pty) Ltd. All rights reserved\n[Contact Us][11][Privacy Policy][12][PAIA][13][Terms of use][14]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about\n[3]: /news\n[4]: /careers\n[5]: /contact\n[6]: https://www.pfizer.com/\n[7]: /terms\n[8]: /privacy\n[9]: /disclaimer\n[10]: https://www.pfizer.co.za/files/Pfizer-PAIA-Manual.pdf\n[11]: /contact\n[12]: /privacy\n[13]: /files/PHA259-PAIA-Manual.pdf\n[14]: /terms"}}, "page_text": "Contact UsPrivacy StatementTerms of UseContact Us Breakthroughs That Change Patients' LivesCategory Biotechnology is our foundation. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet. Explore Our Science * Oncology * Inflammation & Immunology * Vaccines * Rare Disease Pfizer South Africa At Pfizer, we apply science and our global resources to bring therapies to people that extend and significantly improve their lives. We strive to set the standard for quality, safety and value in the discovery, development and manufacture of health care products, including innovative medicines and vaccines. Every day, Pfizer colleagues work across developed and emerging markets to advance wellness, prevention, treatments and cures that challenge the most feared diseases of our time. Consistent with our responsibility as one of the world's premier innovative companies, we collaborate with health care providers, governments and local communities to support and expand access to reliable, affordable health care around the world. For more than 150 years, we have worked to make a difference for all who rely on us. From our sub-Saharan Africa headquarters located in Johannesburg, South Africa, for more than 70 years, Pfizer has been delivering life-changing breakthroughs to the people of South Africa. Guided by our three pillars of innovation, investing and safeguarding, we work with Healthcare Practitioners, Policy Makers, Patient Groups and other members of civil society to serve the communities in which we live and work, broadening access to medicines and strengthening healthcare delivery for the people who need it most. Living our values of courage, excellence, equity and joy, we are a diverse team of about 250 people working daily to provide all South Africans with access to global scientific innovation that can help them to live longer, better lives. Through our commitment to the national agenda, we are contributing to the development of a strong healthcare system, as well as growth of the knowledge economy in the interest of those who need to be empowered today and to the benefit of the generations to come. Join the pfizer team #### Careers Step inside the world of Pfizer and you’ll discover that every single person who works here plays an essential part in making breakthroughs that change patients’ lives.Learn More [Home ][1][About Us][2][News][3][Careers ][4][Contact ][5][Pfizer Global][6][Terms of use][7][Privacy Policy][8][Disclaimer ][9][PAIA ][10]Pfizer Laboratories (Pty) Ltd. Company Reg. No. 1954/000781/07. Building 2, 1st Floor, Maxwell Office Park, Magwa Crescent, Waterfall City, Midrand, Johannesburg, South Africa. Tel. No: 0860 PFIZER (734937). Copyright © 2025. Pfizer Laboratories (Pty) Ltd. All rights reserved [Contact Us][11][Privacy Policy][12][PAIA][13][Terms of use][14] [1]: / [2]: /about [3]: /news [4]: /careers [5]: /contact [6]: https://www.pfizer.com/ [7]: /terms [8]: /privacy [9]: /disclaimer [10]: https://www.pfizer.co.za/files/Pfizer-PAIA-Manual.pdf [11]: /contact [12]: /privacy [13]: /files/PHA259-PAIA-Manual.pdf [14]: /terms", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Pfizer South Africa — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Pfizer has GLP-1 pipeline and market presence, owning brands. | Pfizer has a presence in South Africa and may market GLP-1 receptor agonists in the region. | South Africa | Johannesburg, South Africa", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "64", "Y Score": "76", "Overall Score": "70", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Boehringer Ingelheim do Brasil", "Website": "https://www.boehringer-ingelheim.com.br", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Germany, Boehringer, Ingelheim", "Continent / Geography": "LATAM(Brazil)", "Operational Presence": "Germany; Brazil", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Has diabetes portfolio, though not primarily GLP-1, but relevant in the market.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "DE", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Boehringer Ingelheim do Brasil — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Boehringer Ingelheim has GLP-1 pipeline (e.g., survodutide) and owns brands.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "70", "X Score": "62", "Y Score": "61", "Overall Score": "62", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Sanofi K.K.", "Website": "https://www.sanofi.co.jp", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Tokyo, Japan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Japan)", "Operational Presence": "Japan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Japanese subsidiary of Sanofi, which has GLP-1 products in its portfolio.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "JP", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Sanofi K.K. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Japanese subsidiary of Sanofi, which has GLP-1 products in its portfolio.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "X Score": "66", "Y Score": "58", "Overall Score": "62", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "AstraZeneca K.K.", "Website": "https://www.astrazeneca.co.jp", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Osaka, Japan, Its", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Japan)", "Operational Presence": "Japan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Japanese subsidiary of AstraZeneca, which markets GLP-1 products in the region.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "JP", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "AstraZeneca K.K. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Japanese subsidiary of AstraZeneca, which markets GLP-1 products in the region.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "astrazeneca.co.jp", "data": {"company": {"name": "astrazeneca.co.jp"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [スキップする][1]\n* [スキップする][2]\n[アストラゼネカ] [アストラゼネカ]\n[ [アストラゼネカ] [アストラゼネカ] ][3]\n検索 Menu\n検索 検索 検索 閉じる\n* [ Stories ][4]\n  * [ アストラゼネカのStories ][5]\n  * [ インパクトStories ][6]\n  * [ 医薬品開発 ][7]\n  * [ パートナリング ][8]\n  * [ パイオニアたる所以 ][9]\n  * [ 気候変動と健康 ][10]\n  * [ 患者さんとご家族のため ][11]\n  * [ インクルージョン＆ダイバーシティ ][12]\n  * [ アストラゼネカで働く ][13]\n  * [ 最新情報 ][14]\n* [ アストラゼネカについて ][15]\n  * [ アストラゼネカとは ][16]\n  * [ 会社概要 ][17]\n  * [ 沿革 ][18]\n  * [ 働きがいのある職場 ][19]\n  * [ 米原工場 ][20]\n  * [ 情報公開について ][21]\n  * [ 貢献活動（寄附） ][22]\n  * [ 投資家向けリンク集 ][23]\n* [ 事業と研究開発 ][24]\n  * [ 研究開発パイプライン ][25]\n  * [ オンコロジー（がん） ][26]\n  * [ 循環器・腎・代謝疾患 ][27]\n  * [ 呼吸器・免疫疾患 ][28]\n  * [ 感染症 ][29]\n  * [ アストラゼネカの研究所 ][30]\n* [ サステナビリティ ][31]\n  * [ サステナビリティ ][32]\n  * [ 気候変動・自然保護 ][33]\n  * [ ヘルスエクイティ（健康の公平性） ][34]\n  * [ 保健医療システムのレジリエンス（強靭性） ][35]\n  * [ 私たちのバリュー ][36]\n  * [ 私たちの社員 ][37]\n  * [ 私たちのガバナンスと倫理 ][38]\n* [ 患者・一般の皆さま ][39]\n  * [ 病気と治療について ][40]\n  * [ 弊社製品をお使いの皆さまへ ][41]\n  * [ 臨床試験（治験）について ][42]\n  * [ 次世代医療基盤法 ][43]\n* [ パートナリング ][44]\n  * [ パートナリング ][45]\n  * [ 自治体・企業の皆さま ][46]\n  * [ オープンイノベーションプラットフォーム ][47]\n  * [ 医師主導研究支援プログラム ][48]\n  * [ FAQ ][49]\n  * [ i2.JP ][50]\n* [ ニュース ][51]\n  * [ プレスリリース ][52]\n  * [ お知らせ ][53]\n* [ 採用情報 ][54]\n  * [ 採用情報 ][55]\n  * [ 新卒採用 ][56]\n  * [ キャリア採用 ][57]\n  * [ 障がい者採用 ][58]\n  * [ オフィスツアー ][59]\n* 開く 閉じる\n* [お問合せ][60]\n* [医療関係の皆さま][61]\n* [ グローバルサイト][62]\n\n# 限界を超える。⼈⽣を変える\n\nWhat science can do\n\nこのたびの「令和8年熊本地震」により被害を受けられた皆様に、心よりお見舞い申し上げます。\n現時点で、当社医薬品の供給に大きな影響は確認されておりません。\n当社は今後も関係各所と連携し、必要とする患者さんのもとへ医薬品を安定的にお届けできるよう努めてまいり\nます。\n被災地の一日も早い復旧・復興を心よりお祈り申し上げます。\n\n## 人々、社会、そして地球のために、\n## サイエンスの力で医療の未来を変革します\n\n[ 最新の取り組みはこちら ][63]\n[What makes a difference to our health video]\n\n## アストラゼネカのStories\n\n[\n \n][64]\n\n[患者さんの声は私たちを前進させる原動力―Patient Advocacy Leaders Summit 2025 開催報告][65]\n\n2026年 5月 25日\n\n[患者さんとご家族のため][66]\n\n[\n \n][67]\n\n[日本の小細胞肺がん治療を前へ進めるために ― 学会と共同でレジストリー研究を推進][68]\n\n2026年 3月 5日\n\n[医薬品開発][69]\n\n[\n \n][70]\n\n[新たな国民病「慢性腎臓病（CKD）」で苦しむ方を減らすために―「CKDの克服」を目指すアストラゼネカの取り\n組み―][71]\n\n2026年 2月 6日\n\n[患者さんとご家族のため][72]\n\n[Stories一覧][73]\n \n最新情報や企業活動については、公式SNSでも発信しています。ぜひフォローしてご覧ください。\n\n## アストラゼネカを知る\n\n[ [アストラゼネカとは]\n\n## アストラゼネカとは\n\nアストラゼネカの国内での事業概要および、Purposeや大切する価値について紹介しています。\n\n][74]\n[ [気候変動と健康]\n\n## 気候変動と健康\n\n気候変動を起因とする健康被害や死亡者数が増加しています。\n\n][75]\n[ [研究開発パイプライン]\n\n## 研究開発パイプライン\n\nビジネスパートナーや投資家の皆様に、アストラゼネカの開発パイプラインをご紹介しています。\n\n][76]\n[ [医療課題解決のための協業]\n\n## パートナリング\n\n最高のサイエンスは、協働を通じてうみだされます。アストラゼネカ日本法人では、日本の企業および大学・研\n究機関と協働する機会を広く探し求めています。\n\n][77]\n[ [採用情報]\n\n## 採用情報\n\n患者さんの人生を変えるという当社のミッションに向かい、ともに邁進できる仲間をお待ちしています。\n\n][78]\n\n### 事業と研究開発\n\n[ [オンコロジー（がん）]\n\n## オンコロジー（がん）\n\n][79]\n[ [循環器・腎・代謝疾患]\n\n## 循環器・腎・代謝疾患\n\n][80]\n[ [呼吸器免疫疾患]\n\n## 呼吸器免疫疾患\n\n][81]\n[ [ワクチン・免疫療法]\n\n## 感染症\n\n][82]\n[ [i2.JP] ][83]\n[ [アストラゼネカ医療関係者向け情報サイト-MediChannel-] ][84]\n\n### [アストラゼネカ株式会社][85]\n\nアストラゼネカは、サイエンス志向のグローバルなバイオ・医薬品企業です。日本においては、オンコロジー、\n循環器・腎・代謝疾患、呼吸器・免疫疾患、および感染症を重点領域として、患者さんの人生を変え、健康と医\n療の発展への更なる貢献を果たすべく活動しています。\n* [HOME][86]\n* [Stories][87]\n* [アストラゼネカについて][88]\n* [事業と研究開発][89]\n* [サステナビリティ][90]\n* [患者・一般の皆さま][91]\n* [パートナリング][92]\n* [ニュース][93]\n* [採用情報][94]\n* [医療関係の皆さま][95]\n* [コンプライアンスへの取り組み][96]\n* [取引先との関わり][97]\n* [ソーシャルメディア・コミュニティ・ガイドライン][98]\n\n### Social Media\n* [Facebook][99]\n* [Instagram][100]\n* [YouTube][101]\n* [Linkedin][102]\n\n#### utility links\n* [ご利用規約][103]\n* [プライバシーポリシー][104]\n* [サイトマップ][105]\n* [お問合せ][106]\n* [情報公開について][107]\n* [クッキーポリシー][108]\n\n2026年5月掲載（202605）JP-104714\n© AstraZeneca 2026\n\n**astrazeneca.co.jpを離れます。**\n\nリンク先のサイト内容については、\nそれぞれのお問い合わせ先にご連絡ください。\n\n[キャンセル][109] [続ける][110]\n\n**重要なお知らせ**\n\nあなたは、アストラゼネカのアーカイブ資料にアクセスしようとしています。\nこれら製品またはご使用についてのいかなる資料も、最新の医学知識・情報が反映されているとは限らず、現行\n製品における情報の根拠として参照すること、また有効性や安全性が保証されたデータとして使用することはで\nきません。現行の製品の情報については、承認を受けているNational Product\nLabel(SmPC)を参照してください。\n\n私は、上記の警告メッセージを理解した上で、アーカイブ資料に含まれる製品情報を医療的な目的で使うことは\nありません。\n\n[同意しない][111] [同意する][112]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: #navigation\n[3]: /content/az-jp.html\n[4]: /stories.html\n[5]: /stories.html\n[6]: /stories/stories-of-impact.html\n[7]: /stories/innovation.html\n[8]: /stories/partnering.html\n[9]: /stories/pioneers.html\n[10]: /stories/sustainability.html\n[11]: /stories/patients-and-family.html\n["}}, "page_text": "* [スキップする][1] * [スキップする][2] [アストラゼネカ] [アストラゼネカ] [ [アストラゼネカ] [アストラゼネカ] ][3] 検索 Menu 検索 検索 検索 閉じる * [ Stories ][4] * [ アストラゼネカのStories ][5] * [ インパクトStories ][6] * [ 医薬品開発 ][7] * [ パートナリング ][8] * [ パイオニアたる所以 ][9] * [ 気候変動と健康 ][10] * [ 患者さんとご家族のため ][11] * [ インクルージョン＆ダイバーシティ ][12] * [ アストラゼネカで働く ][13] * [ 最新情報 ][14] * [ アストラゼネカについて ][15] * [ アストラゼネカとは ][16] * [