/gui/112316/index.html [124]: //policy.cookiereports.com/b824999c-de.html [125]: # [126]: # [127]: # [128]: #", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "AstraZeneca GmbH — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: AstraZeneca markets GLP-1 receptor agonists (e.g., Bydureon, exenatide). | German subsidiary of AstraZeneca; markets Bydureon and other GLP-1 products. | Germany | Hamburg, Germany", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "52", "Y Score": "60", "Overall Score": "56", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Zealand Pharma", "Website": "https://www.zealandpharma.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Søborg, Denmark", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Denmark)", "Operational Presence": "Denmark", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Partners with BI for GLP-1 candidates", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "DK", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Zealand Pharma — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Partners with BI for GLP-1 candidates; owns pipeline assets.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "zealandpharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "zealandpharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ About us ][1]\nBack\nAbout us\n\nZealand Pharma is an international biotechnology company headquartered in Denmark, with operations\nin Boston, USA. We are focused on the discovery, design, and development of innovative peptide-based\nand small molecule medicines that empower people to live long and healthy lives\n\n[ Learn More About us Overview ][2]\n\n[ Peptide expertise ][3]\n\n[ Partnering ][4]\n\n[ Corporate management ][5]\n\n[ Board of Directors ][6]\n\n[ Corporate governance ][7]\n\n[ Our impact ][8]\n\n[ Reports & policies ][9]\n\n[ Disease areas ][10]\nBack\nDisease areas\n\nZealand Pharma is focused on disease areas where we believe we can transform metabolic health and\ndeliver outcomes that increase human healthspan\n\n[ Learn More Disease areas Overview ][11]\n\n[ Obesity ][12]\n\n[ Congenital Hyperinsulinism ][13]\n\n[ Short Bowel Syndrome ][14]\n\n[ Chronic Inflammation ][15]\n\n[ Pipeline ][16]\nBack\nPipeline\n\nAt Zealand Pharma, we aim to build the world’s most valuable metabolic health pipeline, underpinned\nby our portfolio of novel and differentiated candidates\n\n[ Learn More Pipeline Overview ][17]\n\n[ Petrelintide ][18]\n\n[ ZP6590 ][19]\n\n[ Survodutide ][20]\n\n[ Dasiglucagon: Continuous infusion ][21]\n\n[ Glepaglutide ][22]\n\n[ ZP9830 ][23]\n\n[ Petrelintide / CT-388 ][24]\n\n[ Dapiglutide (program paused) ][25]\n\n[ Scientific publications ][26]\n\n[ Investors ][27]\nBack\nInvestors\n\nZealand Pharma is committed to creating value for our society and our shareholders through\nlife-changing peptide therapeutics for people who need them.\n\n[ Learn More Investors Overview ][28]\n\n[ Shareholder portal ][29]\n\n[ Stock information ][30]\n\n[ Financial reports ][31]\n\n[ Events & presentations ][32]\n\n[ Annual General Meeting ][33]\n\n[ Analyst coverage ][34]\n\n[ FAQs ][35]\n\n[ PFIC Annual Information ][36]\n\n[ Extraordinary General Meeting May 2026 ][37]\n\n**Zealand Pharma represents a unique investment opportunity** [ Download presentation ][38]\n\n[ News & media ][39]\nBack\nNews & media\n\nZealand Pharma provides news through company announcements and press releases.\n\n[ Learn More News & media Overview ][40]\n\n[ Newsroom ][41]\n\n[ Media resources ][42]\n\n[ Subscribe to news ][43]\n\n[ Careers ][44]\nBack\nCareers\n\nAt Zealand Pharma we pride ourselves on the way we work together as one team fostering a strong and\nengaging company culture founded on collaboration, courage, empowerment, and trust.\n\n[ Learn More Careers Overview ][45]\n\n[ Values and culture ][46]\n\n[ Meet the Zealanders ][47]\n\n**Interested in a career at Zealand Pharma?** [ View open positions ][48]\n\n[ Contact ][49]\nBack\nContact\n\n[ Learn More Contact Overview ][50]\n\n[ Compliance Hotline ][51]\n\nClear\n\nSubmit\n\nSearch\nMenu\nWHERE WE INNOVATE\n\n## Building the most \n## valuable pipeline\n## in metabolic health\n\n[ Pipeline ][52]\nOUR AMBITION\n\n## Becoming a generational biotech\n\n[ About us ][53]\nOUR SCIENCE\n\n## Leveraging decades of\n## metabolic health experience\n\n[ Peptide expertise ][54]\nOUR FOCUS\n\n## Transforming the\n## management\n## of obesity\n\n[ Obesity ][55]\nOUR CULTURE\n\n## Working as one team\n## for each other,\n## partners, & patients\n\n[ Careers ][56]\n[Gen Biotech Thumbnail] [ PLAY VIDEO ][57]\n* ## Share price information\n  \n  ### ZEAL (COP)\n  \n  338.50DKK\n  \n  Last updated on 13 August 2026 13:36 (GMT +01:00)\n  \n  Zealand Pharma is listed on Nasdaq Copenhagen under the ticker symbol ZEAL.\n  \n  [ More Stock information ][58]\n* ## Annual Report 2025\n  \n  [Annual Report 2025 Cover]\n  \n  Read Zealand Pharma's annual report for 2025.\n  \n  [ Download report ][59]\n* ## Corporate presentation\n  \n  [Corporate Presentation Cover]\n  \n  See Zealand Pharma's latest Corporate Presentation for an overview of our R&D pipeline and\n  additional company information.\n  \n  [ Download Presentation ][60]\n\n## Latest news\n\n[ View all news ][61]\n* COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENT 13 Aug 2026\n  \n  ### Zealand Pharma Announces Financial Results for the First Half of 2026\n  \n  [ READ MORE ][62]\n* COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENT 12 Aug 2026\n  \n  ### Zealand Pharma enters into a USD 10"}}, "page_text": "[ About us ][1] Back About us Zealand Pharma is an international biotechnology company headquartered in Denmark, with operations in Boston, USA. We are focused on the discovery, design, and development of innovative peptide-based and small molecule medicines that empower people to live long and healthy lives [ Learn More About us Overview ][2] [ Peptide expertise ][3] [ Partnering ][4] [ Corporate management ][5] [ Board of Directors ][6] [ Corporate governance ][7] [ Our impact ][8] [ Reports & policies ][9] [ Disease areas ][10] Back Disease areas Zealand Pharma is focused on disease areas where we believe we can transform metabolic health and deliver outcomes that increase human healthspan [ Learn More Disease areas Overview ][11] [ Obesity ][12] [ Congenital Hyperinsulinism ][13] [ Short Bowel Syndrome ][14] [ Chronic Inflammation ][15] [ Pipeline ][16] Back Pipeline At Zealand Pharma, we aim to build the world’s most valuable metabolic health pipeline, underpinned by our portfolio of novel and differentiated candidates [ Learn More Pipeline Overview ][17] [ Petrelintide ][18] [ ZP6590 ][19] [ Survodutide ][20] [ Dasiglucagon: Continuous infusion ][21] [ Glepaglutide ][22] [ ZP9830 ][23] [ Petrelintide / CT-388 ][24] [ Dapiglutide (program paused) ][25] [ Scientific publications ][26] [ Investors ][27] Back Investors Zealand Pharma is committed to creating value for our society and our shareholders through life-changing peptide therapeutics for people who need them. [ Learn More Investors Overview ][28] [ Shareholder portal ][29] [ Stock information ][30] [ Financial reports ][31] [ Events & presentations ][32] [ Annual General Meeting ][33] [ Analyst coverage ][34] [ FAQs ][35] [ PFIC Annual Information ][36] [ Extraordinary General Meeting May 2026 ][37] **Zealand Pharma represents a unique investment opportunity** [ Download presentation ][38] [ News & media ][39] Back News & media Zealand Pharma provides news through company announcements and press releases. [ Learn More News & media Overview ][40] [ Newsroom ][41] [ Media resources ][42] [ Subscribe to news ][43] [ Careers ][44] Back Careers At Zealand Pharma we pride ourselves on the way we work together as one team fostering a strong and engaging company culture founded on collaboration, courage, empowerment, and trust. [ Learn More Careers Overview ][45] [ Values and culture ][46] [ Meet the Zealanders ][47] **Interested in a career at Zealand Pharma?** [ View open positions ][48] [ Contact ][49] Back Contact [ Learn More Contact Overview ][50] [ Compliance Hotline ][51] Clear Submit Search Menu WHERE WE INNOVATE ## Building the most ## valuable pipeline ## in metabolic health [ Pipeline ][52] OUR AMBITION ## Becoming a generational biotech [ About us ][53] OUR SCIENCE ## Leveraging decades of ## metabolic health experience [ Peptide expertise ][54] OUR FOCUS ## Transforming the ## management ## of obesity [ Obesity ][55] OUR CULTURE ## Working as one team ## for each other, ## partners, & patients [ Careers ][56] [Gen Biotech Thumbnail] [ PLAY VIDEO ][57] * ## Share price information ### ZEAL (COP) 338.50DKK Last updated on 13 August 2026 13:36 (GMT +01:00) Zealand Pharma is listed on Nasdaq Copenhagen under the ticker symbol ZEAL. [ More Stock information ][58] * ## Annual Report 2025 [Annual Report 2025 Cover] Read Zealand Pharma's annual report for 2025. [ Download report ][59] * ## Corporate presentation [Corporate Presentation Cover] See Zealand Pharma's latest Corporate Presentation for an overview of our R&D pipeline and additional company information. [ Download Presentation ][60] ## Latest news [ View all news ][61] * COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENT 13 Aug 2026 ### Zealand Pharma Announces Financial Results for the First Half of 2026 [ READ MORE ][62] * COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENT 12 Aug 2026 ### Zealand Pharma enters into a USD 100 million royalty purchase and sale agreement with Royalty ### Pharma for the economics related to rusfertide [ READ MORE ][63] * COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENT 10 Aug 2026 ### Zealand Pharma - Transactions related to share buy-back program (week 32, 2026) [ READ MORE ][64] * PRESS RELEASE 06 Aug 2026 ### Zealand Pharma conference call on August 13 at 2pm CEST (8am ET) to present second quarter ### 2026 financial results [ READ MORE ][65] ## An innovative R&D pipeline Obesity ### Petrelintide A long-acting amylin analog as a weight-loss medication representing an alternative to GLP-1 receptor agonists. [ READ MORE ][66] Obesity ### Survodutide A long-acting glucagon/GLP-1 receptor dual agonist targeting obesity and MASH licensed to Boehringer Ingelheim. [ READ MORE ][67] Chronic inflammation ### ZP9830 A potent and selective blocker of the Kv1.3 ion channel with the potential to treat a broad range of T-cell-driven autoimmune diseases. [ READ MORE ][68] Obesity ### ZP6590 A GIP receptor agonist targeting obesity as a potential complement to GLP-1 for increased effect and/or tolerability. [ READ MORE ][69] Congenital Hyperinsulinism ### Dasiglucagon: Continuous infusion A glucagon analog designed to allow for continuous subcutaneous infusion via a wearable pump system for the treatment of Congenital Hyperinsulinism (CHI). [ READ MORE ][70] Short Bowel Syndrome ### Glepaglutide A long-acting GLP-2 analog designed to reduce or eliminate the need for parenteral support in SBS patients with intestinal failure. [ READ MORE ][71] Obesity ### Dapiglutide (program paused) A long-acting GLP-1/GLP-2 receptor dual agonist (Phase 2 ready) [ READ MORE ][72] [ View full pipeline ][73] ## Innovating across a range of disease areas ### Obesity [Crowd 1] As one of the greatest healthcare challenges of our time, obesity and overweight are associated with more than 220 complications and comorbidities, including cardiovascular disease, liver disease, type 2 diabetes, kidney disease, and neuroinflammation. Zealand Pharma is focused on reprogramming metabolic health to increase healthspan, not just treat symptoms. [ Read more ][74] ### Rare diseases [1600Px COLOURBOX31315294] Severely impacting quality of life, many rare diseases represent major unmet needs. Zealand Pharma has a long-standing commitment to people living with congenital hyperinsulinism (CHI) and short bowel syndrome (SBS). [ Congenital hyperinsulinism ][75] [ Short Bowel Syndrome ][76] ### Chronic inflammation [Zealand Pharma 1102] Through damage to tissues and organs, chronic inflammation can lead to the development of a broad range of potentially disabling or life-threatening illnesses. Zealand Pharma believes peptide medicines present opportunities for innovation in the treatment of chronic inflammatory diseases. [ Read more ][77] [Crowd 1] [1600Px COLOURBOX31315294] [Zealand Pharma 1102] [ Explore all disease areas ][78] [Illustration Accordion 1 Grey] ## Safety, tolerability, and clinical effects of petrelintide (ZP8396), a long-acting amylin analog ### Featured publication Results from a 16-week Phase 1 multiple ascending dose (MAD) trial of petrelintide (ZP8396) presented at Obesity Week in November 2024. [ Read more ][79] [ All scientific publications ][80] [Zealand Pharma 0682] ## Fostering an enriching workplace At Zealand, we promote engagement, growth, diversity and inclusion. We believe that engaged and motivated employees with a passion for making a difference bring a positive mindset and inspiring level of energy to work. Our highly skilled employees are at the center of the medical treatment options that we design and develop for patients. We pride ourselves on our ability to work together as one team and to foster a strong and engaging company culture founded on collaboration, courage, empowerment, and trust. [ Careers at zealand ][81] [ open positions ][82] [Zealand Pharm Office Part 2 BF3I3965 Close] [Zealand Pharma 0920] [Zealand Pharma 1220] [Zealand Pharma 1503] ## Would you like to stay up to date with Zealand news? Join our email list to receive company announcements and press releases directly to your inbox. [ Subscribe to news ][83] ## Do you have questions about Zealand Pharma? [