, owns/markets branded drugs. | Has GLP-1 RA biosimilar pipeline | Germany; Switzerland | Holzkirchen, Germany", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "51", "Y Score": "51", "Overall Score": "51", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Teva Pharmaceutical", "Website": "https://www.tevapharm.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Tel, Aviv, Israel", "Continent / Geography": "ME(Israel)", "Operational Presence": "Israel", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Developing GLP-1 RA biosimilars", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IL", "Region Code": "ME", "Summary": "Teva Pharmaceutical — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Developing GLP-1 RA biosimilars, owns/markets branded drugs.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "tevapharm.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "tevapharm.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip To Main Content][1]\nDelay Time 20 Minutes Delay Time 20 Minutes Country Country [teva logo icon] [teva logo icon]\n\n# **Teva in Q2 2026**\n\nBuilding sustainable, innovation-driven growth and long-term value creation\n\nView the press release\n\n## **We Are All In**\n## ** for Better Health**\n\nTeva Pharmaceuticals is a leading innovative biopharmaceutical\ncompany, enabled by a world-class generics business.\n\nGet to know Teva\n\n## **Finding solutions to\n## unmet medical needs**\n\nTeva focuses on innovative medicine for various therapeutic\nareas including neuroscience and immunology.\n\nLearn about our latest innovations\n\n## **Dedicated to addressing\n## patients’ needs**\n\nDeveloping innovative medicines for the future while\nchampioning the production of generics and biosimilars.\n\nLearn about our solutions\n\n## It's Time to Talk About Now\n\nTeva is an innovative biopharmaceutical company, enabled by a world-class generics business. What\ndoes that look like? Watch now.\n\n[Neuroscience Immunology]\n\n#### Transcript\n\n[\nTranscript\n][2]\n\nIt's time to look back on our legacy. Wait. No it's not. It's time to talk about now. It's time to\nlook forward. Our history made us. But now we're an innovative biopharmaceutical leader. powered by\nour generics business.\n\nWait. What does that mean?\nIt means that we deliver generics and biosimilars at scale and we're focused on developing new\nmedicines in areas of greatest unmet need.\n\nLike neuroscience and immunology. It means stepping up innovation, working with partners and experts\nto do whatever it takes. New medicines. Reaching more patients. Faster.\n\nWait. What does that look like?\n\nIt looks like developments in severe mental illness. Progress for movement disorders. Leading brands\nin migraine. And it looks like revolutionizing therapies for autoimmune diseases. A promising\npipeline poised to bring treatments to millions of patients and caregivers.\n\nThrough grit and focus, we're building unrelenting momentum. We find a way. Because at Teva,\nprogress is undeniable. And we're motivated by the people who depend on it. We’re all in for better\nhealth.\n\n\n \n\n \n\n### Teva Corporate Video - It's Time to Talk About Now\n\nAs Teva continues to advance into the acceleration phase of our Pivot to Growth strategy, this video\nreflect who we are today — an innovative biopharmaceutical leader powered by our world-class\ngenerics business — and where we’re headed next.\n\n## Q2 2026 Earnings Highlights Podcast\n\nKey takeaways from Teva's second-quarter shareholder update, from financial performance and pipeline\nprogress to the milestones ahead.  \n\nListen now\n[Person looking in a mirror with visible vitiligo patches, highlighting awareness, confidence, and\nskin depigmentation]\n\n## Vitiligo: Causes, Misconceptions, Patient Impact, and Teva’s Innovation\n\nA scientific and patient-centered overview of vitiligo, covering what it is, what causes it, how it\naffects people’s lives, common misconceptions, and Teva’s work to advance innovation in care.\n\nRead more\n\n## Understanding IBD: Causes, Symptoms, and Long-Term Effects\n\nAround 4.9 million people live with inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). Find out more about its known\ncauses, risk factors, symptoms, long-term complications and current and future treatment options.\n\nRead more\n\n## Driving the next chapter of neuroscience\n\nAt Teva, we focus on addressing some of the most complex and urgent challenges in neuroscience\ntoday.\n\nRead more\n\n## Stepping Up Innovation\n\n**Innovation for patients is at the heart of what we do, in every stage of drug development and\ndelivery.**\n\nFrom in-house innovation to strategic partnerships, we are persistent in the creation of innovative\nmedicines, generics and biologics to increase the accessibility and affordability of existing\nmedicines.\n\nExplore the Teva R&D pipeline\n\n## Press Releases\n\nMoody’s Ratings Upgrades Teva to Investment Grade, Reflecting the Ongoing Execution of Pivot to\nGrowth Strategy\n\nTeva Delivers Strong Q2 Results and Raises Outlook for All"}}, "page_text": "[Skip To Main Content][1] Delay Time 20 Minutes Delay Time 20 Minutes Country Country [teva logo icon] [teva logo icon] # **Teva in Q2 2026** Building sustainable, innovation-driven growth and long-term value creation View the press release ## **We Are All In** ## ** for Better Health** Teva Pharmaceuticals is a leading innovative biopharmaceutical company, enabled by a world-class generics business. Get to know Teva ## **Finding solutions to ## unmet medical needs** Teva focuses on innovative medicine for various therapeutic areas including neuroscience and immunology. Learn about our latest innovations ## **Dedicated to addressing ## patients’ needs** Developing innovative medicines for the future while championing the production of generics and biosimilars. Learn about our solutions ## It's Time to Talk About Now Teva is an innovative biopharmaceutical company, enabled by a world-class generics business. What does that look like? Watch now. [Neuroscience Immunology] #### Transcript [ Transcript ][2] It's time to look back on our legacy. Wait. No it's not. It's time to talk about now. It's time to look forward. Our history made us. But now we're an innovative biopharmaceutical leader. powered by our generics business. Wait. What does that mean? It means that we deliver generics and biosimilars at scale and we're focused on developing new medicines in areas of greatest unmet need. Like neuroscience and immunology. It means stepping up innovation, working with partners and experts to do whatever it takes. New medicines. Reaching more patients. Faster. Wait. What does that look like? It looks like developments in severe mental illness. Progress for movement disorders. Leading brands in migraine. And it looks like revolutionizing therapies for autoimmune diseases. A promising pipeline poised to bring treatments to millions of patients and caregivers. Through grit and focus, we're building unrelenting momentum. We find a way. Because at Teva, progress is undeniable. And we're motivated by the people who depend on it. We’re all in for better health. ### Teva Corporate Video - It's Time to Talk About Now As Teva continues to advance into the acceleration phase of our Pivot to Growth strategy, this video reflect who we are today — an innovative biopharmaceutical leader powered by our world-class generics business — and where we’re headed next. ## Q2 2026 Earnings Highlights Podcast Key takeaways from Teva's second-quarter shareholder update, from financial performance and pipeline progress to the milestones ahead. Listen now [Person looking in a mirror with visible vitiligo patches, highlighting awareness, confidence, and skin depigmentation] ## Vitiligo: Causes, Misconceptions, Patient Impact, and Teva’s Innovation A scientific and patient-centered overview of vitiligo, covering what it is, what causes it, how it affects people’s lives, common misconceptions, and Teva’s work to advance innovation in care. Read more ## Understanding IBD: Causes, Symptoms, and Long-Term Effects Around 4.9 million people live with inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). Find out more about its known causes, risk factors, symptoms, long-term complications and current and future treatment options. Read more ## Driving the next chapter of neuroscience At Teva, we focus on addressing some of the most complex and urgent challenges in neuroscience today. Read more ## Stepping Up Innovation **Innovation for patients is at the heart of what we do, in every stage of drug development and delivery.** From in-house innovation to strategic partnerships, we are persistent in the creation of innovative medicines, generics and biologics to increase the accessibility and affordability of existing medicines. Explore the Teva R&D pipeline ## Press Releases Moody’s Ratings Upgrades Teva to Investment Grade, Reflecting the Ongoing Execution of Pivot to Growth Strategy Teva Delivers Strong Q2 Results and Raises Outlook for All Three Key Innovative Brands, Reflecting Continued Execution of Its Pivot to Growth Strategy Teva and Polpharma Biologics Announce Global Licensing Agreement for a Biosimilar Candidate to Ocrevus® (ocrelizumab) for Multiple Sclerosis ## Healthy Future: Sustainability at Teva ### Teva's Healthy Future Report: Creating the Future We Want to See Our latest Healthy Future Report shows the steps Teva is taking for the health of people, the planet and our business. Healthy Future Report ## Take a closer look at what we do [teva] ### Teva in Q2 2026: Our transformation at a glance [Q1 2026 Earnings hightlights, Listen to the AI - powered call summary] [Innovation][3] [Growth][4] ### Teva in Q1 2026: Our transformation at a glance [2025 Health Future Report] [Sustainability][5] [Environment][6] ### 4 Things You Might Not Know About Our 2025 Healthy Future Report [Leadership][7] [Global Operations][8] [Global][9] [Growth][10] [Biosimilars][11] ### Sustaining Teva’s Generics Powerhouse in the Acceleration Phase [Leadership][12] [Research & Development][13] [Growth][14] ### Step Up Innovation [Teva scientist looking at stylized DNA strand representing acceleration phase of pivot to growth strategy] [Leadership][15] [Research & Development][16] [Growth][17] [Innovation][18] ### Pivot to Growth: The Acceleration Phase [Female Teva scientist reflecting on how innovative medicines in growth engine therapeutic areas will help patients worldwide] [Leadership][19] [Innovation][20] [Neuroscience][21] [Growth][22] ### Delivering on Growth Engines [Innovation][23] [Growth][24] ### Teva in 2025: Innovation drives third consecutive year of growth [Access to Medicine][25] [Sustainability][26] [Social Impact][27] ### Supporting Healthier Communities [Global][28] [Innovation][29] [Research & Development][30] ### “I Think People are Starting to Get That There’s a Lot of Upside at Teva” View all stories ## Careers at Teva ### Make a difference to people's health, every day Working at Teva is not just a job, it’s so much more than that. Here, you get to spend each day helping millions of people around the world enjoy healthier lives. At the same time, you’ll be joining a dedicated team, united by the strong sense that we’re building something greater than ourselves. Explore a Teva Career ## Patients and Caregivers Stories [Mental Health][31] [Schizophrenia][32] [Stigma & Awareness][33] [Social Life & Relationships][34] ### Embracing Authenticity: Disclosing My Schizophrenia, and the Peace it Brought Me [Mental Health][35] [Schizophrenia][36] [Sleep][37] ### Don’t Snooze, I Lose: How I’m Learning to Sleep with Schizophrenia [Close up of male hands planting seeds in a germination box symbolizing growth and new beginnings ] [Mental Health][38] [Schizophrenia][39] [Mindfulness & Wellbeing][40] ### Psychosis Recovery: Learning to Trust the Process [Mental Health][41] [Schizophrenia][42] [Coping Strategies][43] ### My Happy Book: Finding Comfort While Living with Schizoaffective Disorder [Mental Health][44] [Schizophrenia][45] [Triggers, Symptoms & Flare-Ups][46] [Work & School][47] ### How Schizophrenia Guided My Career as a Clinical Social Worker [Woman reflecting on her past, trying not to dwell on mistakes she might've made.] [Mental Health][48] [Schizophrenia][49] [Stigma & Awareness][50] [Work & School][51] ### Reflecting on Your Past with Schizophrenia: Managing the What-Ifs [Woman with Huntington’s disease feeling throat while struggling with dysphagia and aspiration] [Huntington's Disease][52] [Coping Strategies][53] [Triggers, Symptoms & Flare-Ups][54] ### A Hard-to-Swallow Truth: Coping with Aspiration Fears and Denial in Huntington’s Disease [Mental Health][55] [Schizophrenia][56] [Stigma & Awareness][57] [Work & School][58] ### Schizophrenia at Work: Facing Stigma and Finding a Way Forward [Mental Health][59] [Huntington's Disease][60] [Accessibility][61] [Coping Strategies][62] ### HD is Stealing My Ability to Communicate: This is How We Fight Back [Mental Health][63] [Schizophrenia][64] [Triggers, Symptoms & Flare-Ups][65] ### Who Am I? Exploring the Tension Between Treatment and Identity after Psychosis View all stories ## Our Purpose Our colleagues embody the Teva purpose in their work every day. [ Read more ][66] * [Contact Us][67] * [Terms of Use][68] * [Social Media Guidelines][69] * [Teva api][70] * [Medis][71] * [Teva Code of Conduct][72] * [Supplier Code of Conduct][73] * [Environmental, Social and Governance at Teva][74] * [All Corporate Governance & P