hanging Drug Discovery and What It Will Take to Unlock Its Full Potential ][234] [RESPONSIBILITY][235] 07.08.2026 [ ## Amgen Ecovation^{®}: How Amgen Builds Sustainability Into Biotech ][236] [PATIENTS][237] 06.24.2026 [ ## IgG4-RD: From Diagnostic Delays to Collective Action in Rare Disease Care ][238] [PATIENTS][239] 06.22.2026 [ ## What a Landmark Real-World Study Reveals About Thyroid Eye Disease ][240] [PEOPLE & CULTURE][241] 06.18.2026 [ ## Amgen Gives Greater Los Angeles Community an Experience to Remember at FIFA Fan Festival™ ][242] [PEOPLE & CULTURE][243] 06.11.2026 [ ## Amgen Named Among World’s Most Impactful Companies 2026 by TIME ][244] [LEADERSHIP][245] 06.04.2026 [ ## Real-World Evidence: Shaping Obesity Treatment Beyond Clinical Trials ][246] [RESPONSIBILITY][247] 06.04.2026 [ ## kidSTREAM Opening Brings Hands-On Science Learning to Families Near Amgen’s Headquarters ][248] [LEADERSHIP][249] 06.03.2026 [ ## Bob Bradway on AI: Reimagining the Future of Biotechnology ][250] [MORE STORIES][251] ### Our Latest Press Releases PRESS RELEASE PRESS RELEASE PRESS RELEASE PRESS RELEASE PRESS RELEASE [More News][252] [ ##### Global hotline for Ukrainian refugee patients participating in an Amgen clinical trial. ##### Click here for more information. ][253] ## Our Story [Watch Video][254][Learn more][255] [ ## Our Science Amgen is a pioneer in the science of using living cells to make biologic medicines. READ MORE ][256] [ ## Our Products Amgen’s medicines treat serious illnesses and typically address diseases with a limited number of treatment options. READ MORE ][257] [ ## Our Responsibility Making a positive difference in the world is at the heart of what we do at Amgen—and it goes beyond making vital medicines. READ MORE ][258] [ ## Amgen Investors Amgen is a pioneer in the science of using living cells to make biologic medicines, leading and guiding the biotech industry. Read More ][259] [ ## Careers With Amgen Encounter opportunities both new and undiscovered, as we embrace leading-edge technologies, invest in our talents, and maximize our potential. Read More ][260] ### Follow Us On Social Media * [ [linkedIn-icon] [linkedIn-icon] ][261] * [ [twitter-icon] [twitter-icon] ][262] * [ [youtube-icon] [youtube-icon] ][263] * [ [facebook-icon] [ facebook-icon] ][264] * [ [instagram-icon] [instagram-icon] ][265] * [ [threads-icon] [threads-icon] ][266] * [ [tiktok-icon] [tiktok-icon] ][267] [ Contact Us ][268] [ Sitemap ][269] [ Privacy Statement ][270] [ Terms of Use ][271] [ Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy ][272] [ Your Cookie Preferences ][273] © 1996-2026 Amgen Inc. All rights reserved. [d-amgen-logo] [1]: / [2]: / [3]: [4]: # [5]: /about [6]: /about [7]: /about/amgen-history [8]: /about/mission-and-values [9]: /about/leadership [10]: /about/brand-partners [11]: https://www.amgenfoundation.org/ [12]: /about/awards-and-accolades [13]: /about/therapy-areas [14]: /about/therapy-areas/cardiovascular [15]: /about/therapy-areas/bone-health [16]: /about/therapy-areas/inflammation [17]: /about/therapy-areas/oncology [18]: /about/how-we-operate [19]: /about/how-we-operate [20]: /about/how-we-operate/corporate-governance [21]: /responsibility/a-healthy-amgen/business-ethics-and-compliance [22]: /about/how-we-operate/policies-practices-and-disclosures [23]: /science [24]: /science [25]: /science/research-and-development-strategy [26]: /science/research-and-development-strategy [27]: /science/research-and-development-strategy/human-and-disease-biology [28]: /science/research-and-development-strategy/novel-targets-and-modalities [29]: /science/research-and-development-strategy/clinical-trial-optimization [30]: /science/research-and-development-strategy/ai-in-research-and-development [31]: https://www.amgenpipeline.com/ [32]: /science/scientific-advisory-boards [33]: /science/biosimilars [34]: /science/clinical-trials [35]: /science/clinical-trials [36]: /science/clinical-trials/about-clinical-trials [37]: https://www.amgentrials.com [38]: /science/clinical-trials/clinical-trial-representation [39]: /science/clinical-trials/information-for-healthcare-professionals [40]: /science/clinical-trials/clinical-data-transparency-practices [41]: /science/clinical-trials/clinical-out-of-hours-support-program [42]: http://www.amgeniss.com [43]: /science/scientific-community-initiatives [44]: /science/scientific-community-initiatives [45]: /science/scientific-community-initiatives/educational-outreach-program [46]: /science/scientific-community-i", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Amgen — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Developing bispecific GLP-1/GIP RA, owns pipeline. | Developing a bispecific GLP-1/GIP RA | United States | Thousand Oaks, California, USA", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "50", "Y Score": "49", "Overall Score": "50", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Aspen Pharmacare", "Website": "https://www.aspenpharma.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "uMhlanga, South Africa", "Continent / Geography": "AF(South Africa)", "Operational Presence": "South Africa", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Aspen is a leading African pharmaceutical company with a portfolio of diabetes medications, including GLP-1 receptor agonists, marketed across the continent.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "ZA", "Region Code": "AF", "Summary": "Aspen Pharmacare — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Aspen is a pharmaceutical company with a portfolio of diabetes medications including GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating ownership or marketing of GLP-1 brands.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "aspenpharma.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "aspenpharma.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Share Price:\n\nAPNASPENAspen Pharmacare Hldgs14486-49 (-0.34%)\nSearch\n[ Our Response to Covid ][1]\n[ Country Sites ][2]\n* [About Aspen][3]\n  \n  ##### [ About Aspen ][4]\n  * [ Corporate Governance ][5]\n  * [ Regional Overviews ][6]\n  * [ Our Leadership ][7]\n  * [ Global Presence ][8]\n  * [ Business Segments ][9]\n  \n  ##### [ Corporate Governance ][10]\n  \n  The Board is accountable to shareholders and other stakeholders and is ultimately responsible for\n  the implementation of sound corporate governance practices throughout the Group. Aspen’s Board of\n  Directors is committed to ensuring that the Group adheres to high standards of corporate\n  governance in the conduct of its business.\n  \n  ##### [ Regional Overview ][11]\n  * [ Africa Middle East ][12]\n  * [ Americas ][13]\n  * [ Asia ][14]\n  * [ Australasia ][15]\n  * [ Europe CIS ][16]\n  \n  ##### [ Business Segments ][17]\n  * [ Prescription ][18]\n  * [ Over the Counter ][19]\n  * [ Injectables ][20]\n  * [ Manufacturing ][21]\n  \n  ##### [ Manufacturing ][22]\n  \n  Aspen has 23 manufacturing facilities across 15 sites. Our\n  strategic manufacturing sites are widely accredited, holding international approval from some of\n  the most stringent global regulatory agencies. We manufacture a wide variety of product types\n  including steriles, oral solid dose, liquids, semi-solids, biologicals and APIs.\n  \n  ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][23]\n  \n  Watch the Webcast\n  \n  [ Read More » ][24]\n  \n  ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][25]\n  \n  View or Download\n  \n  [ Read More » ][26]\n* [Investor Relations][27]\n  \n  ##### [ Investor Relations ][28]\n  * [ Investor Hub ][29]\n  * [ Financial Information ][30]\n  * [ Financial Results and Presentations ][31]\n  * [ Integrated Reporting ][32]\n  * [ Share Price Information ][33]\n  * [ Financial Calendar ][34]\n  * [ SENS ][35]\n  \n  ##### [ Investor Relations ][36]\n  \n  Access our investor hub for information and tools including corporate reporting, share price,\n  dividends, calendar, SENS and other relevant documents.\n  \n  ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][37]\n  \n  Watch the Webcast\n  \n  [ Read More » ][38]\n  \n  ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][39]\n  \n  View or Download\n  \n  [ Read More » ][40]\n* [We Care][41]\n  \n  ##### We Care\n  * [ Ethics & Compliance Management ][42]\n  * [ SED Initiatives ][43]\n  * [ Mandela Day ][44]\n  * [ Sustainability ][45]\n  * [ Responsible Corporate Citizenship ][46]\n  \n  ##### Ethics & Compliance Management\n  \n  “A bright future beckons. The onus is on us, through hard work, honesty, and integrity, to reach\n  for the stars. ” – Nelson Mandela\n  \n  ##### SED Initiatives\n  \n  Aspen has demonstrated an unwavering commitment to our credo ‘Healthcare. We Care” through a wide\n  range of initiatives and activities that span more than two decades.\n  \n  ##### Mandela Day\n  \n  DURBAN – JSE Limited listed Aspen Pharmacare Holdings Limited (“Aspen”), a global specialty and\n  branded pharmaceutical company, has hosted more than 800 activities over 12 years in celebration\n  of the annual Nelson Mandela International Day (“Mandela Day”).\n  \n  ##### Our Sustainability Commitments\n  \n  We believe that doing business in a sustainable and responsible manner is integral to our purpose,\n  our values and our philosophy “Healthcare. We Care”.\n  \n   \n  \n  Our sustainability commitments are integrated into the Group’s strategic objectives and underpin\n  the way we do business.\n  \n  ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][47]\n  \n  Watch the Webcast\n  \n  [ Read More » ][48]\n  \n  ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][49]\n  \n  View or Download\n  \n  [ Read More » ][50]\n* [Careers][51]\n  \n  ##### [ Careers ][52]\n  * [ Careers at Aspen ][53]\n  * [ Aspen Jobs ][54]\n  * [ Bursary Applications ][55]\n  \n  ##### [ High Performing, Inclusive Culture ][56]\n  \n  Our purpose is to deliver a differentiated portfolio of high quality and affordable medicines to\n  i"}}, "page_text": "Share Price: APNASPENAspen Pharmacare Hldgs14486-49 (-0.34%) Search [ Our Response to Covid ][1] [ Country Sites ][2] * [About Aspen][3] ##### [ About Aspen ][4] * [ Corporate Governance ][5] * [ Regional Overviews ][6] * [ Our Leadership ][7] * [ Global Presence ][8] * [ Business Segments ][9] ##### [ Corporate Governance ][10] The Board is accountable to shareholders and other stakeholders and is ultimately responsible for the implementation of sound corporate governance practices throughout the Group. Aspen’s Board of Directors is committed to ensuring that the Group adheres to high standards of corporate governance in the conduct of its business. ##### [ Regional Overview ][11] * [ Africa Middle East ][12] * [ Americas ][13] * [ Asia ][14] * [ Australasia ][15] * [ Europe CIS ][16] ##### [ Business Segments ][17] * [ Prescription ][18] * [ Over the Counter ][19] * [ Injectables ][20] * [ Manufacturing ][21] ##### [ Manufacturing ][22] Aspen has 23 manufacturing facilities across 15 sites. Our strategic manufacturing sites are widely accredited, holding international approval from some of the most stringent global regulatory agencies. We manufacture a wide variety of product types including steriles, oral solid dose, liquids, semi-solids, biologicals and APIs. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][23] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][24] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][25] View or Download [ Read More » ][26] * [Investor Relations][27] ##### [ Investor Relations ][28] * [ Investor Hub ][29] * [ Financial Information ][30] * [ Financial Results and Presentations ][31] * [ Integrated Reporting ][32] * [ Share Price Information ][33] * [ Financial Calendar ][34] * [ SENS ][35] ##### [ Investor Relations ][36] Access our investor hub for information and tools including corporate reporting, share price, dividends, calendar, SENS and other relevant documents. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][37] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][38] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][39] View or Download [ Read More » ][40] * [We Care][41] ##### We Care * [ Ethics & Compliance Management ][42] * [ SED Initiatives ][43] * [ Mandela Day ][44] * [ Sustainability ][45] * [ Responsible Corporate Citizenship ][46] ##### Ethics & Compliance Management “A bright future beckons. The onus is on us, through hard work, honesty, and integrity, to reach for the stars. ” – Nelson Mandela ##### SED Initiatives Aspen has demonstrated an unwavering commitment to our credo ‘Healthcare. We Care” through a wide range of initiatives and activities that span more than two decades. ##### Mandela Day DURBAN – JSE Limited listed Aspen Pharmacare Holdings Limited (“Aspen”), a global specialty and branded pharmaceutical company, has hosted more than 800 activities over 12 years in celebration of the annual Nelson Mandela International Day (“Mandela Day”). ##### Our Sustainability Commitments We believe that doing business in a sustainable and responsible manner is integral to our purpose, our values and our philosophy “Healthcare. We Care”. Our sustainability commitments are integrated into the Group’s strategic objectives and underpin the way we do business. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][47] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][48] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][49] View or Download [ Read More » ][50] * [Careers][51] ##### [ Careers ][52] * [ Careers at Aspen ][53] * [ Aspen Jobs ][54] * [ Bursary Applications ][55] ##### [ High Performing, Inclusive Culture ][56] Our purpose is to deliver a differentiated portfolio of high quality and affordable medicines to improve the health and quality of life of patients across the markets we operate and how we show up every day to achieve this has shaped a culture of agility, high performance and inclusion. ##### Working At Aspen We believe that doing business in a sustainable and responsible manner is integral to our purpose, our values and our philosophy “Healthcare. We Care”. Our sustainability commitments are integrated into the Group’s strategic objectives and underpin the way we do business and how we show up every day, across the world. ##### Bursary Applications Aligned with our philosophy of “Healthcare. We Care”, Aspen supports education as a way of empowering people. We offer certain bursary opportunities in South Africa for specific qualifications offered at specific institutions. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][57] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][58] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][59] View or Download [ Read More » ][60] * [Media][61] ##### [ Media ][62] * [ Press Releases ][63] * [ Our Stories ][64] * [ Media Coverage ][65] ##### [ Aspen Holding News ][66] ## [Aspen Pharmacare expands access ambitions for HIV prevention across Africa through new ## agreement with MSD][67] ## [Aspen reaches more than 920 000 beneficiaries through Mandela Day][68] ## [Aspen Announces Successful Completion of Aspen APAC Divestment][69] ## [Aspen and Africa CDC advance long-term Vaccine Supply Partnership for Africa][70] ## [Aspen delivers encouraging results, driven by strong Commercial Pharma, reshaped Manufacturing ## and value realisation from APAC divestment][71] ## [Proposed divestment of Aspen Asia Pacific (excluding China) for R26.5 billion][72] ## [Stephen Saad receives both AABLA Lifetime Achievement Award and African of the Year Award][73] ## [Aspen highlights the rising diabetes disease burden][74] ## [Aspen building momentum in Commercial Pharmaceuticals and Manufacturing strategy modified][75] ## [Aspen celebrates 15 years of commitment to Nelson Mandela Day][76] ## [Aspen delivers strong results and advances its strategic ambitions][77] ## [Aspen announces local availability of Lilly’s Mounjaro][78] ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][79] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][80] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][81] View or Download [ Read More » ][82] * [Contact Us][83] * [About Aspen][84] ##### [ About Aspen ][85] * [ Corporate Governance ][86] * [ Regional Overviews ][87] * [ Our Leadership ][88] * [ Global Presence ][89] * [ Business Segments ][90] ##### [ Corporate Governance ][91] The Board is accountable to shareholders and other stakeholders and is ultimately responsible for the implementation of sound corporate governance practices throughout the Group. Aspen’s Board of Directors is committed to ensuring that the Group adheres to high standards of corporate governance in the conduct of its business. ##### [ Regional Overview ][92] * [ Africa Middle East ][93] * [ Americas ][94] * [ Asia ][95] * [ Australasia ][96] * [ Europe CIS ][97] ##### [ Business Segments ][98] * [ Prescription ][99] * [ Over the Counter ][100] * [ Injectables ][101] * [ Manufacturing ][102] ##### [ Manufacturing ][103] Aspen has 23 manufacturing facilities across 15 sites. Our strategic manufacturing sites are widely accredited, holding international approval from some of the most stringent global regulatory agencies. We manufacture a wide variety of product types including steriles, oral solid dose, liquids, semi-solids, biologicals and APIs. ### [ Live Webcast – Completion of the Aspen APAC Divestment ][104] Watch the Webcast [ Read More » ][105] ### [ FY2026 Interim Results Presentation ][106] View or Download [ Read More » ][107] * [Investor Relations][108] ##### [ Investor Relations ][109] * [ Investor Hub ][110] * [ Financi