commitments we have made.\n\nBranded, our MENA-based business, had an outstanding first half, growing revenue 15% and further\nstrengthening its market-leading position. It is truly best"}}, "page_text": "Skip to content LSE 1,638.15 GBp [Document hub][1] Country sites Back ## Our international presence [ Return to Hikma.com ][2] * [Algérie][3] * [Canada][4] * [Croatia][5] * [Egypt][6] * [France][7] * [Germany][8] * [Iraq][9] * [Italy][10] * [Jordan][11] * [KSA][12] * [Morocco][13] * [Netherlands][14] * [Portugal][15] * [Spain][16] * [Tunisia][17] * [UAE][18] * [UK][19] * [US][20] [ Contact Us ][21] * Who we are Back ## Who we are Learn more about our purpose, leadership team and commitment to excellence. [ Who we are ][22] * Overview Back [Overview][23] * [Strategy][24] * [Purpose and impact][25] * [Culture][26] * [Leadership][27] * [Corporate governance][28] * [History][29] * [Codes and ethical standards][30] * [Policy positions and statements][31] * What we do Back ## What we do Learn about our businesses, operations and product portfolio. [ What we do ][32] * [Diversified business model][33] * [R&D][34] * [Products][35] * Contract manufacturing Back [Contract manufacturing][36] * [Injectables contract manufacturing][37] * [Hikma Rx contract manufacturing][38] * [Partnering with Hikma][39] * [Hikma Ventures][40] * Responsibility Back ## Responsibility Learn more about our acting responsibly strategy and commitments to sustainable business. [ Responsibility ][41] * Advancing health and wellbeing Back [Advancing health and wellbeing][42] * [Access to medicines][43] * [Product quality and safety][44] * [Social Responsibility][45] * [Empowering our people][46] * [Protecting the environment ][47] * [Upholding ethical standards and acting with integrity][48] * [Partnerships and stakeholders][49] * [Awards and recognition][50] * [Suppliers][51] * [2025 Sustainability Report][52] * Investors Back ## Investors Learn more about our proven track record of value creation, strategy and investment case. [ Investors ][53] * [Recent results][54] * [Why invest][55] * [Strategy][56] * [Results and presentations][57] * Regulatory news Back [Regulatory news][58] * [Email alert sign-up][59] * Company compiled consensus Back [Company compiled consensus ][60] * [Analyst coverage][61] * [Financial calendar][62] * Investor tools Back [Investor tools][63] * [Share price lookup][64] * [Share graph][65] * [Share series][66] * [Investment calculator][67] * Shareholder information Back [Shareholder information][68] * [Manage your shareholding][69] * [Shareholder meetings][70] * [Dividend information][71] * [Share listings and depositary receipts][72] * [2025 Annual Report][73] * [Corporate factsheets][74] * Careers Back ## Careers Explore what makes Hikma an outstanding destination to further your career. [ Careers ][75] * [Search jobs][76] * [Roles at Hikma][77] * [Why Hikma][78] * [News][79] [ Contact Us ][80] SearchClose Search the Hikma world Submit ### Popular searches * Investors * Careers * Products * Injectables * Contract Close Open menu # Better health. Within reach. Every day. As a global pharmaceutical company, at Hikma we are creating high-quality products and making them accessible to those who need them, helping to shape a healthier world that enriches all our communities. [ Who we are ][81] Play video Transcript **Said Darwazah – Chief Executive Officer** Hello everyone. Today we announced our results for the first half of 2026, and I am pleased to report a strong performance, ahead of last year and in line with our expectations. I’m also pleased to say that we have reiterated our full-year guidance for 2026. This is an important milestone for Hikma and demonstrates that we are delivering against the commitments we have made. Branded, our MENA-based business, had an outstanding first half, growing revenue 15% and further strengthening its market-leading position. It is truly best-in-class and is an increasingly important driver of growth and profitability across the Group. As we promised, Hikma Rx also performed very well, with strong profit growth and significant margin expansion, well ahead of where we were in 2025. This performance was driven by our complex product offerings and our growing CMO business. In injectables, the actions we are taking are stabilising the business. We are deliberately increasing investment in R&D, our commercial platform and our manufacturing network in the US, Europe and MENA. These investments, along with the strengthening of our teams, will deliver an acceleration in absolute profit growth. We are increasingly agile. The more geographically aligned leadership structure we introduced this year is working well, bringing management closer to our markets and customers, and helping our teams act with greater speed and accountability. We have also taken clear, decisive action to increase R&D investment across the Group to accelerate the growth of our pipeline and focus the business on complex products with high barriers to entry. With strong fundamentals, disciplined execution and clear strategic priorities, we remain confident in our full-year guidance, and I’m energised about delivering on it over the rest of the year. I’m proud of the work we do at Hikma and the positive impact we have across the markets we operate in. We are the largest pharma company in MENA and we are also one of the largest suppliers of US-made generic medicines in the US. In addition, we have recently become the fourth largest supplier of injectables in Europe. We are focused on putting better health within reach for millions of people every day, and it is our talented colleagues who make this happen. I want to thank all of them for their excellent work in the first half of 2026. Thank you very much. **What we do** # For almost 50 years we’ve been creating high-quality medicines and making them accessible to the # people who need them. Learn more about how we do this across North America, MENA and Europe. [ Explore what we do ][82] **Investors** # Together we are building a leading generics and specialty pharmaceutical company where everyone # can thrive. Learn more about our strategy, investment case and track record of success. [ Explore investors ][83] **Responsibility** # At Hikma, being a responsible business and advancing our sustainability agenda is integral to how # we do business. Learn more about how we put better health within reach, every day and make a difference to people’s lives. [ Explore responsibility ][84] **Careers** # Join our team and help to make high-quality medicines accessible to patients who need them. We're looking for people who share our passion and want to help us make a real difference in the world. [ Explore careers ][85] What we do Investors Responsibility Careers ## Latest updates [ H1 2026 Interim Results ][86] [ Inside Hikma: putting people first. A new episode of Hikma's “Behind Better Health” podcast explores why employees join the global pharmaceutical company — and why they stay. ][87] [ Sustainability Report 2025 ][88] [ Why the world needs more companies like Hikma. By Said Darwazah, Chief Executive Officer ][89] [ Inside Injectables: A Q&A with Natheer Masarweh, SVP of Injectables Operations | Manufacturing Today ][90] [ Annual Report 2025 ][91] [ Full year 2025 results ][92] [ Exploring partnership opportunities with Hikma Pharmaceuticals. A Q&A with, Faisal Darwazeh VP of Group Business Development & Alliances ][93] [ European Injectables growth: a Q&A with Nassim Rahmani, Associate VP, Commercial Europe & Canada ][94] [ Strategic Priorities in Hikma Pharmaceuticals R&D: Q&A with Hafrun Fridriksdottir, President Rx and R&D ][95] [ Driving pharmaceutical excellence and growth in Pavia: A Q&A with Roberto Gagliano, General Manager, Hikma Italia ][96] [ Strategic insights into Hikma Injectables CMO: meeting partner expectations | Q&A with Tiago Duarte, AVP, CMO & Operations, Injectables division ][97] Previous Next 