][36]\n\n### Science compels us to push the boundaries of what is possible. We trust in the potential of\n### ideas and pursue them, alone and with others, until we have transformed the treatment of\n### disease.\n\n### AstraZeneca. What science can do.\n\n  \n\n### Quick Links\n\n[\n[Our Medicines Icon]\n\nOur Medicines\n\n][37] [\n[careers icon]\n\nCareers\n\n][38] [\n[community icon]\n\nCommunity\n\n][39]\n\n### [Global sites][40]\n\nThis website is intended for people seeking information on AstraZeneca's worldwide business. We also\nhave country sites; click the 'Global sites' link for the directory.\n\n \n\n \n\nVeeva ID: CA-6862\nDate of next review: August 2022\n\n### Quick Links\n* [CASL][41]\n* [Accessibility][42]\n* [Social Media Community Guidelines][43]\n* [Modern Slavery Statement][44]\n\n### Resources\n* [Site Map][45]\n\n### Social Media\n* [Twitter][46]\n\n#### utility links\n* [Contact Us][47]\n* [Legal Notice][48]\n* [Privacy Policy][49]\n* [Cookie policy][50]\n\n© AstraZeneca 2026\n\n**You are now leaving AstraZeneca.ca**\n\nYou have selected a link that will take you to an external site.\n\nAstraZeneca.ca provides this link as a service to website visitors. AstraZeneca.ca is not\nresponsible for the contents, capabilities or privacy policy of any external websites.\n\nWe encourage you to read the privacy policy of every wesbite you visit.\n\nClick 'cancel' to return to AstraZeneca's site or 'continue' to proceed.\n\n[Cancel][51] [Continue][52]\n\n**Important notice for users**\n\nYou are about to access AstraZeneca historic archive material. Any reference in these archives to\nAstraZeneca products or their uses may not reflect current medical knowledge and should not be used\nas a source of information on the present product label, efficacy data or safety data. Please refer\nto your approved national product label (SmPC) for current product information.\n\nI have read this warning and will not be using any of the contained product information for clinical\npurposes.\n\n[I disagree][53] [I agree][54]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: #navigation\n[3]: #footer\n[4]: /content/az-ca.html\n[5]: /content/az-ca/astrazeneca-in-canada.html\n[6]: /content/az-ca/astrazeneca-in-canada.html\n[7]: /content/az-ca/astrazeneca-in-canada/executive-team.html\n[8]: /content/az-ca/astrazeneca-in-canada/contact-us.html\n[9]: /content/az-ca/our-medicines.html\n[10]: https://medicalinformation.astrazeneca.ca/\n[11]: /content/az-ca/our-medicines.html\n[12]: /content/az-ca/our-medicines/focus-areas.html\n[13]: /content/az-ca/our-medicines/patient-assistance-program.html\n[14]: /content/az-ca/our-science.html\n[15]: /content/az-ca/our-science.html\n[16]: /content/az-ca/sustainability.html\n[17]: /content/az-ca/sustainability.html\n[18]: /content/az-ca/sustainability/improving-access"}}, "page_text": "* [Skip to content][1] * [Skip to navigation][2] * [ Skip to footer][3] [AstraZeneca logo] [AstraZeneca logo] [ [AstraZeneca logo] [AstraZeneca logo] ][4] Search Menu Search Search Search Close * [ AZ in Canada ][5] * [ AZ in Canada ][6] * [ Executive Team ][7] * [ Contact Us ][8] * [ Our Medicines ][9] * [ Medical Information for Healthcare Professionals ][10] * [ Our Medicines ][11] * [ Focus Areas ][12] * [ Patient Assistance Program ][13] * [ Our Science ][14] * [ Our Science ][15] * [ Sustainability ][16] * [ Sustainability ][17] * [ Improving Access to Care ][18] * [ Requesting Support ][19] * [ Employee Giving and Volunteerism ][20] * [ Eureka Fellowship ][21] * [ Media ][22] * [ Media Contacts ][23] * [ Press Releases ][24] * [ Articles ][25] * [ Fact Sheets ][26] * [ Working at AZ Canada ][27] * [ Total Rewards ][28] * [ Coffee Chat Videos ][29] * [ Search Jobs ][30] * [ Current Positions ][31] * More Hide * ENGLISH Canada(en) * You are in AstraZeneca.ca * [English][32] * [French][33] Close * [AstraZeneca Websites][34] * [ Global site][35] # Welcome to AstraZeneca Canada # # At AstraZeneca, each and every one of us is bold in the belief that 