DA Rs 902 Cr", "Q1FY27 Net Profit Rs 141 Cr", "Biopharma Revenue up 17%", "Aiming to reach a billion patients worldwide"], "employee_count": null}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": []}, "intel": "Biocon is a global biopharmaceutical leader headquartered in India, with a strong emphasis on affordable innovation. The company operates across generics, biosimilars, novel biologics, and research services. Recent Q1FY27 results show healthy growth with total income up 9% and biopharma revenue up 17%, indicating strong performance in its core segments. Biocon's global footprint includes a presence in Malaysia and a mission to reach a billion patients. For deeper competitive intelligence, consider analyzing its biosimilar portfolio, partnerships, and pipeline details from the investor presentations and annual report linked on the site.", "location": {"offices": ["Malaysia"], "countries": ["India", "Malaysia"], "regions_served": ["Worldwide"]}, "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Biocon — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Developing biosimilar GLP-1 RAs, owns/markets branded drugs. | Developing biosimilar GLP-1 RAs | India | Bengaluru, India", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "47", "Y Score": "47", "Overall Score": "47", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Blau Farmacêutica", "Website": "https://www.blau.com.br", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Cotia, Brazil", "Continent / Geography": "LATAM(Brazil)", "Operational Presence": "Brazil", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Exhibits at Brazilian trade shows (e.g., FCE Cosmetique, Hospitalar) and markets GLP-1 products in Brazil.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commer