zerPro for Professionals][39]\n    \n    [Patient Assistance Programs][40]\n    \n    [Distributors][41]\n    * [Pfizer Distributors][42]\n* [Stories][43]\n  * [Articles][44]\n    \n    [Behind the Science Features][45]\n    \n    [Scientist Stories][46]\n    \n    [Patient Stories][47]\n    \n    [Colleague Stories][48]\n    \n    [Podcasts][49]\n* [Newsroom][50]\n  * [Press Releases][51]\n    \n    [Media Asset Library][52]\n    \n    [Updates and Statements][53]\n    \n    [Partnering News][54]\n    \n    [Media Contacts][55]\n* [About][56]\n  * [Leadership][57]\n    \n    [Purpose & History][58]\n    \n    [Responsibility][59]\n    * [Responsible Business][60]\n    * [Global Impact][61]\n    * [Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion][62]\n    * [Environmental Sustainability][63]\n    * [Health & Safety][64]\n    * [Global HCP/HCO/PO Transparency Reporting][65]\n    * [Misinformation][66]\n    * [Antimicrobial Resistance][67]\n    \n    [Principles & Positions][68]\n    * [Ethics & Compliance][69]\n    * [Political Partnership][70]\n    * [Prescription Value & Pricing][71]\n    * [Policy Positions][72]\n    * [Ready for Cures][73]\n    \n    [Partnering with Others][74]\n    * [Funding Global Health Through Grants][75]\n    * [Patient Advocacy & Engagement][76]\n    * [Working with Healthcare Professionals][77]\n    * [Research and Business Development Partnerships][78]\n    * [Venture Investments][79]\n    * [Supplier & Business-to-Business Resources][80]\n    * [Pfizer CentreOne][81]\n\n[ Investors ][82][ Media ][83][ Careers ][84][ Partners ][85]\n[ Contact Us ][86]\n* [Careers][87]\n* [Investors][88]\nSearch\n[ Contact Us ][89]\nChanged\nChanged\nHow can we help you?\n**0** search results for\nSuggestions within Pfizer.com\nHeader close\nHeader close\n[ Pfizer_LabToLifeManufacturing_HomepageBanner_080626_1440x710_b.jpg ]\n\n# The Manufacturing Work That Enables Patient Access\n\nBehind every medicine is a global network ensuring quality, scale, and delivery. Discover how Pfizer\nturns innovation into patient impact worldwide.\n\n \n\n[Explore the Science of Manufacturing][90]\n\n[Photograph of a woman smiling as a child lifts a toy plane toward the sky.]\n\n#### Pfizer's 2025 Impact Report\n\nEvery year, we take stock of the impact our work has on the world, the environment, and people\nthemselves.\n\n[Read the report][91]\n\nArticles [More articles > ][92]\n[Listening to the Hemophilia Community: Pfizer Survey Reveals Unspoken Compromises][93]\n[Direct Relief and The Pfizer Foundation Expand Support for Community Health Centers on the Front\nLines of Infectious Disease Care ][94]\n[How Pfizer Thinks About AI][95]\nPress Releases [More press releases > ][96]\n[Pfizer Reports Second-Quarter Results And Raises Midpoint of 2026 Revenue Guidance][97] |\n08.04.2026\n[Pfizer Announces Positive Topline Phase 3 Results for LITFULO in "}}, "page_text": "Sorry, you need to enable JavaScript to visit this website. [ Skip to main content ][1] [[Pfizer logo]][2] * [Science][3] * [Clinical Trials][4] * [Guide to Clinical Trials][5] * [Clinical Trials in Children][6] * [Data and Results][7] * [Integrity and Transparency][8] * [Diversity][9] * [Plain Language Study Results ][10] * [Expanded Access & Compassionate Use][11] [Find a Trial][12] [Areas of Focus][13] * [Internal Medicine][14] * [Inflammation & Immunology][15] * [Vaccines][16] * [Oncology][17] [Diseases & Conditions][18] [Product Pipeline][19] [Research Sites][20] * [Products][21] * [How Drugs are Made][22] * [Branded vs. Generic][23] * [Biologics & Biosimilars][24] * [Commitment to Quality][25] * [Global Supply][26] * [Manufacturing Sites][27] [Medicine Safety][28] * [Health Literacy][29] * [Treatment Choices][30] * [Partnering With Patients][31] * [Tips for Patients][32] * [Reporting Adverse Events][33] * [Counterfeiting][34] * [Product Safety][35] [Product List][36] [Product Contacts][37] [PfizerForAll][38] [PfizerPro for Professionals][39] [Patient Assistance Programs][40] [Distributors][41] * [Pfizer Distributors][42] * [Stories][43] * [Articles][44] [Behind the Science Features][45] [Scientist Stories][46] [Patient Stories][47] [Colleague Stories][48] [Podcasts][49] * [Newsroom][50] * [Press Releases][51] [Media Asset Library][52] [Updates and Statements][53] [Partnering News][54] [Media Contacts][55] * [About][56] * [Leadership][57] [Purpose & History][58] [Responsibility][59] * [Responsible Business][60] * [Global Impact][61] * [Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion][62] * [Environmental Sustainability][63] * [Health & Safety][64] * [Global HCP/HCO/PO Transparency Reporting][65] * [Misinformation][66] * [Antimicrobial Resistance][67] [Principles & Positions][68] * [Ethics & Compliance][69] * [Political Partnership][70] * [Prescription Value & Pricing][71] * [Policy Positions][72] * [Ready for Cures][73] [Partnering with Others][74] * [Funding Global Health Through Grants][75] * [Patient Advocacy & Engagement][76] * [Working with Healthcare Professionals][77] * [Research and Business Development Partnerships][78] * [Venture Investments][79] * [Supplier & Business-to-Business Resources][80] * [Pfizer CentreOne][81] [ Investors ][82][ Media ][83][ Careers ][84][ Partners ][85] [ Contact Us ][86] * [Careers][87] * [Investors][88] Search [ Contact Us ][89] Changed Changed How can we help you? **0** search results for Suggestions within Pfizer.com Header close Header close [ Pfizer_LabToLifeManufacturing_HomepageBanner_080626_1440x710_b.jpg ] # The Manufacturing Work That Enables Patient Access Behind every medicine is a global network ensuring quality, scale, and delivery. Discover how Pfizer turns innovation into patient impact worldwide. [Explore the Science of Manufacturing][90] [Photograph of a woman smiling as a child lifts a toy plane toward the sky.] #### Pfizer's 2025 Impact Report Every year, we take stock of the impact our work has on the world, the environment, and people themselves. [Read the report][91] Articles [More articles > ][92] [Listening to the Hemophilia Community: Pfizer Survey Reveals Unspoken Compromises][93] [Direct Relief and The Pfizer Foundation Expand Support for Community Health Centers on the Front Lines of Infectious Disease Care ][94] [How Pfizer Thinks About AI][95] Press Releases [More press releases > ][96] [Pfizer Reports Second-Quarter Results And Raises Midpoint of 2026 Revenue Guidance][97] | 08.04.2026 [Pfizer Announces Positive Topline Phase 3 Results for LITFULO in Patients with Nonsegmental Vitiligo][98] | 07.30.2026 [European Commission Authorizes Pfizer and BioNTech XFG-adapted COVID-19 Vaccine in the European Union][99] | 07.29.2026 ### Products Every product is the result of 1,500 scientists overseeing more than 500,000 lab tests and over 36 clinical trials before the first prescription. Product [Browse All Products][100] ### Pfizer RxPathways Pfizer RxPathways connects eligible patients to a range of assistance programs that offer insurance support, co-pay help, and medicines for free or at a savings. [ Explore RxPathways Details][101] Pipeline Snapshot as of August 4, 2026 * [00Phase 1][102] * [00Phase 2][103] * [00Phase 3][104] * [00Registration][105] * [00 Total][106] [Explore the Product Pipeline][107][Download Complete Pipeline PDF][108] [pipeline animated GIF lines loading in 3D] Areas of Focus #### Revolutionary medicines enable us to enrich and extend life for people living with all types of #### diseases. [Internal medicine graphical thumbnail portrait image 2] ##### [ Internal Medicine ][109] [ View All Internal Medicine ][110] We’re developing therapies to treat, slow, or prevent disease progression and improve the quality of life for patients with obesity, type 2 diabetes, and cardiovascular and kidney diseases. [Inflammation and Immunology graphical thumbnail portrait image 3] ##### [ Inflammation & Immunology ][111] [ View All Inflammation & Immunology ][112] We look for treatments that provide more than just symptom relief, in order to address the root cause of chronic inflammatory diseases at a molecular level [Vaccine graphical thumbnail portrait image 4] ##### [ Vaccines ][113] [ View All Vaccines ][114] Vaccines are the single most important innovation in the science of health to significantly reduce the threat of diseases that were once widespread and oftentimes fatal. [Vaccines][115] [Milestones][116] [Pipeline & Clinical Trials ][117] [Oncology graphical thumbnail portrait image 5] ##### [ Oncology ][118] [ View All Oncology ][119] Cancer treatment needs to be transformed across the entire landscape to significantly improve the lives of cancer patients worldwide. [Oncology][120] [Biology into medicine][121] [Advocacy][122] [Global Impact][123] Button previous Button next ## About #### Starting with Charles Pfizer inventing an almond-flavored antiparasite medicine in 1849, our #### people have always been innovators and trailblazers, committed to finding the next cure. [ Learn More About Us Details][124] #### An Accord for a Healthier World Where people live shouldn’t impact the quality of their healthcare and income shouldn’t determine health outcomes. [ Learn More About The Accord Details][125] [Accord for healthier world globe] [Accord for healthier world globe] ### Sign Up for ### **communications from Pfizer** Receive the latest news from Pfizer in our monthly The Breakthrough newsletter and email alerts on a variety of topics. [ Sign up now Details][126] [[Pfizer: One of the world’s premier biopharmaceutical companies]][127] * ###### [ Investors ][128] * ###### [ Media ][129] * ###### [ Careers ][130] * ###### [ Partners ][131] * [ PfizerForAll ][132] * [ Healthcare Professionals ][133] * [ Grant Seekers ][134] * [ Supplier & B2B Resources ][135] * [ Privacy Statement ][136] * [ Accessibility Statement ][137] * [ Terms of Use ][138] * [ Contact Us ][139] Close ### Glossary * © 2026 Pfizer Inc. All rights reserved This information—including product information—is intended only for residents 