by 2035: cancer, c"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] [][2] * [Stories][3] * [Careers][4] * [Contact][5] [][6] [][7] * About Roche * [About Roche][8] * Business * Governance * Sustainability * [Roche Global Citizenship][9] * [Strategy][10] * [Leadership][11] * [History][12] * Solutions * [Solutions][13] * Focus areas * Pharma solutions * Diagnostic solutions * [Product Development Pipeline][14] * Innovation * [Innovation][15] * Partnering * Ethical standards * Team and structure * [Innovation process][16] * [Clinical trials][17] * Investors * [Investors][18] * [Investor updates][19] * [Investor events][20] * [Reporting][21] * [Finance Information Tool][22] * [Share and Bond information][23] * [Download center][24] * [Frequently asked questions][25] * Media * [Media][26] * [Media releases][27] * [Media events][28] * [Media statements][29] * [Media library][30] * About Roche * [About Roche][31] * Business * [Business][32] * [Diagnostics][33] * [Pharma][34] * Governance * [Governance][35] * [Annual general meetings][36] * [Board of directors][37] * [Committees][38] * [Executive committee][39] * [Code of conduct][40] * Sustainability * [Sustainability][41] * [Approach][42] * [Goals and performance][43] * [ESG index][44] * [Safety health and wellbeing][45] * [Roche Global Citizenship][46] * [Strategy][47] * [Leadership][48] * [History][49] * Solutions * [Solutions][50] * Focus areas * [Focus areas][51] * [Cardiometabolic][52] * [Haematology][53] * [Diabetes][54] * [Immunology][55] * [Infectious diseases][56] * [Inflammatory bowel diseases][57] * [Neurology][58] * [Oncology][59] * [Ophthalmology][60] * [Respiratory][61] * [Women's health][62] * Pharma solutions * [Pharma solutions][63] * [Safety reporting][64] * Diagnostic solutions * [Diagnostic solutions][65] * [Safety officers][66] * [Product Development Pipeline][67] * Innovation * [Innovation][68] * Partnering * [Partnering][69] * [Pharma][70] * [Diagnostics][71] * [Areas of interest][72] * Ethical standards * [Ethical standards][73] * [Advisory][74] * [Animal research][75] * [Genetics][76] * Team and structure * [Team and structure][77] * [R&D locations][78] * [Innovation process][79] * [Clinical trials][80] * Investors * [Investors][81] * [Investor updates][82] * [Investor events][83] * [Reporting][84] * [Finance Information Tool][85] * [Share and Bond information][86] * [Download center][87] * [Frequently asked questions][88] * Media * [Media][89] * [Media releases][90] * [Media events][91] * [Media statements][92] * [Media library][93] * [Stories][94] * [Careers][95] * [Contact][96] Worldwide ## Doing now what patients need next Pioneering diagnostics and pharma to create a healthier future for everyone [ Read our story ][97] [ About Roche ][98] [A family gathers around an outdoor table, enjoying a meal. A man hugs a smiling boy, while two women sit nearby, all appearing content and joyful.] ## In the spotlight [Roche publishes its half year results for 2026][99] Roche reports +6% (CER) sales growth in the first six months of 2026. Commenting on the results, CEO Thomas Schinecker said: “Our strong momentum continued in the first half of the year, driven by a 6% sales increase at constant exchange rates and significant positive pipeline development.” [How we improved outcomes for patients around the world][100] With our combined strengths in Diagnostic and Pharmaceuticals, we worked to provide real and positive change for patients, the people they love and the professionals who care for them. Discover the highlights in our Annual Report. [ Visit Media center ][101] > Our two divisions are focusing jointly on three disease areas that will account for almost 50% of > the global disease burden by 2035: cancer, cardiovascular-metabolic diseases and neurological > diseases. [Portrait of Thomas Schinecker] Dr Thomas Schinecker CEO Roche Group ## Investor information [ Visit Investor center ][102] Sales by HY 2026 ### [CHF 30.4 billion][103] Finance Information Tool Dividend Yield for FY 2025 ### [3.2%][104] Share and Bond Information Next Report ### [22 October 2026][105] Reporting ## We are Roche We combine life-changing diagnostics and medicines to take on the toughest healthcare challenges, those that place the greatest strain on patients, families, communities, and health systems. Guided by the experiences of patients, we are determined to prevent, stop and cure diseases so people can live healthier, longer lives. [Man holding a surfing board smiling with a ocean in the background.] ## Our mission in action * [Two colleagues sit on a green couch in a modern office, engaged in conversation. One person gestures while speaking, and the other listens attentively with a slight smile.] Prevent ### [Identifying high-risk patients][106] We prevent diseases by identifying high-risk patients early to enable timely use of medicines. Our strategy * [A laboratory scientist wearing safety glasses and gloves looks into a microscope while conducting research in a lab setting.] Stop ### [Halting disease progression][107] We stop disease progression by accurately diagnosing patients and delivering targeted medicines. Our diagnostics solutions * [A laboratory professional wearing glasses and gloves explains a piece of equipment to a colleague while holding its open lid in a lab setting.] Cure ### [Restoring health through medicines][108] We cure diseases by identifying the cause of a patient’s condition and restoring health through curative medicines. Our pharma solutions ## Read our stories [ View all stories ][109] [A person faces a landscape of blue mountains, with a large eye symbol above, conveying vision and insight. The sky is clear with a small cloud.] ### Our holistic ophthalmology vision: From prevention to vision restoration How AI and Real-World Data are unlocking innovation to address high-burden eye diseases at scale [ Read the story ][110] [Decorative Illustration] ### [Transforming autoimmune treatment: How data-driven therapies are changing patient ### outcomes][111] Three diseases. One mission. Roche combines breakthrough technologies with deep immunology expertise and real-world data to transform treatment for lupus, IBD, and COPD [Decorative illustration] ### [Haemophilia treatment for all: A partnership for better access][112] The Humanitarian Aid Program, a landmark initiative led by the World Federation of Hemophilia (WFH) and supported by partners including Roche, is working to ensure that people with bleeding disorders in developing countries can access the diagnosis, treatment and care they need. ## Shape the future of healthcare Join our global team of innovators, scientists, and changemakers [ Explore Careers ][113] [ Inclusion and Belonging at Roche ][114] [A gloved hand holds a petri dish with gold-colored bacterial colonies on a reddish-brown medium, suggesting a laboratory experiment.] ### [About Roche][115] We unite leading science and technology across diagnostics, medicines, and digital solutions to prevent, stop and cure diseases. [Abstract close-up of geometric shapes with vibrant pink and orange hues. A pattern of glowing circles creates an energetic and modern feel.] ### [Solutions][116] We are committed to tackling the most complex healthcare challenges that place the greatest strain on people and societies worldwide. [3D Insights into Novel Cancer Models.] ### [Innovation][117] In everything we do, we are guided by the needs of patients and their loved ones, acting with integrity, courage and passion. [Close-up of a microplate with multiple wells, each being filled by thin metallic pipettes. The setting is a laboratory environment, conveying precision.] ### [Media][118] Access a wide range of materials relating to our company, our people, innovation, solutions and diagnostics tools or get in touch with us. [Modern indoor space with large windows, wooden walls, and hanging lights. Curved planter with lush green ferns and plants creates a refreshing atmosphere.] ### [Investors][119] We are committed to delivering value for all our stakeholders through continuous innovation, groundbreaking solutions, trust and sustainable business practices. * [Contact][120] * [Locations][121] ### Helpful links * [Pharma solutions][122] * [Upcoming events][123] * [Annual Report 2025][124] * [Report a potential side effect][125] ### Roche websites * [Diagnostics portal][126] * [Suppliers information][127] * [Roche around the world][128] * [Patients and clinical trials platform][129] * [ linkedin][130] * [ facebook][131] * [ twitter][132] * [ instagram][133] * [ youtube][134] * [Privacy notice][135] * [Legal statement][136] * [Accessibility statement][137] * [Social Media guidelines][138] * Cookies © F. Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd This website contains information on products which is targeted to a wide range of audiences and could contain product details or information otherwise not accessible or valid in your country. Please be aware that we do not take any responsibility for accessing such information which may not comply with any legal process, regulation, registration or usage in the country of your origin. [1]: #main-content [2]: / [3]: /stories [4]: https://careers.roche.com [5]: /contact [6]: /search [7]: /search [8]: /about [9]: /about/roche-global-citizenship [10]: /about/strategy [11]: /about/leadership [12]: /about/history [13]: /solutions [14]: /solutions/pipeline [15]: /innovation [16]: /innovation/process [17]: /innovation/clinical-trials [18]: /investors [19]: /investors/updates [20]: /investors/events [21]: /investors/reports [22]: /investors/rofis [23]: /investors/bonds [24]: /investors/downloads [25]: /investors/faq_investors [26]: /media [27]: /media/releases [28]: /media/events [29]: /media/statements [30]: /media/library-images [31]: /about [32]: /about/business [33]: /about/business/diagnostics [34]: /about/business/pharmaceuticals [35]: /about/governance [36]: /about/governance/annual-general-meetings [37]: /about/governance/board-of-directors [38]: /about/governance/committees [39]: /about/governance/executive-committee [40]: /about/governance/code-of-conduct [41]: /about/sustainability [42]: /about/sustainability/approach [43]: /about/sustainability/goals-performance [44]: /about/sustainability/esg-index [45]: /about/sustainability/safety-health-and-well-being [46]: /about/roche-global-citizenship [47]: /about/strategy [48]: /about/leadership [49]: /about/history [50]: /solutions [51]: /solutions/focus-areas [52]: /solutions/focus-areas/cardiometabolic [53]: /solutions/focus-areas/haematology [54]: /solutions/focus-areas/diabetes [55]: /solutions/focus-areas/immunology [56]: /solutions/focus-areas/infectious-diseases [57]: /solutions/focus-areas/inflammatory-bowel-diseases [58]: /solutions/focus-areas/neurology [59]: /solutions/focus-areas/oncology [60]: /solutions/focus-areas/ophthalmology [61]: /solutions/focus-areas/respiratory [62]: /solutions/focus-areas/womens-health [63]: /solutions/pharma [64]: /solutions/pharma/safety-reporting [65]: /solutions/diagnostics [66]: /solutions/diagnostics/safety-officers [67]: /solutions/pipeline [68]: /innovation [69]: /innovation/partnering [70]: /innovation/partnering/pharma [71]: /innovation/partnering/diagnostics [72]: /innovation/partnering/areas-of-interest [73]: /innovation/ethical-standards [74]: /innovation/ethical-standards/advisory [75]: /innovation/ethical-standards/animal-research [76]: /innovation/ethical-standards/genetics [77]: /innovation/structure [78]: /innovation/structure/rnd-locations [79]: /innovation/process [80]: /innovation/clinical-trials [81]: /investors [82]", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Roche — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Acquired GLP-1 RA assets, owns them. | Acquired GLP-1 RA assets | Switzerland | Basel, Switzerland", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "43", "Y Score": "51", "Overall Score": "47", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Challengers"}, {"Company": "Adocia", "Website": "https://www.adocia.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Lyon, France, Its", "Continent / Geography": "EU(France)", "Operational Presence": "France", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops innovative GLP-1 RA delivery systems", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "FR", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Adocia — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Develops innovative GLP-1 RA delivery systems, likely owns technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "adocia.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "adocia.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ [Adocia] [Adocia] ][1]\n* [Adocia][2]\n  * [About][3]\n  * [History][4]\n  * [Management][5]\n  * [Board of directors][6]\n  * [Advisory board][7]\n* [Products and platforms][8]\n  * [Pipeline][9]\n  * [Technology Platforms][10]\n* [Careers][11]\n  * [The « Adocians »][12]\n  * [HR policy][13]\n  * [Work environment][14]\n  * [Join us][15]\n* [Partnering][16]\n* [Investors][17]\n* [Media][18]\n* [Contact][19]\n  * [Contact us][20]\n  * [Map and accessibility][21]\n* [Investors][22]\n  * [Press releases][23]\n  * [Events and presentations][24]\n  * [Regulated information][25]\n  * [Stock information][26]\n  * [Corporate governance][27]\n  * [General meeting][28]\n* [News][29]\n  * [Press releases][30]\n  * [Scientific resources][31]\n  * [Videos][32]\n* [ EN][33]\n  * [ FR][34]\n[Rechercher]\n[Rechercher]\n\n# Innovative medicine for everyone everywhere\n\nAdocia is a clinical-stage biotechnology company specialized in the development of innovative\ntreatments for diabetes and obesity.\n\n[ Learn more [Arrow right] ][35]\n\n[**Share Capital Increase**\nAccess to information][36]\n\n## Products\n## & platforms\n\nRelying on disruptive technologies with strong intellectual property strategies, Adocia products and\nplatforms range from innovative formulations of already-approved peptides and proteins to\nimmunoprotective scaffold for cell therapies.\n\n[ Contact us [Arrow right] ][37]\n[\nPipeline see more\n][38]\n[\nTECHNOLOGY PLATFORMS see more\n][39]\n\n## Adocia\n## presentation\n\nSince its inception by the Soula family in 2005, Adocia has built a unique expertise in the field of\ndiabetes and obesity. Adocia primary focus lies in developing innovative formulations of insulins\nand other metabolic hormones. With the ambition of becoming a leading player in hormonal treatments,\nAdocia has established a diverse pipeline of specialty products designed for the treatment of type 1\nand type 2 diabetes as well as obesity.\n\n[ Discover [Arrow right] ][40]\n\n## Partnering\n\nAdocia licenses-out its products and technologies after having established the proof-of-concept in\nhuman. Interested in partnering with us? Please reach out!\n\n[ See more [Arrow right] ][41]\n\n## Media\n\n[\n07/23/2026\n[Icon download]\nADOCIA Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Provides a Business Update\n][42] [\n07/03/2026\n[Icon download]\nADOCIA Announces the Expiration of Exclusive Right to Negotiate Partnership for M1Pram with SANOFI\n][43] [\n06/08/2026\n[Icon download]\nADOCIA Announces THDB0206 (BioChaperone® Lispro) Phase 3 Data in Type 2 Diabetes Presented at ADA\n86th Scientific Sessions, Confirming the Positive Results Previously Announced in July 2025\n][44] [\n06/04/2026\n[Icon download]\nAdocia Announces a Virtual KOL Event to Review the Phase 3 Results of the Ultra-Rapid Insulin\nBioChaperone® Lispro on June 16, 2026\n][45] [\n05/12/2026\n[Icon download]\nADOCIA Reports First Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Provides a Business Update\n][46] [\n05/11/2026\n[Icon download]\nADOCIA Announces its Annual Shareholders’ Meeting to be Held on June 3rd, 2026 in Paris\n][47]\n[See all][48]\n[ [Adocia] ][49]\n* [Adocia][50]\n* [Products and platforms][51]\n* [Careers][52]\n* [Partnering][53]\n* [Investors][54]\n* [Media][55]\n* [Contact][56]\nContact us\n[+33(0)4 72 610 610][57] [contact@adocia.com][58]\n\nAdocia\n115 Avenue Lacassagne\n69003 Lyon, France\n\n2026 © Adocia\n* [Site plan][59]\n* [Legal notice][60]\n* [Privacy policy and cookies policy][61]\n* [Managing cookies][62]\n\nWebsite by [[Un Brin de Campagne]Un Brin de Campagne][63]\nManage cookie consent\nTo provide the best experiences, we use technologies such as cookies to store and/or access device\ninformation. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing\nbehavior or unique IDs on this site. Failure to consent or withdrawing consent may adversely affect\ncertain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nThe storage or technical access is strictly necessary for the purpose of legitimate interest to\nallow the use of a specific service explicitly reque"}}, "page_text": "[ [Adocia] [Adocia] ][1] * [Adocia][2] * [About][3] * [History][4] * [Management][5] * [Board of directors][6] * [Advisory board][7] * [Products and platforms][8] * [Pipeline][9] * [Technology Platforms][10] * [Careers][11] * [The « Adocians »][12] * [HR policy][13] * [Work environment][14] * [Join us][15] * [Partnering][16] * [Investors][17] * [Media][18] * [Contact][19] * [Contact us][20] * [Map and accessibility][21] * [Investors][22] * [Press releases][23] * [Events and presentations][24] * [Regulated information][25] * [Stock information][26] * [Corporate governance][27] * [General meeting][28] * [News][29] * [Press releases][30] * [Scientific resources][31] * [Videos][32] * [ EN][33] * [ FR][34] [Rechercher] [Rechercher] # Innovative medicine for everyone everywhere Adocia is a clinical-stage biotechnology company specialized in the development of innovative treatments for diabetes and obesity. [ Learn more [Arrow right] ][35] [**Share Capital Increase** Access to information][36] ## Products ## & platforms Relying on disruptive technologies with strong intellectual property strategies, Adocia products and platforms range from innovative formulations of already-approved peptides and proteins to immunoprotective scaffold for cell therapies. [ Contact us [Arrow right] ][37] [ Pipeline see more ][38] [ TECHNOLOGY PLATFORMS see more ][39] ## Adocia ## presentation Since its inception by the Soula family in 2005, Adocia has built a unique expertise in the field of diabetes and obesity. Adocia primary focus lies in developing innovative formulations of insulins and other metabolic hormones. With the ambition of becoming a leading player in hormonal treatments, Adocia has established a diverse pipeline of specialty products designed for the treatment of type 1 and type 2 diabetes as well as obesity. [ Discover [Arrow right] ][40] ## Partnering Adocia licenses-out its products and technologies after having established the proof-of-concept in human. Interested in partnering with us? Please reach out! [ See more [Arrow right] ][41] ## Media [ 07/23/2026 [Icon download] ADOCIA Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Provides a Business Update ][42] [ 07/03/2026 [Icon download] ADOCIA Announces the Expiration of Exclusive Right to Negotiate Partnership for M1Pram with SANOFI ][43] [ 06/08/2026 [Icon download] ADOCIA Announces THDB0206 (BioChaperone® Lispro) Phase 3 Data in Type 2 Diabetes Presented at ADA 86th Scientific Sessions, Confirming the Positive Results Previously Announced in July 2025 ][44] [ 06/04/2026 [Icon download] Adocia Announces a Virtual KOL Event to Review the Phase 3 Results of the Ultra-Rapid Insulin BioChaperone® Lispro on June 16, 2026 ][45] [ 05/12/2026 [Icon download] ADOCIA Reports First Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Provides a Business Update ][46] [ 05/11/2026 [Icon download] ADOCIA Announces its Annual Shareholders’ Meeting to be Held on June 3rd, 2026 in Paris ][47] [See all][48] [ [Adocia] ][49] * [Adocia][50] * [Products and platforms][51] * [Careers][52] * [Partnering][53] * [Investors][54] * [Media][55] * [Contact][56] Contact us [+33(0)4 72 610 610][57] [contact@adocia.com][58] Adocia 115 Avenue Lacassagne 69003 Lyon, France 2026 © Adocia * [Site plan][59] * [Legal notice][60] * [Privacy policy and cookies policy][61] * [Managing cookies][62] Website by [[Un Brin de Campagne]Un Brin de Campagne][63] Manage cookie consent To provide the best experiences, we use technologies such as cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Failure to consent or withdrawing consent may adversely affect certain features and functions. Functional Functional Always active The storage or technical access is strictly necessary for the purpose of legitimate interest to allow the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of communication over an electronic communications network. Préférences Préférences Le stockage ou l’accès technique est nécessaire dans la finalité d’intérêt légitime de stocker des préférences qui ne sont pas demandées par l’abonné ou l’utilisateur. Statistiques Statistiques Storage or technical access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes. Le stockage ou l’accès technique qui est utilisé exclusivement dans des finalités statistiques anonymes. En l’absence d’une assignation à comparaître, d’une conformité volontaire de la part de votre fournisseur d’accès à internet ou d’enregistrements supplémentaires provenant d’une tierce partie, les informations stockées ou extraites à cette seule fin ne peuvent généralement pas être utilisées pour vous identifier. Marketing Marketing The storage or technical access is necessary to create user profiles in order to send advertisements, or to follow the user on a website or on several websites with similar marketing purposes. * [Manage options][64] * [Manage services][65] * [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][66] * [Read more about these purposes][67] Accept Refuse See preferences Save preferences [See preferences][68] * [{title}][69] * [{title}][70] * [{title}][71] Manage cookie consent [1]: https://www.adocia.com/ [2]: https://www.adocia.com/adocia/ [3]: https://www.adocia.com/adocia/about/ [4]: https://www.adocia.com/adocia/story/ [5]: https://www.adocia.com/adocia/management/ [6]: https://www.adocia.com/adocia/board-of-direction/ [7]: https://www.adocia.com/adocia/advisory-board/ [8]: https://www.adocia.com/products-and-platform/pipeline-2/ [9]: https://www.adocia.com/products-and-platform/pipeline-2/ [10]: https://www.adocia.com/products-and-platform/technology-platforms/ [11]: /career/adocia-team/ [12]: https://www.adocia.com/careers/adocia-team/ [13]: https://www.adocia.com/careers/hr-policy/ [14]: https://www.adocia.com/careers/work-environment/ [15]: https://www.adocia.com/careers/adocia-careers/ [16]: https://www.adocia.com/partnering/ [17]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/ [18]: https://www.adocia.com/medias-publications/ [19]: https://www.adocia.com/contact/ [20]: https://www.adocia.com/contact/ [21]: https://www.adocia.com/access-contact/ [22]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/ [23]: https://www.adocia.com/medias-publications/?_categories=press-releases&_press_type=general [24]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/events-and-presentations/ [25]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/regulated-information/ [26]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/stock-information/ [27]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/governance/ [28]: https://www.adocia.com/investors/general-meeting/ [29]: https://www.adocia.com/medias-publications/ [30]: