ssify": {"summary": "Adocia — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Develops innovative GLP-1 RA delivery systems, likely owns technology. | Develops innovative GLP-1 RA delivery systems | France | Lyon, France, Its", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "43", "Y Score": "50", "Overall Score": "46", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Challengers"}, {"Company": "AstraZeneca Pharmaceuticals LP", "Website": "https://www.astrazeneca-us.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Wilmington, Delaware, USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Markets GLP-1 receptor agonists in the U.S.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "AstraZeneca Pharmaceuticals LP — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: AstraZeneca Pharmaceuticals LP is the U.S. affiliate of AstraZeneca, which markets GLP-1 receptor agonists like Bydureon.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "astrazeneca-us.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "astrazeneca-us.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [Skip to content][1]\n* [skip to navigation][2]\n[AstraZeneca logo] [AstraZeneca logo]\n[ [AstraZeneca logo] [AstraZeneca logo] ][3]\nSearch Menu\nSearch Search Search Close\n* [ About Us ][4]\n  * [ AstraZeneca in the US ][5]\n  * [ Our Leadership ][6]\n  * [ Responsible Business ][7]\n* [ What science can do ][8]\n  * [ What science can do ][9]\n  * [ Campaign films ][10]\n  * [ Thank you, science ][11]\n  * [ Our impact, our people ][12]\n* [ Our Impact ][13]\n* [ Our Communities ][14]\n  * [ AstraZeneca Foundation ][15]\n  * [ Employee Volunteerism and Giving ][16]\n  * [ Request support ][17]\n  * [ Sustainability ][18]\n* [ Patients & Caregivers ][19]\n  * [ Affordability ][20]\n  * [ AstraZeneca Direct ][21]\n  * [ Medicines ][22]\n  * [ Patient Resources ][23]\n  * [ Product counterfeiting ][24]\n* [ Healthcare Providers ][25]\n  * [ Medicines ][26]\n  * [ Medical Information ][27]\n  * [ Product counterfeiting ][28]\n* [ Careers ][29]\n  * [ Careers ][30]\n* [ Media ][31]\n  * [ Media center ][32]\n  * [ Press Releases ][33]\n  * [ Personified ][34]\n  * [ That's Understandable ][35]\n  * [ AZ&You Blog ][36]\n  * [ Articles ][37]\n  * [ Statements ][38]\n* More Hide\n* [AstraZeneca Websites][39]\n* [ Global site][40]\n\n## Our impact\n\n\n[ Learn More ][41]\n\n## For the Health of America\n\n\n[ Learn More ][42]\n\n## **We're transforming the future of healthcare by unlocking the power of **What science can do **–\n## for people, society and the planet.**\n\n[\nWhat science can do\n][43]\n[\nGreat place to work\n][44]\n[\nExplore our media center\n][45]\n\nInvesting\n\n$50bn\n\nin US manufacturing and R&D by 2030\n\n[ Learn more ][46]\n\nLeading\n\n202\n\nactive clinical trials across the US\n\n[ Learn more ][47]\n\nDedicated\n\n$14.2bn\n\nto scientific innovation in 2025\n\n[ Learn more ][48]\n[ [Bild Södertälje] ][49]\n\n## **Rick R. Suárez**\n\nSenior Vice President, US President and Head of US BioPharmaceuticals Business Unit\n\n> We’re living through an extraordinary moment in science, and it’s opening a new era of hope for\n> people affected by disease. Across our BioPharmaceuticals business, we're turning that science\n> into meaningful progress for patients and the healthcare system they rely on.\n\n[ Profile ][50]\n[ [Bild Södertälje] ][51]\n\n## Mohit Manrao\n\nSenior Vice President, US Oncology Business Unit\n\n> Progress in oncology is measured by the lives we improve and extend. At AstraZeneca, we see how\n> every breakthrough can change what is possible for patients and their families. That belief is\n> driving us to build the next model of cancer care.\n\n[ Profile ][52]\n[ [Bild Södertälje] ][53]\n\n## Scott Weintraub\n\nSenior Vice President, United States Business, Alexion\n\n> What inspires our work in rare disease is transforming scientific innovation into meaningful\n> impact for patients. At Alexion, AstraZeneca Rare Disease, we build on decades of pioneering\n> innovation to help more patients benefit from timely diagnosis and innovative treatment.\n\n[ Profile ][54]\n\n## Trending story\n\n[ Advancing Sustainable Respiratory Care Solutions for a Healthier Future ][55]\n\n[ Articles ][56]\n\n## Featured articles\n\n[\n][57]\n\n[Advancing Our US R&I and V&I Ambition: Transforming Care for Millions of People][58]\n\n[ Articles ][59]\n[\n][60]\n\n[Transforming cardiovascular care and the burden of heart failure][61]\n\n[ Articles ][62]\n[ Keep up to date with the latest news ][63]\n\n### [Global site][64]\n\nAstraZeneca's global website is intended for people seeking information on AstraZeneca's worldwide\nbusiness. Click the 'Global site' link for the directory of country sites.\n\n### Resources\n* [AstraZeneca in the US][65]\n* [Community support][66]\n* [Affordability][67]\n* [AZ&You Blog ][68]\n* [Transparency in Coverage - Machine Readable Files][69]\n\n### Quick links\n* [Contact Us - Inside the US][70]\n* [Contact Us - Outside the US][71]\n* [Media][72]\n* [Careers][73]\n* [Medicines][74]\n\n### Social Media\n* [Facebook][75]\n* [LinkedIn][76]\n* [Twitter][77]\n* [Youtube][78]\n* [Instagram][79]\n\n#### utility links\n* [Privacy notice ][80]\n* [Legal notice][8"}}, "page_text": "* [Skip to content][1] * [skip to navigation][2] [AstraZeneca logo] [AstraZeneca logo] [ [AstraZeneca logo] [AstraZeneca logo] ][3] Search Menu 