Vice President, US Oncology Business Unit > Progress in oncology is measured by the lives we improve and extend. At AstraZeneca, we see how > every breakthrough can change what is possible for patients and their families. That belief is > driving us to build the next model of cancer care. [ Profile ][52] [ [Bild Södertälje] ][53] ## Scott Weintraub Senior Vice President, United States Business, Alexion > What inspires our work in rare disease is transforming scientific innovation into meaningful > impact for patients. At Alexion, AstraZeneca Rare Disease, we build on decades of pioneering > innovation to help more patients benefit from timely diagnosis and innovative treatment. [ Profile ][54] ## Trending story [ Advancing Sustainable Respiratory Care Solutions for a Healthier Future ][55] [ Articles ][56] ## Featured articles [ ][57] [Advancing Our US R&I and V&I Ambition: Transforming Care for Millions of People][58] [ Articles ][59] [ ][60] [Transforming cardiovascular care and the burden of heart failure][61] [ Articles ][62] [ Keep up to date with the latest news ][63] ### [Global site][64] AstraZeneca's global website is intended for people seeking information on AstraZeneca's worldwide business. Click the 'Global site' link for the directory of country sites. ### Resources * [AstraZeneca in the US][65] * [Community support][66] * [Affordability][67] * [AZ&You Blog ][68] * [Transparency in Coverage - Machine Readable Files][69] ### Quick links * [Contact Us - Inside the US][70] * [Contact Us - Outside the US][71] * [Media][72] * [Careers][73] * [Medicines][74] ### Social Media * [Facebook][75] * [LinkedIn][76] * [Twitter][77] * [Youtube][78] * [Instagram][79] #### utility links * [Privacy notice ][80] * [Legal notice][81] * [California supply chains disclosure ][82] * [Sitemap][83] * [Copyright ][84] * [Your Privacy Choices][85] * [Consumer Health Data Privacy Notice][86] * [Cookie Preferences][87] ©2026 AstraZeneca **You are now leaving AstraZeneca-us.com** Y