_text": "* [컨텐츠 바로가기][1] # [ [LG Chem] ][2] LG Chem * [COMPANY][3] [Company Introduction][4] * [About Us][5] * [Vision][6] * [LG Way][7] * [CI][8] * [Brand Identity][9] * [Business Areas][10] * [Global Network][11] * [History][12] [Investor Relations][13] * [Management Information][14] * [Financial Information][15] * [Stock Information][16] * [IR Activities][17] * [IR Archive][18] [R&D][19] * [R&D Status][20] * [R&D Field][21] * [R&D Achievements][22] * [Open Innovation][23] [Social Partnership][24] * [Vision and Strategic Tasks][25] * [Operation Status][26] [Media][27] * [Newsroom][28] * [Notice][29] * [Advertisements][30] * [LG Chem in Everyday Life][31] * [PRODUCT][32] [Petrochemicals][33] * [All][34] * [By Material][35] * [By Applicable Industry][36] * [By Division][37] [Advanced Materials][38] * [All][39] * [By Material][40] * [By Applicable Industry][41] * [By Division][42] [Life Sciences][43] * [All][44] * [By Medical Condition][45] * [By Product Type][46] * [By Division][47] * [SUSTAINABILITY][48] [Sustainability Strategy][49] * [Sustainability Strategy][50] * [Sustainability Report][51] * [ESG Bonds][52] * [Eco-Friendly Materials Brand LETZero][53] [Climate Change ][54] * [Climate Action][55] [Circularity][56] * [Circular Economy][57] [Supply Chain][58] * [Responsible Supply Chain][59] [Compliance][60] * [EH&S][61] * [Compliance Management][62] [Human Rights][63] * [Human Rights][64] * [CAREERS][65] [Workplace Vision][66] [People][67] [Life][68] [Apply][69] [History of LG Chem][70] [다국어 사이트 선택 아이콘] * [ KOR][71] * [ ENG][72] * [ CHN][73] * [ GER][74] [검색 열기 아이콘] 전체 메뉴 열기 [ Investor Relations ][75] [ New Drug Pipeline ][76] [ LG Chem On ][77] [ View All Products ][78] [ ESG performance data ][79] [ ][80] [ Eco-friendly Materials Brand LETZero ][81][More][82] [ ][83] [ Sustainable Today ][84][More][85] [ ][86] [ Latest News ][87][More][88] [ ][89] [ archives100 ][90][More][91] play * [ 2026 Company Profile ][92] * [ 2025 Sustainability Report ][93] * [ Eco-friendly Materials LETZero ][94] * [ CI Logo ][95] [History of LG Chem][96] [다국어 사이트 선택 아이콘] * * [ KOR][97] * [ ENG][98] * [ CHN][99] * [ GER][100] [검색 열기 아이콘] 닫기 * COMPANY확장됨 Company Introduction * [About Us ][101] * [Vision ][102] * [LG Way ][103] * [CI ][104] * [Brand Identity][105] * [Business Areas][106] * [Global Network][107] * [History][108] Investor Relations * [Management Information][109] * [Financial Information][110] * [Stock Information][111] * [IR Activities][112] * [IR Archive][113] R&D * [R&D Status][114] * [R&D Field][115] * [R&D Achievements][116] * [Open Innovation][117] Social Partnership * [Vision and Strategic Tasks][118] * [Operation Status][119] Media * [Newsroom][120] * [Notice][121] * [Advertisements][122] * [LG Chem in Everyday Life][123] * PRODUCT확장됨 Petrochemicals * [All][124] * [By Material][125] * [By Applicable Industry][126] * [By Division][127] Advanced Materials * [All][128] * [By Material][129] * [By Applicable Industry][130] * [By Division][131] Life Sciences * [All][132] * [By Medical Condition][133] * [By Product Type][134] * [By Division][135] * SUSTAINABILITY확장됨 Sustainability Strategy * [Sustainability Strategy][136] * [ Sustainability Report ][137] * [ESG Bonds][138] * [Eco-friendly Materials Brand LETZero][139] Climate Change * [Climate Action][140] Circularity * [Circular Economy][141] Supply Chain * [Responsible Supply Chain][142] Compliance * [Environment, Health & Safety][143] * [Compliance Management][144] Human Rights * [Human Rights][145] * CAREERS확장됨 [Workplace Vision][146] [People][147] [Life][148] [Apply][149] * [ 2026 Company Profile ][150] * [ 2025 Sustainability Report ][151] * [ Eco-friendly Materials LETZero ][152] * [ CI Logo ][153] ## Tech-driven Converting Company Driving change through technology, we create new markets with our customers ## Sustainability Sustainability is LG Chem's driving force into the future and what we ultimately aspire to achieve. ## Green Connector Through social responsibility with environmental awareness, LG Chem integrates green values into individual lives and society at large. ## LETZero LETZero, LG Chem’s Integrated Green Brand * 01Tech-driven Converting Company * 02Sustainability * 03Green Connector * 04LETZero ### “Tech-driven Converting Company” #### LG Chem is a converting company with strong technological capabilities. ##### About LG Chem * **1947** Established [go to History >][154] * **17,389** Number of Employees^{} Korea 12,943 ,Global 4,446 * **56** Global Business Sites^{} Korea16, Global40 * **50,434** Patents^{} Korea 17,975, Global 32,459 * KRW **45.93** trillion Sales^{} * KRW **1.18** trillion Operating Income^{} ##### Sustainability at LG Chem * **3**× Revenue of Four Core Growth Drivers (by 2030) * * Battery & Electronic Materials * Oncology New Drugs * Eco-friendly Sustainability * High Value-Added Business * **2050** Net Zero * **2030** Carbon-neutral Growth * **1.93** million tons Carbon Emissions Reduced Through Renewable Energy^{} * KRW **6.4** billion Social Contribution Achievements^{} * ^{}as of 2025 * ^{}as of today * ^{}2021~2025 (Estimation) ### Business #### Our exceptional products and materials with world-leading quality and cutting-edge technology #### are advancing the future life forward. * **Petrochemicals [**Petrochemicals][155] Petrochemicals Company We focus on eco-friendly materials to lead the sustainability business. * **Advanced Materials [**Advanced Materials][156] Advanced Materials Company We aim to become a global top‑tier battery and electronic materials company leading next‑generation technologies. * **Life Sciences [**Life Sciences][157] Life Sciences Company We aim to rise as a global pharmaceutical company that develops innovative new drugs. Petrochemicals Company We focus on eco-friendly materials to lead the sustainability business. The Petrochemicals Company is LG Chem's major business area with world-class productivity and cost competitiveness. We have established a vertically integrated system from basic raw materials such as ethylene and propylene to downstream products such as PE, ABS, and synthetic rubber. Advanced Materials Company We aim to become a global top‑tier battery and electronic materials company leading next‑generation technologies. The Advanced Materials Company is enhancing our business competitiveness in specialty materials through a market and customer-oriented approach. Life Sciences Company We aim to rise as a global pharmaceutical company that develops innovative new drugs. As a new growth engine for the future to be fostered in the medium and long term, the Company has differentiated R&D capabilities that have received new drug approval from the U.S. FDA for the first time in Korea. play ### News * [ALL][158] * [Press Releases][159] * [Notice][160] [Read More**][161] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.31 LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results ][162] * [ Notice 2026.07.22 Warning Regarding Counterfeit Products Warning Regarding Counterfeit Products ][163] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.17 LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor ][164] * [ Newsroom 2026.06.23 LG Chem to Invest KRW 15 Trillion in R&D, Intensifying Focus on Semiconductor, Mobility, and Robotics Materials LG Chem to Invest KRW 15 Trillion in R&D, Intensifying Focus on Semiconductor, Mobility, and Robotics Materials ][165] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.31 LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results LG Chem Announces Q2 Financial Results ][166] * [ Newsroom 2026.07.17 LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor LG Chem Enters Semiconductor Stripper Market with Mass Supply to Amkor ][167] * [ Newsroom 2026.06.23 LG Chem to Invest KRW 15 Trillion in R&D, Intensifying Focus on Semiconductor, Mobility, and Robotics Materials LG Chem to Invest KRW 15 Trillion in R&D, Intensifying Focus on Semiconductor, Mobility, and Robotics Materials ][168] * [ Newsroom 2026.05.07 LG Chem Showcases Mono-Material Innovation to Accelerate Shift in Packaging Films at Interpack 2026 LG Chem Showcases Mono-Material Innovation to Accelerate Shift in Packaging Films at Interpack 2026 ][169] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 Youth Activists for Biodiversity Conservation Youth Activists for Biodiversity Conservation ][170] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 Partnering for Better Perfomance - Enhancing PVC quality with analytical expertise Partnering for Better Perfomance - Enhancing PVC quality with analytical expertise ][171] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 Participating in Shanghai World of Packaging 2025, LG Chem will present its ultra-thin packaging film material, UNIQABLE™ Participating in Shanghai World of Packaging 2025, LG Chem will present its ultra-thin packaging film material, UNIQABLE™ ][172] * [ LinkedIn 2025.12.17 LG Chem Participates in High-Performance Thermal Materials Technology Seminar 2025 LG Chem Participates in High-Performance Thermal Materials Technology Seminar 2025 ][173] * [ Notice 2026.07.22 Warning Regarding Counterfeit Products ][174] * [ Notice 2026.05.21 Notice of Transfer of Personal Data ][175] * [ Notice 2026.03.19 Notice on Electronic Voting and Live Online Broadcasting for the 25th AGM of Shareholders ][176] * [ Notice 2026.02.27 Explanatory Materials for the 25th Annual General Meeting ][177] Discover LG Chem's latest content on social media. * [유튜브][178] * [인스타그램][179] * [네이버 블로그][180] * [Privacy Policy][181] * [Ethics Hotline][182] * [Site Map][183] * [1:1 Inquiries][184] Survey [LG Chem History Highlights][185] LEGAL * [Rejection of Unauthorized E-mail Collection][186] * [Cookie Setting][187] Related Sites * LG Corp. * [LG][188] * [LG Display][189] * [LG Electronics ][190] * [LG U+][191] * [LG Household&Health Care][192] Family Site * [LG Chem Blog][193] * [LG Energy Solution][194] * [Innovation Center][195] * [Farmhannong][196] * [AVEO Pharmaceuticals][197] * [Virtual e-Mobility Solution Site][198] Business * [LG Chem On][199] * [Procurement Portal System][200] * [SINGLEX Supplier Portal][201] ©LG Chem. All Rights Reserved Welcome! This site uses cookies to provide you with the best user experience. By continuing to browse the site, you agree to the use of cookies. Recommandation You have the option to accept all cookies recommended by us, or to make your own selection. You can revoke your consent to the selection made at any time. [Accept all][202] [More options][203] 닫기 ### alert Confirm Close Popup ** alert Confirm Close Popup ** close ** Rejection of e-mail collection without We reject any automatic collection of e-mail addresses on this website. Please note that anyone violating this can be punished in accordance with the information and communication network laws. Crime Response Center [http://www.spamcop.or.kr][204] Survey [ 1:1 Inquiries ][205] Top 1* 1 2 3 4 5 2 ** The LG Ethics Hotline Website is operated and personal data is processed according to applicable Korean Data Protection Laws by LG Corp. and LG Chem Ltd. If you do not wish your personal data being processed in Korea, please address your concern directly to the LG Chem Europe GmbH Internal Audit Team [emeaethics@lgchem.com]. [ Go to Ethics Hotline ][206] Close Popup ** ### For more information 팝업 닫기 ** When you visit our website, information is stored in your browser or exported in the form of cookies. This information may be about you, your preferences, or the", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "LG Chem Ltd. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: LG Chem's life sciences division has developed and marketed GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating ownership or marketing of GLP-1 brands. | LG Chem's life sciences division has developed and marketed diabetes treatments, including GLP-1 receptor agonists, in South Korea and other Asian markets. | South Korea | Seoul, South, Korea", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "42", "Y Score": "46", "Overall Score": "44", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Challengers"}, {"Company": "MannKind Corporation", "Website": "https://www.mannkindcorp.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Danbury, Connecticut, USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "MannKind is developing combination products involving GLP-1 receptor agonists for diabetes and obesity.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "MannKind Corporation — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: MannKind is developing combination products involving GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating pipeline ownership.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "75", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "mannkindcorp.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "mannkindcorp.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [ Skip to Primary Content ][1]\n* [ Skip to Footer ][2]\n* [About][3]\n  [About Mannkind][4] [Our Values][5] [Executive Leadership][6] [Board of Directors][7] [History of\n  Innovation][8]\n* [Products & Pipeline][9]\n  [Products & Pipeline][10] [Pipeline Chart][11] [Clinical Trials][12] [About Clinical Trials][13]\n  [MannKind Trials][14] [Scientific Advisory Board][15] [Publications][16] [Medical Affairs][17]\n* [Partners][18]\n  [Partnering with Mannkind][19] [Technosphere][20] [Innholation innovation][21] [BluHale\n  Inhalation][22] [H-Patch][23] [Intelectual property][24]\n* [Careers][25]\n  [Mannkind Careers][26] [Locations][27] [Department][28] [Open Positions][29] [Benefits][30]\n  [Internships & Fellowships][31]\n* [Newsroom][32]\n* [Investors][33]\n  [Investing in Mannkind][34] [Events & Presentations][35] [Corporate Deck & Fact Sheet][36] [Press\n  Releases][37] [SEC Filings][38] [Financial Information][39] [Annual Reports][40] [Quarterly\n  Results][41] [ESG][42] [Stock Information][43] [Historic Price Lookup][44] [Investment\n  Calculator][45] [Ownership Profile][46] [Analyst Coverage][47]\n\nFDA Approved 05/29/2026:\n\n##### New option in Pediatric Diabetes Care\n\n[Learn More][48]\n\nFDA Approved 07/24/2026:\n\n##### Furoscix ReadyFlow™ (furosemide injection)\n\n[learn more][49]\n[ [Mannkind] ][50]\n* [About][51]\n  [Our Values][52] [Executive Leadership][53] [Board of Directors][54] [History of Innovation][55]\n* [Products & Pipeline][56]\n  [Pipeline Chart][57] [Clinical Trials][58] [About Clinical Trials][59] [MannKind Trials][60]\n  [Scientific Advisory Board][61] [Publications][62] [Medical Affairs][63]\n* [Partners][64]\n  [Technosphere][65] [Inhalation innovation][66] [BluHale Inhalation][67] [H-Patch][68]\n  [Intellectual property][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n  [Locations][71] [Departments][72] [Open Positions][73] [Benefits][74] [Internships &\n  Fellowships][75]\n* [Newsroom][76]\n* [Investors][77]\n  [Events & Presentations][78] [Corporate Deck][79] [Press Releases][80] [SEC Filings][81]\n  [Financial Information][82] [Annual Reports][83] [Quarterly Results][84] [Corporate\n  Governance][85] [ESG][86] [Stock Information][87] [Historic Price Lookup][88] [Investment\n  Calculator][89] [Ownership Profile][90] [Analyst Coverage][91]\n[MannKind logo]\nwatch video\n\n# life more humann.\n\n[life more humann]\n\nAt MannKind, we are dedicated to transforming chronic disease through **innovative, patient-centric\nsolutions** designed to fit seamlessly into daily life. Our focus is on delivering therapies for\npeople living with **cardiometabolic and orphan lung diseases** such as diabetes, pulmonary\nhypertension and fluid overload in heart and chronic kidney disease.\n\nIn the spirit of our founder Alfred E. Mann, we are in pursuit of a world where people with serious\nmedical conditions can live **life more humann**.\n\n[learn more about us][92]\n×\n\n## products\n## & pipeline\n\nCheck out our research and development pipeline focused on cardiometabolic and orphan lung diseases.\n\n[explore our products & pipeline][93]\n[Pipeline]\n[Pipeline]\n[Pipeline]\n[Pipeline]\n\n### V-Go^{®}\n\n#### All-In-One Insulin Delivery Patch\n\nFull Indication, Important Safety Information, and Instructions for Patient Use can be accessed at\n[go-vgo.com][94].\n\n[visit V-Go for more][95]\n\n### afrezza^{®}\n\n#### (insulin human) Inhalation Powder\n\nFull Prescribing Information, including BOXED WARNING, Instructions for Use, and Medication Guide\ncan be accessed at [afrezza.com.][96]\n\n[visit afrezza for more][97]\n\n### Technosphere^{®} utilized in Tyvaso DPI^{®}\n\n#### (treprostinil) inhalation powder\n\nUnited Therapeutics’ Tyvaso DPI represents the second FDA-approved product utilizing MannKind’s\ninnovative Technosphere inhalation technology. Full Prescribing Information can be accessed at\n[tyvaso.com.][98]\n\n[visit tyvaso dpi for more][99]\n\n### Furoscix^{®} On-body Infusor\n\n#### (furosemide injection)\n\nThe Furoscix On-body Infusor is marketed by scPharmaceuticals, a wholly owned subsidiary of\nMannKind. Full Prescribing I"}}, "page_text": "* [ Skip to Primary Content ][1] * [ Skip to Footer ][2] * [About][3] [About Mannkind][4] [Our Values][5] [Executive Leadership][6] [Board of Directors][7] [History of Innovation][8] * [Products & Pipeline][9] [Products & Pipeline][10] [Pipeline Chart][11] [Clinical Trials][12] [About Clinical Trials][13] [MannKind Trials][14] [Scientific Advisory Board][15] [Publications][16] [Medical Affairs][17] * [Partners][18] [Partnering with Mannkind][19] [Technosphere][20] [Innholation innovation][21] [BluHale Inhalation][22] 