as diabetes, pulmonary hypertension and fluid overload in heart and chronic kidney disease. In the spirit of our founder Alfred E. Mann, we are in pursuit of a world where people with serious medical conditions can live **life more humann**. [learn more about us][92] × ## products ## & pipeline Check out our research and development pipeline focused on cardiometabolic and orphan lung diseases. [explore our products & pipeline][93] [Pipeline] [Pipeline] [Pipeline] [Pipeline] ### V-Go^{®} #### All-In-One Insulin Delivery Patch Full Indication, Important Safety Information, and Instructions for Patient Use can be accessed at [go-vgo.com][94]. [visit V-Go for more][95] ### afrezza^{®} #### (insulin human) Inhalation Powder Full Prescribing Information, including BOXED WARNING, Instructions for Use, and Medication Guide can be accessed at [afrezza.com.][96] [visit afrezza for more][97] ### Technosphere^{®} utilized in Tyvaso DPI^{®} #### (treprostinil) inhalation powder United Therapeutics’ Tyvaso DPI represents the second FDA-approved product utilizing MannKind’s innovative Technosphere inhalation technology. Full Prescribing Information can be accessed at [tyvaso.com.][98] [visit tyvaso dpi for more][99] ### Furoscix^{®} On-body Infusor #### (furosemide injection) The Furoscix On-body Infusor is marketed by scPharmaceuticals, a wholly owned subsidiary of MannKind. Full Prescribing Information, including Important Safety Information and Instructions for Patient Use can be accessed at [furoscix.com][100]. [visit furoscix for more][101] ## investors Learn more about MannKind. [invest in us][102] ## investors [investors_image_720x720] ## partners [MannKind Factory] ## partners From concept to commercialization, we collaborate with pharmaceutical organizations of all sizes, working flexibly and seamlessly to create products and technologies that truly break the mold. [partner with us][103] ## careers [Pipeline] ## careers We’re looking for people who are passionate about making the world a little more humann for all to join our team! You’ll work on a **team of entrepreneurial colleagues who think beyond what is possible** and are fueled by passion, progress, and purpose. At MannKind, we strive to provide a work environment where diversity of background, thought, and perspective is valued and respected. [careers at mannkind][104] ## Make a humann connection with us. Reach out anytime. [contact][105] ## sign up for email updates [sign up][106] [Terms of Use][107] [Privacy Policy][108] [Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy][109] [Patent Notices][110] [Corporate Governance][111] ©2026 MannKind Corporation. All rights reserved. [announcement-banner-bg] ## Now FDA Approved: ## Furoscix ReadyFlow™ ### (furosemide injection) Designed for at-home administration in seconds via an autoinjector [Learn More][112] [MannKind] [MannKind] × [1]: #pd-main [2]: #footer [3]: https://mannkindcorp.com/about/ [4]: https://mannkindcorp.com/about/ [5]: /about#our-values [6]: /about#executive-leadership [7]: /about#board [8]: /about#history [9]: https://mannkindcorp.com/pipeline/ [10]: https://mannkindcorp.com/pipeline/ [11]: /pipeline/#chart [12]: https://mannkindcorp.com/clinical-trials/ [13]: https://mannkindcorp.com/clinical-trials/ [14]: /clinical-trials#trials [15]: /clinical-trials#advisory [16]: https://mannkindcorp.com/publications/ [17]: https://mannkindmedaffairs.com/ [18]: https://mannkindcorp.com/partnering/ [19]: https://mannkindcorp.com/partnering/ [20]: /partnering/#technosphere_technology [21]: /partnering/#inhalation_innovation [22]: /partnering/#inhalation_training_device [23]: /partnering/#h-patch [24]: /partnering#intellectual-property [25]: https://mannkindcorp.com/careers/ [26]: https://mannkindcorp.com/careers/ [27]: /careers/#locations [28]: /careers#department [29]: https://recruitingbypaycor.com/career/CareerHome.action?clientId=8a7883c67b979504017bd02a03511 b78 [30]: /careers/#benefits [31]: /careers/#fellowships--internships [32]: h