he Partnering Team][69] * [Meet the External Innovation Team][70] * [Contact Business Development Team][71] * [Sanofi x STATION F][72] * [Media][73] * [ Media ][74] * [Stories][75] * [Press Releases][76] * [Contacts][77] * [Investors][78] * [ Investors ][79] * [News and Events][80] * [ News and Events ][81] * [News][82] * [Upcoming Events][83] * [Past Events][84] * [Shares, ADRs and Bonds][85] * [ Shares, ADRs and Bonds ][86] * [Share Price][87] * [Dividend][88] * [Shares, Structure and Vote][89] * [Bonds][90] * [Analyst Coverage and Vara Consensus][91] * [Share Repurchases][92] * [American Depositary Receipts][93] * [Financial Reports and Other Publications][94] * [Environment, Social, Governance][95] * [Private Shareholders][96] * [Contacts and Subscription][97] * [Careers][98] Global [Hand holding a liquid sample, preparing for mass spectrometry analysis] Preparing samples for mass spectrometry analysis, Vaccines, Toronto Campus, Canada Preparing samples for mass spectrometry analysis, Vaccines, Toronto Campus, Canada # Second Quarter 2026 Results The results were reviewed by management during a live audio webcast with the financial community on July 30, 2026. [Learn more][99] ## Our Latest Articles [Read our latest articles][100] [A photo of Khushika, who has ASMD, sitting with her family.] Sustainability August 12, 2026 ### Celebrating 35 Years of the Rare Humanitarian Program [Read the article][101] [ close-up, high-tech conceptual 3D render of a bispecific antibody molecule binding to two distinct, colorful cellular target receptors simultaneously. ] Our Science July 28, 2026 ### One Target, One Answer. Two Targets, a Thousand Questions. [Read the article][102] [Animation 3D Immunoscience] Our Science July 21, 2026 ### Partner Spotlight: Advancing the Next Generation of Immune-Mediated Disease Treatments [Read the article][103] [Two women in black wetsuits standing on a beach with a surfboard, ready for surfing] ## The Power of Chasing A Dream Every day, we chase the miracles of science to improve people’s lives. We apply our deep understanding of the immune system to develop breakthrough innovations in medicines and vaccines so you can focus on what matters most, chasing your dreams. If you’re chasing your dreams, remember... you’re not alone. **We’re right beside you** ## People Stories #### We’re proud to spotlight those who inspire us to keep going further in the work we do. [A woman wearing a black wetsuit holds a surfboard under blue skies and sunshine while looking out to the horizon with a hopeful and determined expression.] ### Céline, living with secondary progressive multiple sclerosis France [Read more][104] [A man wearing glasses and a blue jacket operates a video camera and looks focused while filming, his hand is outstretched in front of him as he gestures. ] ### Xavier, living with autoimmune type 1 diabetes US [Read more][105] [A woman in a white Sanofi lab coat and company badge outside of a building, moving forward while confidently and positively looking ahead. Several people are running alongside her in the background.] ### Wei, Sanofi China [Read more][106] [See all stories][107] ## We are an R&D driven, AI-powered biopharmaceutical company committed to improving people’s lives ## and delivering compelling growth. ## About Us ### Who We Are We are an R&D driven, AI-powered biopharma company committed to improving people’s lives and creating compelling growth. [Read more][108] ### Our Science We turn the impossible into possible. [Read more][109] [Alizée, autoimmune T1D, and her family, France] ### Patients We chase the miracles of science to improve people’s lives. [Read more][110] [An straight down drone view of Garrarus beach, Waterford Ireland, with sea green waters, coarse sandy beach, and a rocky coast] ### Sustainability We are at the forefront of addressing some of the world's most critical challenges, striving to create a healthier, more resilient future. [Read more][111] ## Our Pipeline ### 5 Therapeutic areas ### 61 Compounds in clinical development ### 20 Clinical trials in phase 3 [Explore our pipeline][112] ## Pursue Progress. Discover Extraordinary. Better is out there. Better medications, better outcomes, better science. It's all down to people like you, from different backgrounds, in different locations, doing different roles. Take the most important step in your career: help us change the lives of people, families and communities for the better. [Explore Career Opportunities ][113] ## Our Latest Press Releases August 4, 2026 Press Release: Sanofi’s MenQuadfi approved in the EU for use in infants from age six weeks against invasive meningococcal disease [Read the Press Release][114] July 30, 2026 Press Release: Sanofi’s half-year financial report for 2026 [Read the Press Release][115] July 30, 2026 Press Release: Q2 2026: double-digit sales growth and strong business EPS growth; 2026 guidance upgraded [Read the Press Release][116] July 24, 2026 Press Release: Sanofi announces decision not to submit amlitelimab in atopic dermatitis for global regulatory reviews [Read the Press Release][117] [See all press releases][118] Follow us Back to top * [Global Privacy][119] * [Contact][120] * [Legal notice][121] * [Cookies Policy][122] * [Our publications][123] * [Directory][124] * [Sitemap][125] * [Accessibility: partial compliance][126] * [Code of Conduct][127] © Sanofi 2004-2026 - All rights reserved [1]: /en/search-result [2]: [3]: /en/our-company [4]: /en/our-company/our-strategy [5]: https://www.sanofi.com/en/chasing-miracles [6]: [7]: /en/our-company/governance [8]: /en/our-company/governance/board-of-directors [9]: /en/our-company/governance/executive-committee [10]: /en/our-company/governance/specialist-committees [11]: [12]: /en/our-company/sustainability [13]: /en/our-company/sustainability/sustainable-and-equitable-access-to-healthcare [14]: /en/our-company/sustainability/environmental-impact [15]: /en/our-company/sustainability/health-syste