"Operational Presence": "Hungary", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Has GLP-1 RA research", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "HU", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Gedeon Richter — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Has GLP-1 RA research, likely developing own assets.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "70", "X Score": "43", "Y Score": "42", "Overall Score": "42", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Gilead Sciences Canada", "Website": "https://www.gilead.ca", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Mississauga, Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Gilead Sciences Canada is developing a GLP-1 receptor agonist for obesity, though not yet marketed.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Gilead Sciences Canada — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Gilead Sciences is developing a GLP-1 receptor agonist for obesity, indicating it owns a pipeline asset. Although not yet marketed, the company is a biotech with a late-stage pipeline, fitting the 'Brand / Marketer' type as a developer.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "gilead.ca", "data": {"company": {"name": "gilead.ca"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[All-Pages-Gilead-logo]][1]\n* [Science][2]\n* [Responsibility][3]\n  * [Responsibility][4]\n  * [Sustainability][5]\n  * [Giving][6]\n    * [Giving][7]\n    * [What We Fund][8]\n    * [Medical Grants Fellowships Journal Clubs and Rounds][9]\n    * [HIV Community Grants Program][10]\n    * [Oncology and Hematology Community Grants Program][11]\n    * [Liver Community Grants Program][12]\n    * [Apply For Funding][13]\n    * [Terms and Conditions][14]\n    * [FAQs][15]\n  * [Global Health and Access][16]\n  * [Partnerships and Community][17]\n* [Company][18]\n  * [Company][19]\n  * [Message from the General Manager][20]\n  * [Gilead In Canada][21]\n  * [Canadian Leadership Team][22]\n* [Careers][23]\nEnglish (EN) EN\n* [English (EN)][24]\n* [Francais (FR)][25]\nSearch Search\nHamber\n[white-gilead-logo.png]\n\n# ACHIEVING\n# BOLD AMBITIONS\n\n##### For more than 35 years, we have been tackling some of the world’s greatest public health\n##### challenges, revolutionizing HIV treatment and prevention and delivering a cure for hepatitis\n##### C. Now, we are working to discover and advance therapies that offer new hope to patients\n##### impacted by diseases across our therapeutic areas of Virology, Oncology and Inflammation.\n\n[ImageCanada][ImageCanada]\n\n## Delivering **Transformative Therapies** and Advancing Health Equity \n\nThrough innovation, we’re helping to build a healthier world for all people.\n\n[ Learn More About Gilead ][26]\n[science-banner][science-banner]\n[Four Gilead researchers in a lab.][Four Gilead researchers in a lab.]\n\n## Using Science to Improve the Lives of People and Communities\n\nWe invest in world-class science to combat the world's most devastating diseases.\n\n[ Explore Science ][27]\n\n## An Inclusive Workplace Where We All Can Make an Impact\n\nMore than 17,000 employees at Gilead worldwide work to advance scientific innovation, help ensure\nour medicines reach those who need it and make a difference in the communities where we live and\nwork.\n\n[ Explore Careers at Gilead ][28]\n[Five people standing and smiling][Five people standing and smiling]\n[Gilead_logo]\n\nThis website is intended for residents of Canada.\n\n### INFORMATION\n* [Sitemap][29]\n* [Gilead.com][30]\n* [Product Monographs][31]\n\n### GET IN TOUCH\n* [Contact Us][32]\n* [Report an Adverse Event][33]\n* [Medical Information][34]\n\n### COUNTRY DISCLOSURES\n* [Cookie Statement][35]\n* Manage Cookie Settings\n* [Privacy Statement][36]\n* [Healthcare Professional Privacy Notice][37]\n* [Social Media Guidelines][38]\n* [Terms of Use][39]\n\n© 1996-2026 Gilead Sciences, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nYou are now leaving www.gilead.com/en-ca and visiting a third-party website which is not owned or\ncontrolled by Gilead Sciences. Links to these sites are provided as a resource to our visitors.\nGilead does not assume responsibility for any content on linked sites.\n\n[OK][40] [CANCEL][41]\n\nYou are now leaving www.gilead.com/en-ca and visiting our global website, Gilead.com. Please note\nsome of the content on this site is only intended for audiences in the United States.\n\n[OK][42] [CANCEL][43]\n\n[1]: /en-ca\n[2]: /en-ca/science\n[3]: /en-ca/responsibility\n[4]: /en-ca/responsibility/overview\n[5]: /en-ca/responsibility/sustainability\n[6]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving\n[7]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/overview\n[8]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/what-we-fund\n[9]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/medical-grants-fellowships-journal-clubs-and-rounds\n[10]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/hiv-community-grants-program\n[11]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/oncology-and-hematology-community-grants-program\n[12]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/liver-community-grants-program\n[13]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/apply-for-funding\n[14]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/terms-and-conditions\n[15]: /en-ca/responsibility/giving/faqs\n[16]: /en-ca/responsibility/global-health-and-access\n[17]: /en-ca/responsibility/partnerships-and-community\n[18]: /en-ca/company\n[19]: /en-ca/company/overview\n[20]: /en-ca/company/message-from-the-general-manager\n[21]: /en-ca/company"}}, "page_text": "[[All-Pages-Gilead-logo]][1] * [Science][2] * [Responsibility][3] * [Responsibility][4] * [Sustainability][5] * [Giving][6] * [Giving][7] * [What We Fund][8] * [Medical Grants Fellowships Journal Clubs and Rounds][9] * [HIV Community Grants Program][10] * [Oncology and Hematology Community Grants Program][11] * [Liver Community Grants Program][12] * [Apply For Funding][13] * [Terms and Conditions][14] * [FAQs][15] * [Global Health and Access][16] * [Partnerships and Community][17] * [Company][18] * [Company][19] * [Message from the General Manager][20] * [Gilead In Canada][21] * [Canadian Leadership Team][22] * [Careers][23] English (EN) EN * [English (EN)][24] * [Francais (FR)][25] Search Search Hamber [white-gilead-logo.png] # ACHIEVING # BOLD AMBITIONS ##### For more than 35 years, we have been tackling some of the world’s greatest public health ##### challenges, revolutionizing HIV treatment and prevention and delivering a cure for hepatitis ##### C. Now, we are working to discover and advance therapies that offer new hope to patients ##### impacted by diseases across our therapeutic areas of Virology, Oncology and Inflammation. [ImageCanada][ImageCanada] ## Delivering **Transformative Therapies** and Advancing Health Equity Through innovation, we’re helping to build a healthier world for all people. [ Learn More About Gilead ][26] [science-banner][science-banner] [Four Gilead researchers in a lab.][Four Gilead researchers in a lab.] ## Using Science to Improve the Lives of People and Communities We invest in world-class science to combat the world's most devastating diseases. [ Explore Science ][27] ## An Inclusive Workp