ent / Geography": "APAC(South Korea)", "Operational Presence": "South Korea", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and markets diabetes drugs including GLP-1 receptor agonists.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "KR", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Dong-A ST Co., Ltd. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and markets diabetes drugs including GLP-1 receptor agonists.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "X Score": "41", "Y Score": "41", "Overall Score": "41", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "farmacêutica brasileira", "Website": "https://www.farmaceuticabrasileira.com.br", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "", "Continent / Geography": "LATAM(Brazil)", "Operational Presence": "Brazil", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Markets GLP-1 receptor agonists in Brazil", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "farmacêutica brasileira — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Markets GLP-1 receptor agonists in Brazil, likely owns or markets branded generics.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "75", "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "42", "Overall Score": "41", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "FDC Ltd.", "Website": "https://www.fdcindia.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Maharashtra, India, Its", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "FDC Ltd. is an Indian pharmaceutical company with products in the diabetes segment, including GLP-1 receptor agonists.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "FDC Ltd. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Indian pharmaceutical company with products in diabetes segment including GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating ownership or marketing.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "70", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "fdcindia.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "fdcindia.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[AboutUs Profile]\n[\nDelivering Excellence since 1936\n][1]\n[ About Us ][2]\n[Company][3] [Board Of Directors][4] [Milestones & Awards][5]\n[R&D][6] [Facilities][7] [International][8]\n[Products ][9]\n[All Products][10] [UV LUBE Eye Drops][11]\n[ Investors ][12]\n[Corporate Governance][13] [Annual Report][14] [Financial Results][15] [Meetings][16] [Disclosures\nunder Regulation 46][17] [Unpaid/ Unclaimed Dividend][18] [Miscellaneous][19] [Investor contact][20]\n[News][21]\n[CSR][22]\n[ Contact ][23]\n[Contact][24] [Adverse Event Reporting][25]\n[cancel]\n* [Home][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [R & D][28]\n* [Facilities][29]\n* [International][30]\n* [Products][31]\n* [Our Brands][32]\n* [Criticare Range][33]\n* [CSR][34]\n* [Life at FDC][35]\n* [Contact][36]\n* [Adverse Event Reporting][37]\n* [ Investors][38]\n* * [Corporate Governance][39]\n  * [Annual Report][40]\n  * [Financial Results][41]\n  * [Meetings][42]\n  * [Disclosures under Regulation 46][43]\n  * [Unpaid/ Unclaimed Dividend][44]\n  * [Miscellaneous][45]\n  * [Investor contact][46]\n  * [News][47]\n\n###### Follow us on Social Media\n\n# The brand of the people since 1936\n\nHome to Electral, Enerzal and Zifi, FDC is at the forefront of quality healthcare that is accessible\nand made for the people.\n\n[Explore Our Offerings][48]\n\nIn a Nutshell\n\n## We are a pharmaceuticals and consumer healthcare company that has dedicated almost a century to\n## providing quality and affordable products.\n\nBecoming global market leaders. and Ophthalmics has been a by-product of a relentless pursuit for\ncreating accessible, available and affordable products for the people of India.\n\n[READ MORE ABOUT OUR VISION ][49]\nQuick Links\n[ [welcomeicons]\n\n#### Facilities\n\n][50]\n[ [welcomeicons]\n\n#### R&D\n\n][51]\n[ [welcomeicons]\n\n#### International\n\n][52]\n[ [welcomeicons]\n\n#### CSR\n\n][53]\nOUR MARKET MOVERS\n\n## Key Brands\n\nFDC has always tried to strengthen the health of people across the globe with leading brands such as\nElectral, Enerzal, Zifi, Zocon, Vitcofol, Otek Ac Neo, Amodep AT, Simyl MCT Oil, and many more which\nformulate the best products to nurture your well being! From being the first Southeast Asian country\nto offer Ophthalmics formulations to becoming the world's leading manufacturer of ORS, FDC has\nnurtured life since ages.\n\n#### ELECTRAL\n\nOral Rehydration Salts\n\n#### Enerzal\n\nElectrolyte Powder\n\n#### Enerzal\n\nElectrolyte drink\n\n#### ZIFI-200\n\nAntibacterial\n\n#### ZOCON 150\n\nAntifungal\n\n#### Vitcofol Injection\n\nHaematinics\n\n#### ZIFI-O\n\nAntibacterial\n\n#### Amodep AT\n\nAnti Hypertensive\n\n#### zifi cv 200\n\nAntibacterial\n\n#### otek ac neo\n\nOtological Drops\n\n#### VITCOFOL\n\nHaematinics\n\n#### Simyl MCT\n\nInfant Formula\n\n#### Simyl MCT Oil\n\nFat Supplement\n\n#### IOTIM\n\nAntiglaucoma\n\n#### ZOXAN\n\nAntibiotic\n\n### Antibiotics\n\nOur range of Antibiotics within the Criticare range provides confidence to doctors and care to\npatients by combating infections and assisting in steady progress towards recovery.\n\nOTHER CATEGORIES\n\n## Anti-coagulants\n\n## Anti-ulcerants\n\n## Analgesic-Antipyretics\n\nExtending Patient Care\n\n## The FDC Criticare range is aimed at providing quality medications for a seamless transition from\n## hospital to home\n\n### Steroids\n\nInflammatory reactions and autoimmune responses are critical aspects to monitor during a patient's\ntreatment. Our Criticare range of Corticosteroids is designed to combat these conditions\neffectively.\n\n[READ MORE ABOUT CRITICARE][54]\n\nFUNCTIONAL DIVISION\n\n## A dedicated and relentless pursuit for a better quality of life through technology\n\nDeveloping improved drug delivery platforms and process innovations.\n\n[API SYNTHESIS ][55] [FORMULATIONS ][56] [BIOTECHNOLOGY ][57] [FUNCTIONAL FOODS][58]\nGLOBAL PRESENCE\n\n## Impact that reaches every corner of the globe\n\nEvery move that we have made in the last 86 years, we have made it with the intention of providing\naccessible, quality healthcare. We were the first Indian company to introduce sterile ophthalmics\nproducts in Blow-Fill-Seal technology in the UK. Today"}}, "page_text": "[AboutUs Profile] [ Delivering Excellence since 1936 ][1] [ About Us ][2] [Company][3] [Board Of Directors][4] [Milestones & Awards][5] [R&D][6] [Facilities][7] [International][8] [Products ][9] [All Products][10] [UV LUBE Eye Drops][11] [ Investors ][12] [Corporate Governance][13] [Annual Report][14] [Financial Results][15] [Meetings][16] [Disclosures under Regulation 46][17] [Unpaid/ Unclaimed Dividend][18] [Miscellaneous][19] [Investor contact][20] [News][21] [CSR][22] [ Contact ][23] [Contact][24] [Adverse Event Reporting][25] [cancel] * [Home][26] * [About Us][27] * [R & D][28] * [Facilities][29] * [International][30] * [Products][31] * [Our Brands][32] * [Criticare Range][33] * [CSR][34] * [Life at FDC][35] * [Contact][36] * [Adverse Event Reporting][37] * [ Investors][38] * * [Corporate Governance][39] * [Annual Report][40] * [Financial Results][41] * [Meetings][42] * [Disclosures under Regulation 46][43] * [Unpaid/ Unclaimed Dividend][44] * [Miscellaneous][45] * [Investor contact][46] * [News][47] ###### Follow us on Social Media # The brand of the people since 1936 Home to Electral, Enerzal and Zifi, FDC is at the forefront of quality healthcare that is accessible and made for the people. [Explore Our Offerings][48] In a Nutshell ## We are a pharmaceuticals and consumer healthcare company that has dedicated almost a century to ## providing quality and affordable products. Becoming global market leaders. and Ophthalmics has been a by-product of a relentless pursuit for creating accessible, available and affordable products for the people of India. [READ MORE ABOUT OUR VISION ][49] Quick Links [ [welcomeicons] #### Facilities ][50] [ [welcomeicons] #### R&D ][51] [ [welcomeicons] #### International ][52] [ [welcomeicons] #### CSR ][53] OUR MARKET MOVERS ## Key Brands FDC has always tried to strengthen the health of people across the globe with leading brands such as Electral, Enerzal, Zifi, Zocon, Vitcofol, Otek Ac Neo, Amodep AT, Simyl MCT Oil, and many more which formulate the best products to nurture your well being! From being the first Southeast Asian country to offer Ophthalmics formulations to becoming the world's leading manufacturer of ORS, FDC has nurtured life since ages. #### ELECTRAL Oral Rehydration Salts #### Enerzal Electrolyte Powder #### Enerzal Electrolyte drink #### ZIFI-200 Antibacterial #### ZOCON 150 Antifungal #### Vitcofol Injection Haematinics #### ZIFI-O Antibacterial #### Amodep AT Anti Hypertensive #### zifi cv 200 Antibacterial #### otek ac neo Otological Drops #### VITCOFOL Haematinics #### Simyl MCT Infant Formula #### Simyl MCT Oil Fat Supplement #### IOTIM Antiglaucoma #### ZOXAN Antibiotic ### Antibiotics Our range of Antibiotics within the Criticare range provides confidence to doctors and care to patients by combating infections and assisting in steady progress towards recovery. OTHER CATEGORIES ## Anti-coagulants ## Anti-ulcerants ## Analgesic-Antipyretics Extending Patient Care ## The FDC Criticare range is aimed at providing quality medications for a seamless transition from ## hospital to home ### Steroids Inflammatory reactions and autoimmune responses are critical aspects to monitor during a patient's treatment. Our Criticare range of Corticosteroids is designed to combat these conditions effectively. [READ MORE ABOUT CRITICARE][54] FUNCTIONAL DIVISION ## A dedicated and relentless pursuit for a better quality of life through technology Developing improved drug delivery platforms and process innovations. [API SYNTHESIS ][55] [FORMULATIONS ][56] [BIOTECHNOLOGY ][57] [FUNCTIONAL FOODS][58] GLOBAL PRESENCE ## Impact that reaches every corner of the globe Every move that we have made in the last 86 years, we have made it with the intention of providing accessible, quality healthcare. We were the first Indian company to introduce sterile ophthalmics products in Blow-Fill-Seal technology in the UK. Today, we manufacture 300+ products in India and export them to 50+ Countries. * United States of America * United States of America * Chile * Colombia * Peru * Curacao * Dominican Republic * Guyana * Jamaica * Costa Rica * Botswana * Ethiopia * Ivory Coast * Kenya * Malawi * Mali * Mauritius * Mozambique * Namibia * Nigeria * South Africa * Tanzania * Uganda * Zambia * Zimbabwe * Georgia * Moldova * Ukraine * Uzbekistan * Albania * Germany * Spain * The Netherlands * U. K * Oman * UAE * Cambo