any][67] [We Are Global][68]\n      \n      From Bad Homburg out into every corner of the world. We are there with our expertise where we\n      are needed! Get to know more about our global presence.\n  * close\n* Portfolio\n  * [Main menu][69] [Portfolio][70]\n    \n    Discover Fresenius Kabi's portfolio in Pharma, Nutrition, MedTech and Biopharma. Explore our\n    innovative solutions for improved healthcare results.\n    * [Portfolio][71] [IV Drugs & Infusion Therapy][72]\n      \n      Enhance patient care with Fresenius Kabi’s comprehensive, high-quality IV therapy products for\n      anesthetics, oncology, anti-infectives, and critical care.\n    * [Portfolio][73] [Medical Nutrition][74]\n      \n      Discover Fresenius Kabi’s specialized medical nutrition solutions. Learn more about our\n      products, from parenteral and enteral nutrition to keto analogs.\n    * [Portfolio][75] [MedTech][76]\n      \n      Discover all our advanced medical technologies for nutrition, anesthesia monitoring, cell\n      therapies, blood donation, and safe therapy administration.\n    * [Portfolio][77] [Biopharma][78]\n      \n      We offer affordable, high-quality, effective, and safe biopharmaceuticals for patients with\n      autoimmune diseases and cancer. Learn more at Fresenius Kabi!\n  * close\n* Sustainability\n  * [Main menu][79] [Sustainability][80]\n    \n    Discover how Fresenius Kabi integrates sustainability into healthcare: improving lives,\n    protecting the planet, and empowering people through innovation, responsibility, and impact.\n    * [Sustainability][81] [Environment][82]\n      \n      Fresenius Kabi is work"}}, "page_text": "[ [Fresenius Kabi Logo] ][1] Navigation * [ Resource Center ][2] * [ Contact ][3] Global Current website: [ Fresenius Kabi Global Website ][4] Suggested websites based on your location: [ Fresenius Kabi India ][5] ### Fresenius Kabi around the world ### Select Country * Africa & Middle East * [MENA][6] * [South Africa][7] * 