sence. * close * Portfolio * [Main menu][69] [Portfolio][70] Discover Fresenius Kabi's portfolio in Pharma, Nutrition, MedTech and Biopharma. Explore our innovative solutions for improved healthcare results. * [Portfolio][71] [IV Drugs & Infusion Therapy][72] Enhance patient care with Fresenius Kabi’s comprehensive, high-quality IV therapy products for anesthetics, oncology, anti-infectives, and critical care. * [Portfolio][73] [Medical Nutrition][74] Discover Fresenius Kabi’s specialized medical nutrition solutions. Learn more about our products, from parenteral and enteral nutrition to keto analogs. * [Portfolio][75] [MedTech][76] Discover all our advanced medical technologies for nutrition, anesthesia monitoring, cell therapies, blood donation, and safe therapy administration. * [Portfolio][77] [Biopharma][78] We offer affordable, high-quality, effective, and safe biopharmaceuticals for patients with autoimmune diseases and cancer. Learn more at Fresenius Kabi! * close * Sustainability * [Main menu][79] [Sustainability][80] Discover how Fresenius Kabi integrates sustainability into healthcare: improving lives, protecting the planet, and empowering people through innovation, responsibility, and impact. * [Sustainability][81] [Environment][82] Fresenius Kabi is working toward more sustainable healthcare – reducing emissions, saving water, and cutting waste across our global operations. * [Sustainability][83] [People][84] Explore how Fresenius Kabi fosters a safe, inclusive, and empowering workplace: supporting employee development, well-being, and equal opportunities worldwide. * [Sustainability][85] [Community][86] Discover how Fresenius Kabi supports communities through local engagement, health initiatives, and social impact projects that improve lives and foster resilience. * [Sustainability][87] [Quality][88] Learn how Fresenius Kabi ensures product safety and quality through certified systems, risk management, and transparent labeling that support safe, effective patient care. * [Sustainability][89] [Business Ethics][90] Fresenius Kabi stands for integrity, human rights, and ethical business, building trust through transparency, compliance, and responsible global supply chains. * close * Work With Us * [Main menu][91] [Work With Us][92] Learn more about the benefits of being a part of Fresenius Kabi. Why we are the right company for you to get ahead in your job and your development. * [Work With Us][93] [Why Us][94] Develop your career in our global company Fresenius Kabi that is always striving to make a positive impact on the future of global healthcare. * [Work With Us][95] [Your Opportunities][96] Always experience new challenges in the job from entry-level job up to experienced professional. At Fresenius Kabi you will find the right job for you! * [Work With Us][97] [Jobs][98] Find jobs at Fresenius Kabi and apply via the Global Fresenius Career Site. Explore roles worldwide and join a global healthcare company. * close * Media * [Main menu][99] [Media][100] Discover the Fresenius Kabi Newsroom with the latest news and congress announcements. Stay always up to date! * close * Inspiring Stories * [Main menu][101] [Inspiring Stories][102] Take a look behind the scenes. Read about employees, nurses and patients who are redefining courage and compassion in Fresenius Kabi's Inspiring Stories. * close Search X What are you looking for Search ### Quick links * [ ##### Vision ][103] Learn more about our vision * [ ##### Excellence ][104] Learn more about our portfolio * [ ##### Sustainability ][105] Learn all about our Corporate Social Responsibility # We are Committed to Life [More][106] [ ### Vision We strive to transform Fresenius Kabi in the decade to come. We are committed to increase efficiencies in the therapy and care of patients and improve access to high-quality healthcare around the globe. [healthcare professionals in action] ][107] [ ### Excellence We are specialized in lifesaving medicines and technologies for critically and chronically ill patients. With our passion and expertise, we touch the lives of almost 450 million people every year, each one representing the importance of our work. [healthcare professionals in action] ][108] [ ### Sustainability We constantly strive to improve our sustainability footprint. For us, meeting the needs of patients and healthcare professionals goes hand in hand with responsible and ethical management. [nurse taking hand of woman] ][109] [ ### Women Who Shaped Us At Fresenius Kabi, colleagues worldwide share personal stories for International Women’s Day, honoring the women who shaped their courage and purpose. [Images of Fresenius Kabi employees being interviewed on international womens day.] ][110] [ ### Fresenius Kabi recognized as a Top Employer in 13 countries Fresenius Kabi has been certified by Top Employers Institute as a Top Employer for 2026 in 13 countries and additionally two regions. [Image showing the top employer 2026 seals of the 13 countries and 2 regions.] ][111] [ ### Four Colleagues, Four Scientific Journeys: Voices of Women in Science Female scientists from Biopharma, MedTech, Nutrition and Pharma share their stories and advice, showing how science careers impact patient care and innovation. [Image of women in science.] ][112] [ ### Meet The Heroes Behind Patient Safety Unseen heroes ensure patient safety through precision, care, and smart tech at Fresenius Kabi. Discover how people make the difference. [Several people in different job roles like production and lab workers depicted as heroes with capes and gadgets.] ][113] Previous Next Pause Play 1. International Women Day 2. Top Employer 13 Countries 3. Women in science 4. Unseen Patient Safety Heroes ## Explore our latest news * [ Press Release | August 5, 2026 ##### #FutureFresenius: Excellent Q2 performance demonstrates structural step-up – Guidance raised Q2/26 demonstrates Fresenius’ structural transformation, consistently turning operational momentum into earnings growth and delivering the highest capital returns in the decade. [#FutureFresenius hashtag with blue lines on a dark blue background.] ][114] * [ Press Release | May 6, 2026 ##### #FutureFresenius: REJUVENATE in action – Excellent start to the year - demonstrating ##### continued strength and resilient performance; Guidance reconfirmed Q1/26 builds further on strong momentum: Continued operating strength of core businesses with solid topline development and excellent Core EPS growth; FY/26 guidance reconfirmed [#FutureFresenius hashtag with blue lines on a dark blue background.] ][115] * [ Press Release | May 4, 2026 ##### First-in-market: Fresenius Kabi achieves MDR Class III CE certification for blood donation ##### systems, reaffirming its commitment to patient safety Fresenius Kabi has obtained CE certification under the European Medical Device Regulation (EU) 2017/745 (MDR) for its blood donation systems. [Empathy, trust and nurse holding hands with patient for help, consulting support and healthcare advice. Kindness, counseling and medical therapy in nursing home for hope, consultation and psychology.] ][116] [ See all news ][117] #### Special interests ## What are you looking for? ### For patients and relatives [Discover stories from our patients][118] ### For healthcare professionals [Discover our portfolio][119] [Access our resource center][120] #### People & stories ## Making a difference in patients’ lives is what drives us every day Show description Hide description [ [Close-up of a person's arm holding a red stress ball during a blood donation procedure.] Follow a blood donation from collection to transfusion. Learn how safety, quality, and traceability are ensured at every step. ##### The Journey of a Blood Donation MedTech ##### The Journey of a Blood Donation ][121] Show description Hide description [ [Healthcare professional wearing a white uniform and a stethoscope gently holds the hand of a sitting baby on an examination table in a clinical setting, with medical equipment and monitors visible in the background.] Why neonatal and pediatric parenteral nutrition requires dedicated medical scientific development, supporting care from the very first hours of life ##### Not Just Small Adults Medical Nutrition ##### Not Just Small Adults ][122] Show description Hide description [ [Image of Yenna Vandevijver.] How does a long-term career in Regulatory Affairs grow over time? Discover how Yenna Vandevijver developed her role at Fresenius Kabi over 15 years. ##### Growing with Fresenius Kabi: A Career Path in Regulatory Affairs, Quality and Vigilance Employee Story ##### Growing with Fresenius Kabi: A Career Path in Regulatory Affairs, Quality and Vigilance ][123] #### Career ## Start your journey with us [ ### Caring and careers start here Learn more about the benefits of being a part of Fresenius Kabi. Why we are the right company for you", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Fresenius Kabi — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Developing GLP-1 RA biosimilars, owns/markets branded drugs. | Developing GLP-1 RA biosimilars | Germany | Bad Homburg, Germany", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "41", "Y Score": "41", "Overall Score": "41", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Johnson & Johnson", "Website": "https://www.jnj.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "New Brunswick, USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Pharmaceutical; Biotechnology; Medical technologies", "Specialty Focus": "Has GLP-1 RA research programs", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code