 check your domain's market value. ][72] [ WHOIS Lookup [arrow] Find domain ownership and registration details. ][73] [ Logo Design [arrow] Create instant, professional logos in minutes. ][74] Why Atom Atom.com [About Us][75] [Case Studies][76] [Testimonials][77] [Blog][78] Partner With Us [ Distribution Network API [arrow] Share our premium domains with your clients. ][79] [ MCP Server [arrow] Access premium domains, availability checks, and trademark data. ][80] [ White Label Marketplace [arrow] Offer a turnkey branded domain marketplace on your site. ][81] [ Atom Connect [arrow] Learn more about our full partner ecosystem. ][82] # intarcia.com is for sale! [intarcia.com] 9 Strong Buyer Interest Recently viewed or shortlisted by 2+ buyers. [Secure Transactions] Secure Transactions Atom holds your payment until the domain is in your account. Funds are released to the seller only after successful delivery. The transfer is guaranteed. [Fast Domain Transfers] Fast Domain Transfers We manage the transfer process from start to finish. Most domains change hands within hours of purchase, many in under 1 hour. [Flexible Payments] Flexible Payments Enjoy flexible and secure checkout options, including credit card, crypto, wire transfer, and other available payment methods. Options may vary by domain. About intarcia.com hear it Domain name Intarcia.com is a powerful and evocative choice, suggesting innovation, interconnectedness, and forward thinking. The name itself is a fusion of \"integrity\" and \"arc,\" hinting at a journey towards integrity and unity. This short, 8-letter domain is not only easy to remember and spell but also exudes a sense of strength and sophistication. Ideal for tech companies, startups focused on sustainability, or wellness brands, Intarcia.com is a versatile and dynamic name that can help a business stand out in a crowded market. Embrace the future with Intarcia.com. Does intarcia.com fit your brand? Submit Our AI is generating results. This can take 30-40 seconds. ## Make an Offer $ Make an offer. Sellers typically respond to serious ones. Submit Offer [Visa] [Mastercard] [American Express] [Wire Transfer] [Escrow.com] [PayPal] [BitPay] [Amazon Pay] [Apple Pay] ### Buy with Confidence * Ownership verified * Payment protected until transfer is complete * Fast, guided transfer ### Buy with Confidence Ownership verified Payment protected until transfer is complete Fast, guided transfer Purchase Protection Program 100% refund guaranteed if domain can't be transferred. [Learn more][83] Verified Domain Seller ownership has been confirmed. This domain is available and ready to transfer. Need help? Ready to Chat? Replies in 3 Min [ +1 (847) 597-0044 ][84] [ Email Us ][85] Step-by-Step Purchase Guide [Video thumbnail] Domain Details Related Keywords * [Healthtech][86] * [Wellness][87] * [Biotech][88] * [Medical][89] * [Innovation][90] * [Pharmaceuticals][91] * [Research][92] * [Digitalhealth][93] * [Medtech][94] * [Nutrition][95] Domain Characteristics * [Short][96] * [.com][97] * [Made Up][98] Key Emotions or Feelings * [Disrupt, Innovate][99] Root Words * [Tar][100] View more Trusted Worldwide ## Why Buy With Atom? Home of Millions of Premium Domains, High-Quality Curated 100K+ Customers Rated Excellent on Trustpilot 4x Inc. 5000 Fastest-Growing Companies in the US 2025 Trailblazer Award Honored by the Internet Commerce Association Frequently Asked Questions How does intarcia.com get transferred to me? After payment is completed for intarcia.com, we’ll guide you through the best available transfer option based on the domain’s current registrar and extension. For most domains, we’ll seamlessly move the domain to your Atom account. If the domain extension is not yet supported or there is an exception, we can typically assist with either a registrar account push or by providing an authorization (auth) code so you can transfer the domain to your preferred registrar. Does intarcia.com come with Trademark or Business Registration? intarcia.com and other names on Atom Marketplace do not include Trademarks or business registration. This is because Trademarks are unique to the industry (class) as well as country of the business. Since intarcia.com can be purchased by anyone for any use, it would not be possible for us to file a Trademark in advance. We recommend that you do some research and/or seek legal advice to ensure that the name you are interested in does not have a direct Trademark conflict by a competitor in your industry and within your region. If there is no direct conflict, or the existing trademark is unrelated to how you plan to use it, then you have a good chance of being able to trademark the name yourself. If there is an existing trademark, keep in mind that, as long as your business is in a different industry, you may still be able to file a trademark for the name. We also offer a Trademark validation & Filing service which includes upfront Trademark validation and filing the Trademark application on your behalf by a licensed Trademark Attorney. What is your refund policy? Domains purchased on our platform are generally non-refundable. Because domain transfers are typically instant or near-instant, refunds cannot be issued once a domain transfer has been initiated or completed. If a domain has not yet been transferred, a refund may be considered only if all of the following conditions are met: * The refund request is made on the same day as the purchase * The domain transfer has not been initiated (including registrar push or transfer-out) * The domain was purchased with a one-time payment (not installments) If a refund is approved under these conditions, it may be subject to a cancellation fee to cover payment processing costs. Are there any ongoing costs after I purchase the Domain? The purchase price of a domain on our marketplace is a one-time payment. Once the domain is transferred to your account, you will own it. To keep the domain active, you’ll need to renew it each year through your domain registrar. Renewal fees vary by registrar and domain extension. For example, .com domains typically renew for around $10–$20 per year, while other extensions such as .io, .xyz, or .ai may cost more. To avoid accidental expiration, we recommend keeping a valid credit card on file with your registrar and enabling auto-renewal so your domain renews automatically each year. How safe is the purchase process? All domain purchases are backed by our Purchase Protection Guarantee. With over 100,000 customers worldwide, Atom has been featured in the Inc 5000 list of fastest growing companies for 4 consecutive years. We initiate most domain transfers within 1 Business day of purchase. If, for any reason, we are unable to transfer the domain to your ownership, we offer a 100% refund. How does Lease to Own work? Some domains on our marketplace offer Lease to Own plans, allowing you to purchase a domain through smaller monthly payments instead of paying the full amount upfront. You can begin using the domain after your first payment. The domain will remain securely held with Atom until all payments are completed, and our team can assist with any domain setting changes while the Lease to Own plan is active. Once the Lease to Own plan has been paid in full, the domain will be transferred to your ownership. If your plans change, you can cancel the Lease to Own plan at any time. Learn more about how Lease to Own plans work in our detailed guide: [How Lease to Own Works.][101] #### Reject AI logo and assign to Logo Designer We’ll remove the current AI logo and route your", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Intarcia Therapeutics — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Developed a GLP-1 RA implant, owns the asset. | Developed a GLP-1 RA implant (though not marketed yet) | United States | United, States, Its", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "40", "Overall Score": "40", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Kallyope, Inc.", "Website": "https://www.kallyope.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "States, Kallyope, Inc", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Kallyope is researching GLP-1 receptor agonists for metabolic and CNS disorders.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "", "Region Code": "", "Summary": "Kallyope, Inc. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Kallyope is researching GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating development of own assets.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "70", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "kallyope.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "Kallyope Inc.", "domain": "kallyope.com", "founded_year": null, "description": "Kallyope is a New York-based biopharmaceutical company focused on developing innovative medicines for the treatment of migraine. The company leverages unique insights into neural signaling pathways and has a late-stage pipeline led by elismetrep, a first-in-class medication for acute migraine in Phase 3 trials. Founded by world-leading neuroscientists, Kallyope's team combines scientific innovation with drug development experience."}, "business": {"products": [{"name": "Elismetrep", "category": "Investigational drug", "features": ["First-in-class medication for acute treatment of migraine", "Late-stage pipeline (Phase 3)"], "pricing": null}], "services": [], "industries": [], "key_markets": []}, "financials": {"key_numbers": [], "employee_count": null, "scale_signals": []}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": []}, "intel": "Kallyope is a clinical-stage biotech with a promising late-stage asset, elismetrep, in Phase 3 for acute migraine. The company's focus on neural signaling pathways differentiates it in the migraine space. Key milestones to watch are Phase 3 completion and regulatory filings. The NYC location and emphasis on innovation may attract partnerships for commercialization. Given the large migraine patient population, a successful launch could position Kallyope as a major player. Potential investors and partners should monitor trial results and regulatory interactions closely.", "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Kallyope, Inc. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Kallyope is researching GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating development of own assets. | Kallyope is researching GLP-1 receptor agonists for metabolic and CNS disorders. | United States | States, Kallyope, Inc", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "40", "Overall Score": "40", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}, {"Company": "Merck KGaA", "Website": "https://www.merckgroup.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Darmstadt, Germany", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Germany)", "Operational Presence": "Germany", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Has a diabetes care division with GLP-1 products.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Brand", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "DE", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Merck KGaA — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Merck KGaA has a diabetes care division with GLP-1 products, indicating brand ownership.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand", "verify_confidence": "80", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "merckgroup.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "merckgroup.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Redirect\n\nYou have accessed [https://www.emdgroup.com][1], but for users from your part of the world, we\noriginally designed the following web presence [https://www.merckgroup.com][2].\n\n[Let's go][3] Cancel\n\nInternet Explorer is not supported\n\nYou are using an outdated browser. If you would like to use our website, please use Chrome, Firefox,\nSafari or other browser\n\nAccept\n\nShare Disclaimer\n\nBy sharing this content, you are consenting to share your data to this social media provider. More\ninformation are available in our [Privacy Statement][4]. \n\nOK Cancel\n{\"analytics\":\"targeting\"}\n\nCookie Disclaimer\n\nWe use cookies so that we can offer you the best possible website experience. This includes cookies\nwhich are necessary for the operation of the app and the website, as well as other cookies which are\nused solely for anonymous statistical purposes, for more comfortable website settings, or for the\ndisplay of personalized content. You are free to decide in the Cookie Settings which categories you\nwould like to permit. Please note that depending on what you select, the full functionality of the\nwebsite may no longer be available. You may review and change your choices at any time. Further\ninformation can be found in our [Privacy Statement][5].\n\nAccept cookies Accept only Necessary Cookie Settings\n\nCookie Disclaimer\n* Necessary\n  + -\n  \n  These cookies are necessary for the website to operate. Our website cannot function without these\n  cookies and they can only be disabled by changing your browser preferences.\n* 