 * [Introduction][86]\n  * [Life@Wockhardt][87]\n  * [L&D Initiatives][88]\n  * [Voice of Wockhardians][89]\n  * [Career@Wockhardt][90]\n* [Media][91]\n  * [Press Releases][92]\n  * [Wockhardt in Media][93]\n* [ESG][94]\n* [Contact us][95]\n* [banner image][banner image]\n  \n  ## OUR DISCOVERY. ROAD TO RECOVERY.\n  \n  [Know More][96]\n* [banner image][banner image]\n  \n  ## Innovation Wins. Excellence Wins.\n  ## LIFE WINS\n  \n  [Know More][97]\n[\nDemystifying COVID-19 – COVID-19 China Timebomb How to prevent it? (26th Dec 2022)\n][98]\n[\nChairman’s interaction with CNBC-TV18 Halftime Report (23 Feb 2023)\n][99]\n[\nGame Changer Under-Trial Drug WCK-5222 Shows Promise Against Hospital Superbugs CNN News 18 (22 Feb\n2023)\n][100]\n[ View All ][101]\n\n## Chairman's Profile\n\nBeing different and making a difference. That sums up the vision, philosophy, conviction and driving\nforce behind Dr. Habil F Khorakiwala who revels in venturing down the road less travelled.\n\nHe founded Wockhardt in 1967. Today, the Wockhardt Group is India’s leading research-based, global\nhealthcare enterprise with relevance in the fields of Pharmaceuticals, Biotechnology, Active\nPharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs), and Super Speciality Hospitals.\n\n[ Read More ][102]\n\n## Investor Information\n\nOur investors, Wockhardt shareowners, are an important and valued constituent of the Wockhardt\nstakeholder universe.\n\nWhile it is a matter of regulatory compliance, we also consider it as good governance and our duty\nand responsibility, to keep our investors informed and updated regularly about news, event"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to content][1] [[Wockhardt][Wockhardt]][2] Menu * [Home][3] * [About Us][4] * [Chairman’s Profile][5] * [Board Of Directors][6] * [Team Wockhardt][7] * [Corporate Milestones][8] * [Research & Development][9] * [R&D at Wockhardt][10] * [New Drug Discovery][11] * [Pipeline / Projects][12] * [News & Events][13] * [Publications][14] * [ZAYNICH][15] * [MIQNAF][16] * [FOVISCU][17] * [ODRATE][18] * [Biologicals][19] * [News & Events][20] * [Pipeline / Projects][21] * [Publications][22] * [R&D Contact][23] * [Our Manufacturing Units][24] * [Shendra, India][25] * [Biotech Park, India][26] * [Daman, India][27] * [Ankleshwar, India][28] * [Global Footprint][29] * [India][30] * [UK & Europe][31] * [Emerging Markets][32] * [Products][33] * [India Branded Business][34] * [API][35] * [Russia – CIS][36] * [UK][37] * [Irish Market][38] * [Emerging Markets][39] * [Quality Generics][40] * [India MRP Reduction Notification][41] * [Quality Policy][42] * [Investors][43] * [From Chairman’s Office][44] * [AGM Speech][45] * [Letter to Shareowners][46] * [Financials][47] * [Annual Report][48] * [Quarterly Results][49] * [Financial Press Releases][50] * [Related Party Transactions][51] * [Subsidiary Financials][52] * [Annual Return][53] * [Corporate Governance][54] * [Policies & Codes][55] * [Committee’s of the Board][56] * [Familiarisation programs][57] * [Shareholding Pattern][58] * [Secretarial Compliance Report][59] * [Authorised KMP][60] * [Corporate Actions][61] * [Memorandum of Association and Article of Association][62] * [ESOP Scheme][63] * [Disclosures under Regulation 46 of SEBI LODR Regulations][64] * [Announcements / Disclosures][65] * [Shareholders Meeting / Postal ballot][66] * [AGM Notice][67] * [Proceedings][68] * [Voting Results][69] * [Transcript of the AGM][70] * [Postal Ballot Notice][71] * [IEPF][72] * [Unclaimed Dividend][73] * [Nodal Officer][74] * [Analyst/ Investors][75] * [Presentation][76] * [Audio / Video Recording][77] * [Transcript][78] * [Shareowner Services][79] * [FAQ][80] * [Green Initiative][81] * [Investor Contact][82] * [Other Notices][83] * [Credit Rating][84] * [careers][85] * [Introduction][86] * [Life@Wockhardt][87] * [L&D Initiatives][88] * [Voice of Wockhardians][89] * [Career@Wockhardt][90] * [Media][91] * [Press Releases][92] * [Wockhardt in Media][93] * [ESG][94] * [Contact us][95] * [banner image][banner image] ## OUR DISCOVERY. ROAD TO RECOVERY. [Know More][96] * [banner image][banner image] ## Innovation Wins. Excellence Wins. ## LIFE WINS [Know More][97] [ Demystifying COVID-19 – COVID-19 China Timebomb How to prevent it? (26th Dec 2022) ][98] [ Chairman’s interaction with CNBC-TV18 Halftime Report (23 Feb 2023) ][99] [ Game Changer Under-Trial Drug WCK-5222 Shows Promise Against Hospital Superbugs CNN News 18 (22 Feb 2023) ][100] [ View All ][101] ## Chairman's Profile Being different and making a difference. That sums up the vision, philosophy, conviction and driving force behind Dr. Habil F Khorakiwala who revels in venturing down the road less travelled. He founded Wockhardt in 1967. Today, the Wockhardt Group is India’s leading research-based, global healthcare enterprise with relevance in the fields of Pharmaceuticals, Biotechnology, Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs), and Super Speciality Hospitals. [ Read More ][102] ## Investor Information Our investors, Wockhardt shareowners, are an important and valued constituent of the Wockhardt stakeholder universe. While it is a matter of regulatory compliance, we also consider it as good governance and our duty and responsibility, to keep our investors informed and updated regularly about news, events and developments that impact our business and operations. [ View More ][103] ## Investor Focus [ ][104] FINANCIAL RESULTS FY23 Q3 [ ][105] FINANCIAL RESULTS FY23 Q2 [ ][106] FINANCIAL RESULTS FY23 Q1 [ View More ][107] ## About Us Wockhardt is a leading, research-based, global enterprise with relevance in the fields of pharmaceuticals, biotechnology, and healthcare services. Our multinational R&D and manufacturing facilities are spread across India, USA, UK and UAE, and our worldwide marketing presence includes over 30 countries across 6 continents. [ Read More ][108] ## Our Products [latest launches][109] [legacy products][110] latest launches * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][111] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium 5000 I.U./ml (previously known as Multiparin [Know More][112] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][113] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][114] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][115] legacy products * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][116] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium 5000 I.U./ml (previously known as Multiparin [Know More][117] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][118] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][119] * [product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image][product image] ### Heparin Sodium Flushing Solution (previously known as Canusal [Know More][120] ## Media & Press Archives Select Year 202320222018 * [ [download image] ][121] ### [WOCKHARDT’S Q3 FY23 EBITDA GROWTH @37% OVER Q2 FY23][122] 13 February, 2023 * [ [download image] ][123] ### [WOCKHARDT’S Q2 FY23 TOPLINE GROWTH @14% AND EBITDA GROWTH @369% OVER PREVIOUS QUARTER][124] 04 November, 2022 * 1 [2][125] [3][126] [»][127] [View More][128] ## Team Wockhardt Team Wockhardt exhibits a global work culture and mindset in complete alignment with organisational goals and strives to excel, collectively as well as individually. Whole-heartedly adopting the corporate credo of Life Wins, Team Wockhardt has in place a strong leadership team with the bandwidth to ably lead the organisation into the future. [ View More ][129] [ ][130] ## OUR DISCOVERY. ROAD TO RECOVERY. Life threatened globally by rising multidrug-resistant infections or **Antimicrobial Resistance (AMR).** **Zaynich** administered on compassionate grounds and saved over 85 lives from extreme drug resistant infection, has achieved two landmark regulatory approvals from the United States Food and Drug Administration (US FDA) and the Central Drugs Standard Control Organisation (CDSCO). In parallel, the Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA) for ZAYNICH is under review by the European Medicines Agency (EMA). ## Research Wins. Life Wins. [ Know more ][131] ## Our Motto ## Global Reach - ## Our Business [New Drug Discovery][132] [Biologicals in Diabetes][133] [Branded Pharmaceuticals][134] [Vaccines][135] [contract Manufacturing][136] [API ][137] ## Our Product Portfolio Select [India branded business][138] [India Branded Business][139] [API][140] [Russia – CIS][141] [UK][142] [Irish Market][143] [Emerging Markets][144] [Quality Generics][145] ## INVESTOR FOCUS [ ][146] FINANCIAL RESULTS FY27 Q1 [ ][147] FINANCIAL RESULTS FY26 Q4 [ ][148] FINANCIAL RESULTS FY26 Q3 [ View More ][149] [ ][150] Wockhardt Reports PAT of Rs. 107 Cr for Q1 FY27 Maintaining Positive Momentum [ ][151] Wockhardt Reports positive PBT of Rs. 238 Cr for FY 26 [ ][152] Wockhardt reports Positive PBT in Q2FY26 – INR 91 crore [ View More ][153] ## Media Coverage Archives Select Year 2023 2022 2018 * ### [ Superbugs Are Winning. India’s New Antibiotic Discoveries Could Turn The Tide][154] 9 August 2026 * ### [How three stubborn men, and $1.5 billion poured in over two decades, put India on the world’s ### new-drug map][155] 27 July 2026 [View More][156] ## Voice of Wockhardians My journey at Wockhardt began in April 2020, and it has been a transformative experience that has shaped my professional and personal growth. LCS SRI VISHNU AVP and Cluster Head, Sales & Marketing – Diabetes Business At Wockhardt, I’ve found not only a fulfilling career but also a second family. The supportive and nurturing atmosphere cultivated by our Chairman has truly inspired me and my colleagues. VIJAY MHATRE Manager – Finance Working at Wockhardt for over a decade, I’ve had a fulfilling experience, with diverse roles and projects that contributed to personal and professional growth. JAGMOHAN SINGH RISHI Head – Training, SFE & Digital Marketing, Sales Training As the leader of the Drug Regulatory Affairs function for the Pharmaceuticals Business at our company, my primary responsibility is to guide the organization through the regulatory process to ensure successful translation of drug research and development into medicines for patients. ZOHER SIHORWALA Senior Vice President and Head – Drug Regulatory Affairs My ten-year tenure with Wockhardt, a global pioneer in pharmaceuticals and biotechnology, has been a remarkable journey of growth and learning. PRAVIN SAMBREY Country Manager, International Marketing ROW Every day, I am part of a zero ego team that’s pushing the boundaries of science to develop new antibiotics that can save lives. DR. VINOD AHIRRAO Senior Group Leader - Analytical Chemistry, Drug Discovery Research Relocating from Delhi to Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar was initially challenging, but the welcoming environment and supportive colleagues made the transition seamless. AISHWARIA V NAIR Senior Research Associate - Project Management, Biotech R&D One of the things I appreciate most about working at Wockhardt is the passion of every team member for top-quality scientific work. The team at Wockhardt is prodigious— every person is willing to help each other and celebrate successes together. RAJESH CHAVAN Senior Group Leader - Pharmacology, Drug Discovery Research Every day, I am inspired by the privilege of working alongside a team of seasoned and unwaveringly dedicated scientists. SNEHAL PALWE Senior Research Scientist - Microbiology, Drug Discovery Research The collaborative environment, continuous learning opportunities, and the chance to work on cutting-edge technology and digital atomization have truly enhanced my professional growth. PRADEEP MISHRA Manager - Information Technology I find the work culture at Wockhardt warm and professional, people are very friendly and supportive. Everyone seems to be working to their highest standards, which creates a nice, effective and organized environment. DR. MOHAMMAD USMAN SHAIKH Group Leader - Chemistry, Drug Discovery Research The most important aspect of Wockhardt is the exceptional leadership under whose guidance the scientific team's efforts", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Wockhardt — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Wockhardt has a presence in the Indian diabetes market and offers GLP-1 receptor agonists, indicating it markets these products. | Wockhardt has a presence in the Indian diabetes market and offers GLP-1 receptor agonists. | India | Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", "role_description": "Brand"}}, "X Score": "40", "Y Score": "40", "Overall Score": "40", "Industry Category": "Healthcare / Pharmaceutical", "Quadrant": "Emerging Players"}], "rejected_final": [{"company": "SPIMACO", "reason": "No evidence of owning or marketing a GLP-1 brand; summary is speculative."}, {"company": "Daiichi Sankyo Company, Limited", "reason": "No confirmed GLP-1 product or pipeline; summary is vague."}, {"company": "Astellas Pharma Inc.", "reason": "No confirmed GLP-1 product; summary is speculative."}, {"company": "Mitsubishi Tanabe Pharma Corporati